window.OrleansData.register("content/c0184.json",{"7b1af948e61bbce2":{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2","title":"Cluster manifest retrieval","titleZh":"集群清单检索","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/cluster-manifest-retrieval/","sourceHash":"7c414db651b5ede4f28d32da8e2516fa3786358de4051d6b4a0b9aeb65405295","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Cluster manifest retrieval</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">集群清单检索</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Each silo publishes an immutable grain manifest describing its grain types, interfaces, and properties. The cluster manifest provider assembles these manifests into the metadata used for type resolution and version-aware placement.</p>","zh":"<p>每个 Silo 都会发布一份不可变的 Grain 清单，描述其 Grain 类型、接口和属性。集群清单提供程序汇总这些清单，形成用于类型解析和感知版本的放置决策的元数据。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-2","type":"heading","anchor":"membership-and-publication","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"membership-and-publication\">Membership and publication</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"membership-and-publication\">成员管理与发布</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Cluster manifests have a major version corresponding to the membership version and a minor version which advances as manifests arrive. When membership advances, the provider synchronously prunes non-active silos and includes the local silo when it is active. Local grain metadata also remains available while the local silo is starting.</p>","zh":"<p>集群清单具有与成员版本对应的主版本号，以及随着清单到达而递增的次版本号。当成员版本前进时，提供程序会同步移除非活动 Silo，并在本地 Silo 处于活动状态时将其纳入其中。本地 Silo 启动期间，本地 Grain 元数据也保持可用。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The provider retrieves missing active silos’ manifests and publishes successful results. Unsuccessful fetches are retried after five seconds or when a newer membership snapshot arrives. Cancellation reaches the remote call and stops local waiting.</p>","zh":"<p>提供程序获取尚未取得的活动 Silo 清单，并发布成功获取的结果。获取失败时，会在 5 秒后或收到更新的成员快照时重试。取消会传递到远程调用，并停止本地等待。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-5","type":"heading","anchor":"content-addressed-retrieval","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"content-addressed-retrieval\">Content-addressed retrieval</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"content-addressed-retrieval\">按内容寻址的获取</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.clustermanifestoptions/properties/\">EnableContentAddressedRetrieval</a> defaults to <code>true</code>, enabling hash-based retrieval and peer repair. Set it to <code>false</code> in <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.clustermanifestoptions/\">ClusterManifestOptions</a> to request each missing active silo’s manifest directly. Configure the option through the silo builder before starting the silo. The provider captures the value at construction; a restart applies configuration changes.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.clustermanifestoptions/properties/\">EnableContentAddressedRetrieval</a> 默认为 <code>true</code> ，启用基于哈希的获取和对等节点修复。在 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.clustermanifestoptions/\">ClusterManifestOptions</a> 中将其设为 <code>false</code> ，即可直接向各个尚未取得清单的活动 Silo 请求其清单。应在启动 Silo 之前，通过 Silo 构建器配置此选项。提供程序在构造时捕获该值；配置变更需重启后才能生效。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>With this option enabled, the provider asks each missing silo for the content hash of its local manifest. A matching entry in the local hash cache supplies the manifest immediately. Otherwise, the provider requests the manifest by hash, verifies its content, and adds it to the cache.</p>","zh":"<p>启用此选项时，提供程序会向每个尚未取得清单的 Silo 请求其本地清单的内容哈希。如果本地哈希缓存中存在匹配条目，就立即使用该条目提供清单。否则，提供程序会按哈希请求清单，验证其内容，然后将其加入缓存。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Hashes use incremental SHA-256 over a fixed canonical traversal: an encoding version, sorted grain entries, then sorted interface entries. Each section and property collection starts with its count. Identifiers have a byte-length prefix; property keys and values have UTF-16 code-unit-length prefixes. A length of <code>-1</code> represents null or a default identifier, while <code>0</code> represents an empty value. Counts and lengths are signed 32-bit big-endian integers, and UTF-16 code units are written in big-endian order. This layout preserves exact identifier bytes and string contents, including invalid UTF-16, and gives equivalent content the same hash regardless of dictionary insertion order. Hashes of immutable manifest instances are memoized with weak keys, allowing the manifests to be collected when their owners release them.</p>","zh":"<p>哈希采用增量 SHA-256，按照固定的规范顺序遍历：先是编码版本，然后是排序后的 Grain 条目，最后是排序后的接口条目。每一节和每个属性集合都以其数量开头。标识符带有字节长度前缀；属性键和值带有 UTF-16 码元长度前缀。长度 <code>-1</code> 表示 null 或默认标识符， <code>0</code> 表示空值。计数和长度均为有符号 32 位大端整数，UTF-16 码元也按大端顺序写入。此布局精确保留标识符字节和字符串内容，包括无效的 UTF-16，并确保等价内容得到相同的哈希，不受字典插入顺序影响。不可变清单实例的哈希通过弱键记忆化缓存，因此，所有者释放清单后，清单仍可被垃圾回收。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Each publication creates a fresh cache containing its live manifests and local metadata. In-flight retrievals retain their original cache instance. A stale retrieval can populate that instance, while newer publications retain their own cache. The provider exposes the new manifest version before its new cache. Retrievals capture the cache before checking the version, so an older update which captures the newer cache also observes that its membership snapshot has been superseded.</p>","zh":"<p>每次发布都会创建新的缓存，其中包含当前存活的清单和本地元数据。正在进行的获取操作仍持有其原始缓存实例。过时的获取操作可以填充该实例，而较新的发布保留各自的缓存。提供程序先公开新的清单版本，再公开新的缓存。获取操作先捕获缓存，再检查版本，因此，较旧的更新如果捕获了较新的缓存，也会观察到自己的成员快照已被取代。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-10","type":"heading","anchor":"peer-repair-and-bounded-waiting","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"peer-repair-and-bounded-waiting\">Peer repair and bounded waiting</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"peer-repair-and-bounded-waiting\">对等节点修复与有界等待</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>When more than one active silo’s manifest is missing, the enabled provider also probes up to three peers selected from a rotating ordered membership list. Direct retrieval starts alongside these probes.</p>","zh":"<p>当缺少多个活动 Silo 的清单时，启用此功能的提供程序还会从轮换的有序成员列表中选择至多 3 个对等节点进行探测。直接获取与这些探测同时启动。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Each probe has a one-second deadline shared by its hash-summary and manifest-update requests. Cached hashes can satisfy missing entries directly; otherwise the provider requests a complete update from the peer and verifies each candidate against the summary’s hash. Successfully repaired entries are published immediately, including partial repairs. Direct requests for those entries are removed from the required completion set, allowing the remaining successful fetches to advance the manifest independently.</p>","zh":"<p>每次探测具有 1 秒的截止时限，由其哈希摘要请求和清单更新请求共用。已缓存的哈希可以直接满足缺失条目的需要；否则，提供程序会向对等节点请求完整更新，并依据摘要中的哈希验证每个候选项。成功修复的条目会立即发布，包括仅部分修复成功的情况。这些条目对应的直接请求会从必须完成的集合中移除，使其余成功获取的结果能够独立推进清单。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-13","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>When direct retrieval supplies every missing manifest first, the provider cancels the optional peer attempts and publishes the direct results immediately. The successful direct path therefore completes independently of a slow peer-summary request.</p>","zh":"<p>当直接获取率先提供了所有缺失清单时，提供程序会取消可选的对等节点尝试，并立即发布直接获取的结果。因此，成功的直接路径可以独立完成，不受缓慢的对等节点摘要请求影响。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The provider admits at most three concurrent local probe attempts. Completion, timeout, and caller cancellation release the attempt’s slot immediately, allowing later retries to proceed. The one-second deadline cancels the request token and ends local waiting; Orleans signals cancellation to the peer using the ordinary RPC path. Direct retrieval continues alongside these attempts. Late responses leave the completed attempt’s result unchanged, and late failures are observed and logged. Retry selection rotates through active peers, with retries paced by the five-second delay or a newer membership snapshot.</p>","zh":"<p>提供程序最多接纳 3 个并发的本地探测尝试。完成、超时和调用方取消都会立即释放该尝试占用的名额，使后续重试能够继续。1 秒截止时限到达时，会取消请求令牌并结束本地等待；Orleans 通过普通 RPC 路径向对等节点发送取消信号。直接获取与这些尝试并行进行。迟到的响应不会改变已完成尝试的结果，迟到的失败则会被观测并记录日志。重试选择会在活动对等节点之间轮换，重试节奏由 5 秒延迟或更新的成员快照控制。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-15","type":"heading","anchor":"compatibility-rollout-and-rollback","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"compatibility-rollout-and-rollback\">Compatibility, rollout, and rollback</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"compatibility-rollout-and-rollback\">兼容性、逐步部署与回滚</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Silos serve hash requests on demand, including when they are configured for direct retrieval. Providers using the default content-addressed mode compute and reuse content hashes as manifests become available.</p>","zh":"<p>Silo 会按需处理哈希请求，包括配置为直接获取的 Silo。使用默认内容寻址模式的提供程序会在清单可用时计算并复用内容哈希。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>During a rolling deployment, enabled silos try hash retrieval and fall back to the established direct RPC when a peer rejects the newer method or its hash request fails. An invalid or unavailable hash-addressed body also triggers direct retrieval. Independent remote cancellation follows that compatibility path; cancellation of the local request propagates to the caller. Peer-repair failures leave direct retrieval responsible for filling the missing entries.</p>","zh":"<p>在滚动部署期间，启用该功能的 Silo 会尝试按哈希获取；如果对等节点拒绝较新的方法，或者哈希请求失败，则回退到既有的直接 RPC。按哈希寻址的内容主体无效或不可用时，也会触发直接获取。远程端独立发起的取消遵循这一兼容路径；本地请求的取消则传播给调用方。对等节点修复失败后，仍由直接获取负责补齐缺失条目。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Upgraded silos adopt content-addressed retrieval at startup while existing silos continue using their deployed implementation. Unsupported hash requests can produce transient exception logs and extra requests during the upgrade; successful direct fallback supplies the required metadata. Individual silo-manifest RPCs retain the configured system response timeout, while optional peer-summary/update attempts have a one-second deadline.</p>","zh":"<p>升级后的 Silo 在启动时采用按内容寻址的获取，而现有 Silo 继续使用已部署的实现。升级期间，不受支持的哈希请求可能产生临时异常日志和额外请求；成功的直接回退会提供所需的元数据。各个 Silo 清单 RPC 仍使用配置的系统响应超时时间，而可选的对等节点摘要／更新尝试则具有 1 秒的截止时限。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-19","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Observe manifest retrieval and peer-probe diagnostics during joins and restarts. Debug logs distinguish hash fallback, peer timeout, occupied probe slots, and late failures. Warnings identify failed direct fetches. To select direct retrieval, set the option to <code>false</code> and restart the affected silos; they continue answering enabled peers’ hash requests on demand.</p>","zh":"<p>在加入集群和重启期间，观察清单获取和对等节点探测的诊断信息。调试日志会区分哈希回退、对等节点超时、探测名额被占用，以及迟到的失败。警告日志标识直接获取失败。若要选择直接获取，将选项设为 <code>false</code> 并重启受影响的 Silo；它们仍会按需响应启用了该功能的对等节点发出的哈希请求。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-20","type":"heading","anchor":"measuring-retrieval","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"measuring-retrieval\">Measuring retrieval</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"measuring-retrieval\">衡量获取行为</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-21","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The <code>Microsoft.Orleans</code> meter exposes <a href=\"#/docs/host/monitoring/metrics-catalog/::cluster-manifests\">manifest retrieval instruments</a>. Compare a canary with silos using direct retrieval during equivalent joins and restarts:</p>","zh":"<p><code>Microsoft.Orleans</code> meter 公开 <a href=\"#/docs/host/monitoring/metrics-catalog/::cluster-manifests\"> 清单获取度量仪表 </a> 。在等价的加入集群和重启场景下，将金丝雀实例与使用直接获取的 Silo 进行比较：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-22","type":"table","en":"<table><thead><tr><th>Signal</th><th>Interpretation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>orleans-manifest-cache-lookups</code>, split by <code>result</code> and <code>source</code></td><td>The hit fraction shows how often known content satisfies direct hash requests or peer-summary lookups.</td></tr><tr><td><code>orleans-manifest-fallbacks</code>, split by <code>reason</code></td><td>Counts hash retrievals which proceed through the direct RPC after an error, missing body, or content mismatch.</td></tr><tr><td><code>orleans-manifest-peer-probes</code>, split by <code>status</code></td><td>Shows completed local attempts, timeouts, cancellation, errors, and admission skips. Cancellation also includes optional probes superseded by successful direct retrieval.</td></tr><tr><td><code>orleans-manifest-peer-repairs</code></td><td>Counts missing silo entries supplied by successfully published peer repairs. Repeated summaries contribute each repaired entry once per publication.</td></tr><tr><td><code>orleans-manifest-retrieval-duration</code>, split by <code>mode</code> and <code>status</code></td><td>Measures each local silo-manifest retrieval in milliseconds, including cache lookup, fallback, and terminal cancellation or failure.</td></tr></tbody></table>","zh":"<table><thead><tr><th>信号</th><th>含义</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>orleans-manifest-cache-lookups</code> ，按 <code>result</code> 和 <code>source</code> 拆分</td><td>命中比例表明，已有内容能够满足直接哈希请求或对等节点摘要查找的频率。</td></tr><tr><td><code>orleans-manifest-fallbacks</code> ，按 <code>reason</code> 拆分</td><td>统计因错误、缺少内容主体或内容不匹配而转入直接 RPC 的哈希获取次数。</td></tr><tr><td><code>orleans-manifest-peer-probes</code> ，按 <code>status</code> 拆分</td><td>显示已完成的本地尝试、超时、取消、错误，以及因接纳限制而跳过的尝试。取消也包括因直接获取成功而被取代的可选探测。</td></tr><tr><td><code>orleans-manifest-peer-repairs</code></td><td>统计通过成功发布的对等节点修复补齐的缺失 Silo 条目。对于重复摘要，每个修复条目在每次发布中仅计数一次。</td></tr><tr><td><code>orleans-manifest-retrieval-duration</code> ，按 <code>mode</code> 和 <code>status</code> 拆分</td><td>以毫秒为单位衡量每次本地 Silo 清单获取，包括缓存查找、回退，以及最终取消或失败。</td></tr></tbody></table>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-23","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Attributes use fixed categories, keeping time-series cardinality stable across silo restarts. The direct mode records retrieval duration while the hash and peer counters reflect content-addressed retrieval activity. Use these metrics alongside serialized message sizes and silo CPU/memory to evaluate the benefit for the service’s manifest sizes and mix of application versions.</p>","zh":"<p>属性使用固定类别，使时间序列基数在 Silo 重启前后保持稳定。直接模式记录获取耗时，而哈希计数器和对等节点计数器反映按内容寻址的获取活动。将这些指标与序列化消息大小以及 Silo 的 CPU／内存使用情况结合起来，评估该机制对于服务的清单大小和应用版本组合所带来的收益。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7b1af948e61bbce2-24","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>See <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/cluster-management/\">cluster membership</a> for membership transitions and <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/rolling-version-skew/\">rolling version skew</a> for how manifest metadata drives interface-version selection.</p>","zh":"<p>成员状态转换参见 <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/cluster-management/\"> 集群成员管理 </a> ；清单元数据如何驱动接口版本选择，参见 <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/rolling-version-skew/\"> 滚动升级中的版本差异 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"e75ec04d9609457e":{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e","title":"Grain directory architecture","titleZh":"Grain 目录架构","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/grain-directory/","sourceHash":"88eaf9bbcf24616a6a79de4946ef755a911358d3883aed87c029cf6fae614716","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Grain directory architecture</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Grain 目录架构</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The grain directory maps a grain identity to an activation address. It is on the critical path when a caller has no usable cached address and when the runtime creates, moves, or removes an activation. Placement chooses a silo; the directory coordinates which activation address is authoritative.</p>","zh":"<p>Grain 目录将 Grain 身份映射到激活实例地址。当调用方没有可用的缓存地址，以及运行时创建、移动或移除激活实例时，目录都处于关键路径上。放置机制选择 Silo；目录则协调哪个激活实例地址具有权威性。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans uses <code>DistributedGrainDirectory</code> by default, with versioned range ownership and coordinated membership-view transitions. Select <code>LegacyGrainDirectory</code> with <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.corehostingextensions/methods/\">UseLegacyGrainDirectory</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 默认使用 <code>DistributedGrainDirectory</code> ，它具有带版本的范围所有权，并协调成员视图转换。可以使用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.corehostingextensions/methods/\">UseLegacyGrainDirectory</a> 选择 <code>LegacyGrainDirectory</code> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-3","type":"heading","anchor":"legacygraindirectory-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"legacygraindirectory-\"><code>LegacyGrainDirectory</code> <span id=\"overview-and-architecture\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"legacygraindirectory-\"><code>LegacyGrainDirectory</code> <span id=\"overview-and-architecture\"></span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><code>LegacyGrainDirectory</code> partitions registrations over the membership ring. Hashing a grain identity selects the silo whose legacy directory partition is authoritative for that key. This follows the broad consistent-hashing distributed-hash-table model described by <a href=\"https://pdos.csail.mit.edu/papers/chord:sigcomm01/chord_sigcomm.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Chord</a>, adapted to Orleans membership and activation semantics. Each silo also keeps non-authoritative cache entries to avoid repeated remote lookups.</p>","zh":"<p><code>LegacyGrainDirectory</code> 在成员环上对注册信息进行分区。对 Grain 身份进行哈希计算，可以选出相应 Silo，由该 Silo 的旧版目录分区权威地管理此键。这遵循 <a href=\"https://pdos.csail.mit.edu/papers/chord:sigcomm01/chord_sigcomm.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Chord </a> 所描述的一致性哈希分布式哈希表的一般模型，并针对 Orleans 的成员管理和激活语义进行了调整。每个 Silo 还会保存非权威缓存条目，以避免重复的远程查找。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-5","type":"diagram","en":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"3f03a84625cfa7ba56441ce7ff7e74a41cef94ec809d76ad461d33bc1feb85d5\" data-diagram-language=\"en\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rendering diagram…\">Rendering diagram…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>Original Mermaid source</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart LR\n    Caller[Calling silo]\n    Cache[Local address cache]\n    Ring[Membership hash ring]\n    Owner[Owning LegacyGrainDirectory]\n    Partition[Legacy directory partition]\n    Activation[Target activation]\n\n    Caller --&gt; Cache\n    Cache --&gt;|miss or invalid| Ring\n    Ring --&gt; Owner\n    Owner --&gt; Partition\n    Partition --&gt;|activation address| Caller\n    Caller --&gt; Activation</code></pre></details></figure>","zh":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"3f03a84625cfa7ba56441ce7ff7e74a41cef94ec809d76ad461d33bc1feb85d5\" data-diagram-language=\"zh\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正在绘制图表…\">正在绘制图表…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看原始 Mermaid 图表代码</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart LR\n    Caller[Calling silo]\n    Cache[Local address cache]\n    Ring[Membership hash ring]\n    Owner[Owning LegacyGrainDirectory]\n    Partition[Legacy directory partition]\n    Activation[Target activation]\n\n    Caller --&gt; Cache\n    Cache --&gt;|miss or invalid| Ring\n    Ring --&gt; Owner\n    Owner --&gt; Partition\n    Partition --&gt;|activation address| Caller\n    Caller --&gt; Activation</code></pre></details></figure>","diagram":"3f03a84625cfa7ba56441ce7ff7e74a41cef94ec809d76ad461d33bc1feb85d5","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The legacy directory preserves these invariants:</p>","zh":"<p>旧版目录保持以下不变量：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-7","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>a directory key is derived from the grain identity, not its current location;</li>\n<li>the membership view determines the authoritative owner;</li>\n<li>local cache entries are hints and can be invalidated;</li>\n<li>registration detects competing single-activation addresses;</li>\n<li>a failed or deactivated silo’s addresses are removed or rejected; and</li>\n<li>partition ownership transfers as the membership ring changes.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>目录键由 Grain 身份派生，而非由其当前位置派生；</li>\n<li>成员视图决定权威所有者；</li>\n<li>本地缓存条目仅作为提示，可以失效；</li>\n<li>注册操作会检测单激活实例地址之间的竞争；</li>\n<li>发生故障或已停用的 Silo 的地址会被移除或拒绝；以及</li>\n<li>分区所有权随着成员环的变化而转移。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Message forwarding and invalidation repair stale caches. Forwarding is bounded and is not an application-level retry policy.</p>","zh":"<p>消息转发和失效处理会修复陈旧缓存。转发次数有界，并不构成应用层的重试策略。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/GrainDirectory/LocalGrainDirectory.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Legacy directory implementation</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/GrainDirectory/LocalGrainDirectoryPartition.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">legacy partition implementation</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>源码： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/GrainDirectory/LocalGrainDirectory.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 旧版目录实现 </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/GrainDirectory/LocalGrainDirectoryPartition.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 旧版分区实现 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-10","type":"heading","anchor":"directory-selection","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"directory-selection\">Directory selection</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"directory-selection\">目录选择</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The runtime resolves a directory per grain type. The unnamed default resolves to <code>DistributedGrainDirectory</code> unless the silo has explicitly replaced it. A named implementation of <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.graindirectory.igraindirectory/\">IGrainDirectory</a> can be registered and selected using grain-type metadata.</p>","zh":"<p>运行时按 Grain 类型解析目录。未命名的默认目录会解析为 <code>DistributedGrainDirectory</code> ，除非 Silo 已显式替换它。可以注册带名称的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.graindirectory.igraindirectory/\">IGrainDirectory</a> 实现，并通过 Grain 类型元数据选择它。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Custom directories own their consistency, availability, and cleanup behavior. They should define what concurrent registration means, how failed silos are removed, and whether stale reads are possible. The surrounding message router cannot turn an eventually consistent custom directory into a strongly consistent one.</p>","zh":"<p>自定义目录负责自身的一致性、可用性和清理行为。它们应明确并发注册的含义、如何移除失效 Silo，以及是否可能读取到陈旧数据。外围的消息路由器无法将最终一致的自定义目录变成强一致目录。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-13","type":"heading","anchor":"default-distributedgraindirectory-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"default-distributedgraindirectory-\">Default: <code>DistributedGrainDirectory</code> <span id=\"distributed-grain-directory\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"default-distributedgraindirectory-\">默认目录： <code>DistributedGrainDirectory</code> <span id=\"distributed-grain-directory\"> </span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The default directory is view-synchronous, with versioned range ownership and coordinated membership-view transitions. <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.corehostingextensions/methods/\">CoreHostingExtensions.AddDistributedGrainDirectory</a> selects it explicitly or registers a named alias. Aliases share one directory instance and one lifecycle participant per silo.</p>","zh":"<p>默认目录具有视图同步性，采用带版本的范围所有权，并协调成员视图转换。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.corehostingextensions/methods/\">CoreHostingExtensions.AddDistributedGrainDirectory</a> 可显式选择该目录，或注册带名称的别名。在每个 Silo 中，所有别名共享一个目录实例和一个生命周期参与者。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The implementation divides the hash ring into configurable ranges, analogous to the virtual-node partitioning described by <a href=\"https://www.allthingsdistributed.com/files/amazon-dynamo-sosp2007.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dynamo</a>. <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions/properties/\">GrainDirectoryOptions.PartitionsPerSilo</a> defaults to <strong>1</strong>. A partition normally serves requests locally. During a membership view change, old and new owners coordinate range locks, snapshots, and ownership transfer. The design applies the <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/publication/virtually-synchronous-methodology-for-dynamic-service-replication/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">virtually synchronous methodology for dynamic service replication</a> and has similarities to <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/publication/vertical-paxos-and-primary-backup-replication/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Vertical Paxos and primary-backup replication</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>该实现将哈希环划分为可配置的范围，类似于 <a href=\"https://www.allthingsdistributed.com/files/amazon-dynamo-sosp2007.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Dynamo </a> 所描述的虚拟节点分区。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions/properties/\">GrainDirectoryOptions.PartitionsPerSilo</a> 默认为 <strong> 1 </strong> 。分区通常在本地处理请求。成员视图变更期间，旧所有者和新所有者会协调范围锁、快照和所有权转移。该设计采用 <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/publication/virtually-synchronous-methodology-for-dynamic-service-replication/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 用于动态服务复制的虚拟同步方法 </a> ，并与 <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/publication/vertical-paxos-and-primary-backup-replication/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Vertical Paxos 和主备复制 </a> 有相似之处。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-16","type":"diagram","en":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"fd1c0a068424f9396a9617dfa2bb085496560847e160963bacecdd4cf18d9381\" data-diagram-language=\"en\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rendering diagram…\">Rendering diagram…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>Original Mermaid source</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Old as Previous range owner\n    participant New as New range owner\n    participant Clients as Directory callers\n\n    Old-&gt;&gt;Old: Seal range for new view\n    Clients-&gt;&gt;Old: Request with view number\n    Old--&gt;&gt;Clients: Synchronize or retry in newer view\n    New-&gt;&gt;Old: Request range snapshot\n    Old--&gt;&gt;New: Registrations and version\n    New-&gt;&gt;New: Install snapshot and open range\n    New--&gt;&gt;Old: Transfer complete\n    Old-&gt;&gt;Old: Delete transferred snapshot</code></pre></details></figure>","zh":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"fd1c0a068424f9396a9617dfa2bb085496560847e160963bacecdd4cf18d9381\" data-diagram-language=\"zh\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正在绘制图表…\">正在绘制图表…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看原始 Mermaid 图表代码</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Old as Previous range owner\n    participant New as New range owner\n    participant Clients as Directory callers\n\n    Old-&gt;&gt;Old: Seal range for new view\n    Clients-&gt;&gt;Old: Request with view number\n    Old--&gt;&gt;Clients: Synchronize or retry in newer view\n    New-&gt;&gt;Old: Request range snapshot\n    Old--&gt;&gt;New: Registrations and version\n    New-&gt;&gt;New: Install snapshot and open range\n    New--&gt;&gt;Old: Transfer complete\n    Old-&gt;&gt;Old: Delete transferred snapshot</code></pre></details></figure>","diagram":"fd1c0a068424f9396a9617dfa2bb085496560847e160963bacecdd4cf18d9381","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Requests and responses carry view information. A range cannot serve a request under an incompatible ownership view. If an orderly transfer is impossible, the new owner recovers registrations by querying active silos rather than assuming the failed owner’s state.</p>","zh":"<p>请求和响应都携带视图信息。范围不能在不兼容的所有权视图下处理请求。如果无法有序转移，新所有者会通过查询活动 Silo 来恢复注册信息，而不是假定失效所有者的状态。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>API: <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.corehostingextensions/methods/\">CoreHostingExtensions.AddDistributedGrainDirectory</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions/\">GrainDirectoryOptions</a>. Implementation: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Hosting/CoreHostingExtensions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">hosting registration</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/GrainDirectory/DistributedGrainDirectory.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>DistributedGrainDirectory</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>API： <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.corehostingextensions/methods/\">CoreHostingExtensions.AddDistributedGrainDirectory</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions/\">GrainDirectoryOptions</a> 。实现： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Hosting/CoreHostingExtensions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 宿主注册 </a> 以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/GrainDirectory/DistributedGrainDirectory.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>DistributedGrainDirectory</code> </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-19","type":"heading","anchor":"tradeoffs","level":2,"en":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"view-change-procedure\"></span><span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"recovery-process\"></span><span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"partitioning-strategy\"></span><h2 id=\"tradeoffs\">Tradeoffs</h2>","zh":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"view-change-procedure\"></span><span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"recovery-process\"></span><span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"partitioning-strategy\"></span><h2 id=\"tradeoffs\">权衡</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-20","type":"table","en":"<table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th><code>LegacyGrainDirectory</code></th><th>Default <code>DistributedGrainDirectory</code></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Selection</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.corehostingextensions/methods/\">CoreHostingExtensions.UseLegacyGrainDirectory</a></td><td>Runtime default</td></tr><tr><td>Ownership</td><td>Membership consistent-hash ring</td><td>Versioned ranges over membership views</td></tr><tr><td>Normal lookup</td><td>Owner partition plus per-silo cache</td><td>Owner partition plus view coordination</td></tr><tr><td>View change</td><td>Partition split/merge and cache repair</td><td>Sealed ranges and snapshot transfer</td></tr><tr><td>Recovery emphasis</td><td>Duplicate detection and invalidation</td><td>Explicit range recovery</td></tr><tr><td>Configuration</td><td>Explicit directory selection</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions/properties/\">GrainDirectoryOptions.PartitionsPerSilo</a>, default 1</td></tr></tbody></table>","zh":"<table><thead><tr><th>属性</th><th><code>LegacyGrainDirectory</code></th><th>默认的 <code>DistributedGrainDirectory</code></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>选择方式</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.corehostingextensions/methods/\">CoreHostingExtensions.UseLegacyGrainDirectory</a></td><td>运行时默认值</td></tr><tr><td>所有权</td><td>基于成员的一致性哈希环</td><td>成员视图上的带版本范围</td></tr><tr><td>常规查找</td><td>所有者分区加每个 Silo 的缓存</td><td>所有者分区加视图协调</td></tr><tr><td>视图变更</td><td>分区拆分／合并和缓存修复</td><td>范围封存和快照转移</td></tr><tr><td>恢复重点</td><td>重复检测和失效处理</td><td>显式范围恢复</td></tr><tr><td>配置</td><td>显式目录选择</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions/properties/\">GrainDirectoryOptions.PartitionsPerSilo</a> ，默认值为 1</td></tr></tbody></table>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-21","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>More partitions can improve ownership granularity but increase transfer and coordination work. Production rollouts should include compatibility, failure, and load testing.</p>","zh":"<p>增加分区数可以细化所有权粒度，但也会增加转移和协调工作。生产环境的逐步部署应包括兼容性、故障和负载测试。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e75ec04d9609457e-22","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For directory changes during a version upgrade, follow <a href=\"#/docs/migration/grain-directory/::legacy-to-distributed-directory-upgrade\">Grain directory migration</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>有关版本升级期间的目录变更，请遵循 <a href=\"#/docs/migration/grain-directory/::legacy-to-distributed-directory-upgrade\"> Grain 目录迁移 </a> 中的说明。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"843f6fe8e0b61215":{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215","title":"Placement and activation balancing","titleZh":"放置与激活实例均衡","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/load-balancing/","sourceHash":"e9095359cf528ad29c9e0ae8e6617386b9938ed30ef9f48ecbb009cd9f2724f5","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Placement and activation balancing</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">放置与激活实例均衡</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Placement chooses a silo when Orleans needs a new activation. Balancing can later move existing activations. Those are separate decisions with different information and costs.</p>","zh":"<p>当 Orleans 需要新的激活实例时，由放置机制选择 Silo。均衡机制则可以在之后移动已有激活实例。这是两个独立的决策，所需信息和成本各不相同。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The default placement strategy is <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.resourceoptimizedplacement/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacement</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>默认放置策略为 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.resourceoptimizedplacement/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacement</a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For the application and operational view of scale-out, scale-in, persistence, and configuration, see <a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-placement/\">Grain placement and migration</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>有关横向扩容、缩容、持久化和配置的应用与运维视角，参见 <a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-placement/\"> Grain 放置与迁移 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-4","type":"heading","anchor":"resource-optimized-placement","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"resource-optimized-placement\">Resource-optimized placement</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"resource-optimized-placement\">资源优化放置</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><code>ResourceOptimizedPlacementDirector</code> receives cluster-wide <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.runtime.siloruntimestatistics/\">SiloRuntimeStatistics</a> from <code>DeploymentLoadPublisher</code>. It excludes incompatible and overloaded silos, applies a <a href=\"https://www.eecs.harvard.edu/~michaelm/postscripts/handbook2001.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">power-of-multiple-choices load-balancing strategy</a> by sampling approximately the square root of the available candidates, normalizes their signals, adds jitter to avoid deterministic herding, and selects the lowest utilization score.</p>","zh":"<p><code>ResourceOptimizedPlacementDirector</code> 从 <code>DeploymentLoadPublisher</code> 接收整个集群的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.runtime.siloruntimestatistics/\">SiloRuntimeStatistics</a> 。它会排除不兼容和过载的 Silo，应用 <a href=\"https://www.eecs.harvard.edu/~michaelm/postscripts/handbook2001.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 多选取优负载均衡策略 </a> ，从可用候选节点中抽样，样本数量约为候选节点数的平方根；随后归一化其信号，加入随机扰动以避免确定性选择导致的集中涌入，并选择利用率评分最低的节点。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-6","type":"diagram","en":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"9676b88d3a60b09cedcf3f349bd23447c80cb41431089944aa26dc2c98c0e6cd\" data-diagram-language=\"en\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rendering diagram…\">Rendering diagram…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>Original Mermaid source</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart LR\n    Stats[SiloRuntimeStatistics]\n    Publisher[DeploymentLoadPublisher]\n    Director[ResourceOptimizedPlacementDirector]\n    Candidates[Compatible, non-overloaded silos]\n    Score[Weighted normalized score]\n    Target[Selected silo]\n\n    Stats --&gt; Publisher\n    Publisher --&gt; Director\n    Candidates --&gt; Director\n    Director --&gt; Score\n    Score --&gt; Target</code></pre></details></figure>","zh":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"9676b88d3a60b09cedcf3f349bd23447c80cb41431089944aa26dc2c98c0e6cd\" data-diagram-language=\"zh\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正在绘制图表…\">正在绘制图表…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看原始 Mermaid 图表代码</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart LR\n    Stats[SiloRuntimeStatistics]\n    Publisher[DeploymentLoadPublisher]\n    Director[ResourceOptimizedPlacementDirector]\n    Candidates[Compatible, non-overloaded silos]\n    Score[Weighted normalized score]\n    Target[Selected silo]\n\n    Stats --&gt; Publisher\n    Publisher --&gt; Director\n    Candidates --&gt; Director\n    Director --&gt; Score\n    Score --&gt; Target</code></pre></details></figure>","diagram":"9676b88d3a60b09cedcf3f349bd23447c80cb41431089944aa26dc2c98c0e6cd","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The default relative weights are:</p>","zh":"<p>默认相对权重如下：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-8","type":"table","en":"<table><thead><tr><th>Signal</th><th>Weight</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.resourceoptimizedplacementoptions/properties/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacementOptions.CpuUsageWeight</a></td><td>40</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.resourceoptimizedplacementoptions/properties/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacementOptions.MemoryUsageWeight</a></td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.resourceoptimizedplacementoptions/properties/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacementOptions.AvailableMemoryWeight</a></td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.resourceoptimizedplacementoptions/properties/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacementOptions.MaxAvailableMemoryWeight</a></td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.resourceoptimizedplacementoptions/properties/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacementOptions.ActivationCountWeight</a></td><td>15</td></tr></tbody></table>","zh":"<table><thead><tr><th>信号</th><th>权重</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.resourceoptimizedplacementoptions/properties/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacementOptions.CpuUsageWeight</a></td><td>40</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.resourceoptimizedplacementoptions/properties/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacementOptions.MemoryUsageWeight</a></td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.resourceoptimizedplacementoptions/properties/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacementOptions.AvailableMemoryWeight</a></td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.resourceoptimizedplacementoptions/properties/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacementOptions.MaxAvailableMemoryWeight</a></td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.resourceoptimizedplacementoptions/properties/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacementOptions.ActivationCountWeight</a></td><td>15</td></tr></tbody></table>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.resourceoptimizedplacementoptions/properties/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacementOptions.LocalSiloPreferenceMargin</a> defaults to 5. If the local silo’s score is within that margin of the best candidate, placement can preserve locality. Before usable statistics are available, the director selects a compatible silo.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.resourceoptimizedplacementoptions/properties/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacementOptions.LocalSiloPreferenceMargin</a> 默认为 5。如果本地 Silo 的评分与最佳候选节点的差距在该范围内，放置机制可以保持局部性。在可用统计信息就绪之前，放置决策器会选择一个兼容的 Silo。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Public options: <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.resourceoptimizedplacementoptions/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacementOptions</a>. Implementation: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Placement/ResourceOptimizedPlacementDirector.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>ResourceOptimizedPlacementDirector</code></a> and the default registration in <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Hosting/DefaultSiloServices.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>DefaultSiloServices</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>公共选项： <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.resourceoptimizedplacementoptions/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacementOptions</a> 。实现： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Placement/ResourceOptimizedPlacementDirector.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>ResourceOptimizedPlacementDirector</code> </a> ，以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Hosting/DefaultSiloServices.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>DefaultSiloServices</code> </a> 中的默认注册。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Enabling <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">LoadSheddingEnabled</a> sets the <code>IsOverloaded</code> statistic when either its CPU or memory threshold is exceeded. When non-overloaded compatible silos have published statistics, resource-optimized placement scores that set using CPU, memory, capacity, and activation-count measurements. When every compatible silo is overloaded or lacks current statistics, placement selects a compatible silo so activation can proceed.</p>","zh":"<p>启用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">LoadSheddingEnabled</a> 后，只要 CPU 或内存任一阈值被超过，就会设置 <code>IsOverloaded</code> 统计值。当未过载且兼容的 Silo 已发布统计信息时，资源优化放置会根据 CPU、内存、容量和激活实例数量对这一集合评分。如果所有兼容 Silo 都已过载或缺少当前统计信息，放置机制仍会选择一个兼容 Silo，使激活能够继续。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-12","type":"heading","anchor":"load-shedding","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"load-shedding\">Load shedding</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"load-shedding\">负载削减</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-13","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Set <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">LoadSheddingEnabled</a> to <code>true</code> to activate load shedding. <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">CpuThreshold</a> defaults to 95 percent and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">MemoryThreshold</a> defaults to 90 percent. Client-gateway request rejection evaluates both thresholds. Stream providers which use <code>LoadShedQueueFlowController</code> evaluate CPU usage against a limit derived from <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">CpuThreshold</a> and pause queue reads at that limit. Crossing either configured threshold marks the silo’s published runtime statistics as overloaded, and resource-optimized placement favors compatible silos with non-overloaded statistics.</p>","zh":"<p>将 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">LoadSheddingEnabled</a> 设为 <code>true</code> 可启用负载削减。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">CpuThreshold</a> 默认为 95%， <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">MemoryThreshold</a> 默认为 90%。客户端网关拒绝请求时会评估这两个阈值。使用 <code>LoadShedQueueFlowController</code> 的流提供程序会将 CPU 使用率与从 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">CpuThreshold</a> 派生的限制值进行比较，并在达到该限制时暂停队列读取。超过任一配置阈值，都会将 Silo 发布的运行时统计信息标记为过载；资源优化放置会优先选择统计信息显示未过载的兼容 Silo。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Use load shedding as one layer of admission control alongside bounded work and deadlines. Use a hosting-platform autoscaler to create capacity, activation rebalancing or repartitioning to move eligible activations, and <a href=\"#/docs/host/configuration-guide/activation-collection/::enable-memory-based-activation-shedding\">memory-based activation shedding</a> to deactivate activations under memory pressure.</p>","zh":"<p>将负载削减作为接纳控制的一层，并结合有界工作量和截止时限使用。通过宿主平台的自动缩放器增加容量，通过激活实例再平衡或重新分区移动符合条件的激活实例，并通过 <a href=\"#/docs/host/configuration-guide/activation-collection/::enable-memory-based-activation-shedding\"> 基于内存的激活实例削减 </a> 在内存压力下停用激活实例。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-15","type":"heading","anchor":"placement-resolution-and-extension","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"placement-resolution-and-extension\">Placement resolution and extension</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"placement-resolution-and-extension\">放置解析与扩展</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.placement.placementstrategyresolver/\">PlacementStrategyResolver</a> selects a grain-specific strategy when one is declared; otherwise it uses the default. <code>PlacementService</code> applies placement filters before calling the strategy’s keyed <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.runtime.placement.iplacementdirector/\">IPlacementDirector</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>如果声明了特定于 Grain 的策略， <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.placement.placementstrategyresolver/\">PlacementStrategyResolver</a> 就会选择它；否则使用默认策略。 <code>PlacementService</code> 在调用该策略按键注册的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.runtime.placement.iplacementdirector/\">IPlacementDirector</a> 之前，先应用放置筛选器。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>A custom strategy consists of:</p>","zh":"<p>自定义策略由以下部分组成：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-18","type":"list","en":"<ol>\n<li>an <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.placementstrategy/\">PlacementStrategy</a> value associated with the grain type;</li>\n<li>an <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.runtime.placement.iplacementdirector/\">IPlacementDirector</a> which chooses from compatible silos; and</li>\n<li>registration through <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.placementstrategyextensions/methods/\">PlacementStrategyExtensions.AddPlacementDirector</a>.</li>\n</ol>","zh":"<ol>\n<li>与 Grain 类型关联的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.placementstrategy/\">PlacementStrategy</a> 值；</li>\n<li>从兼容 Silo 中作出选择的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.runtime.placement.iplacementdirector/\">IPlacementDirector</a> ；以及</li>\n<li>通过 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.placementstrategyextensions/methods/\">PlacementStrategyExtensions.AddPlacementDirector</a> 完成的注册。</li>\n</ol>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-19","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Placement filters are orthogonal constraints. They can remove candidates based on metadata or another policy before the director scores them. A director should use the candidates supplied by the placement context instead of reconstructing cluster membership.</p>","zh":"<p>放置筛选器是正交约束。它们可以在放置决策器评分之前，根据元数据或其他策略移除候选节点。放置决策器应使用放置上下文提供的候选节点，而不是自行重建集群成员信息。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-20","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>API: <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.placement.placementstrategyresolver/\">PlacementStrategyResolver</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.placementstrategyextensions/methods/\">PlacementStrategyExtensions.AddPlacementDirector</a>. Implementation: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Placement/PlacementService.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>PlacementService</code></a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Placement/PlacementStrategyResolver.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">strategy resolution</a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Hosting/PlacementStrategyExtensions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">registration extensions</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>API： <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.placement.placementstrategyresolver/\">PlacementStrategyResolver</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.placementstrategyextensions/methods/\">PlacementStrategyExtensions.AddPlacementDirector</a> 。实现： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Placement/PlacementService.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>PlacementService</code> </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Placement/PlacementStrategyResolver.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 策略解析 </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Hosting/PlacementStrategyExtensions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 注册扩展 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-21","type":"heading","anchor":"balancing-long-lived-activations","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"balancing-long-lived-activations\">Balancing long-lived activations</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"balancing-long-lived-activations\">均衡长期存活的激活实例</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-22","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Resource-optimized placement only affects new activations. Long-lived activations can become unbalanced after:</p>","zh":"<p>资源优化放置仅影响新激活实例。发生以下情况后，长期存活的激活实例可能出现分布失衡：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-23","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>a silo joins or leaves;</li>\n<li>traffic changes while the activation remains alive;</li>\n<li>activation memory use diverges;</li>\n<li>a placement constraint changes the candidate set; or</li>\n<li>communicating grains are spread across silos.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>Silo 加入或离开；</li>\n<li>激活实例仍存活时，流量发生变化；</li>\n<li>激活实例的内存使用量出现差异；</li>\n<li>放置约束改变了候选集合；或者</li>\n<li>相互通信的 Grain 分布在不同 Silo 上。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-24","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Moving an activation has a cost: dehydrate and rehydrate work, directory updates, cold caches, and a temporary interruption. Orleans therefore exposes opt-in protocols rather than continuously moving every activation.</p>","zh":"<p>移动激活实例存在成本：状态提取与恢复、目录更新、冷缓存，以及短暂中断。因此，Orleans 提供需要主动启用的协议，而不是持续移动每一个激活实例。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-25","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Valid activations continue running on their current silos across membership changes. A joining silo receives activations through later creation or opt-in migration. During graceful shutdown, ordinary activations on the departing silo deactivate; later calls create replacements on remaining compatible silos.</p>","zh":"<p>成员变更期间，有效激活实例会继续在其当前 Silo 上运行。新加入的 Silo 通过后续创建或主动启用的迁移获得激活实例。在优雅关闭期间，正在离开的 Silo 上的普通激活实例会停用；之后的调用会在其余兼容 Silo 上创建替代实例。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-26","type":"heading","anchor":"activation-rebalancer","level":2,"en":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"experimental-activation-rebalancer\"></span><h2 id=\"activation-rebalancer\">Activation rebalancer</h2>","zh":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"experimental-activation-rebalancer\"></span><h2 id=\"activation-rebalancer\">激活实例再平衡器</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-27","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.activationrebalancerextensions/methods/\">ActivationRebalancerExtensions.AddActivationRebalancer</a> enables the resource rebalancer. A worker observes cluster statistics in sessions, estimates imbalance using entropy, and asks source silos to migrate random activations toward underloaded silos. A monitor can wake or relocate the worker after failure.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.activationrebalancerextensions/methods/\">ActivationRebalancerExtensions.AddActivationRebalancer</a> 启用资源再平衡器。工作实例在会话中观察集群统计信息，使用熵估算不均衡程度，并请求源 Silo 将随机选择的激活实例迁移至负载较低的 Silo。发生故障后，监测器可以唤醒或重新安置工作实例。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-28","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The protocol optimizes distribution of activation count and memory use. The activation repartitioner complements it by optimizing the communication graph and cross-silo hot paths.</p>","zh":"<p>该协议优化激活实例数量和内存使用量的分布。激活实例重新分区器则通过优化通信图和跨 Silo 的热点路径对其进行补充。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-29","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The most operationally significant <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrebalanceroptions/\">ActivationRebalancerOptions</a> are:</p>","zh":"<p>运维影响最显著的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrebalanceroptions/\">ActivationRebalancerOptions</a> 如下：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-30","type":"table","en":"<table><thead><tr><th>Option</th><th>Default</th><th>Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrebalanceroptions/properties/\">RebalancerDueTime</a></td><td>60 seconds</td><td>Delay before the first balancing session.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrebalanceroptions/properties/\">SessionCyclePeriod</a></td><td>15 seconds</td><td>Time between cycles in a session. It must be at least twice the deployment-statistics refresh period.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrebalanceroptions/properties/\">MaxStagnantCycles</a></td><td>3</td><td>Stop a session after consecutive cycles whose improvement remains below the entropy quantum.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrebalanceroptions/properties/\">ActivationMigrationCountLimit</a></td><td><code>int.MaxValue</code></td><td>Maximum requested migrations per cycle. Set a finite initial limit to bound churn while evaluating the feature.</td></tr></tbody></table>","zh":"<table><thead><tr><th>选项</th><th>默认值</th><th>效果</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrebalanceroptions/properties/\">RebalancerDueTime</a></td><td>60 秒</td><td>首次均衡会话开始前的延迟。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrebalanceroptions/properties/\">SessionCyclePeriod</a></td><td>15 秒</td><td>会话内各周期之间的时间间隔。它必须至少是部署统计信息刷新周期的两倍。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrebalanceroptions/properties/\">MaxStagnantCycles</a></td><td>3</td><td>连续多个周期的改善幅度均低于熵增量阈值时，停止会话。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrebalanceroptions/properties/\">ActivationMigrationCountLimit</a></td><td><code>int.MaxValue</code></td><td>每个周期请求迁移的最大数量。评估该功能时，初始应设置一个有限上限，以限制频繁变动。</td></tr></tbody></table>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-31","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The entropy quantum, allowed deviation, and cycle and silo weights control convergence and migration rate. Keep their defaults until representative measurements justify a change. Resolve <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.placement.rebalancing.iactivationrebalancer/\">IActivationRebalancer</a> from silo services to suspend or resume sessions, request a <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.placement.rebalancing.rebalancingreport/\">RebalancingReport</a>, or subscribe to reports. Reports contain an approximate cluster imbalance and per-silo acquired and dispersed activation counts. Also observe migration rate, activation latency, state-transfer failures, memory, and cross-silo calls.</p>","zh":"<p>熵增量阈值、允许的偏差，以及周期权重和 Silo 权重共同控制收敛和迁移速率。在具有代表性的测量结果支持调整之前，应保留默认值。从 Silo 服务中解析 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.placement.rebalancing.iactivationrebalancer/\">IActivationRebalancer</a> ，可以暂停或恢复会话、请求 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.placement.rebalancing.rebalancingreport/\">RebalancingReport</a> ，或订阅报告。报告包含近似的集群不均衡程度，以及每个 Silo 接收和迁出的激活实例数量。还应观察迁移速率、激活延迟、状态转移失败、内存和跨 Silo 调用。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-32","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Implementation: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Placement/Rebalancing/ActivationRebalancerWorker.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>ActivationRebalancerWorker</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>实现： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Placement/Rebalancing/ActivationRebalancerWorker.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>ActivationRebalancerWorker</code> </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-33","type":"heading","anchor":"activation-repartitioner","level":2,"en":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"experimental-activation-repartitioner\"></span><h2 id=\"activation-repartitioner\">Activation repartitioner</h2>","zh":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"experimental-activation-repartitioner\"></span><h2 id=\"activation-repartitioner\">激活实例重新分区器</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-34","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.activationrepartitioningextensions/methods/\">ActivationRepartitioningExtensions.AddActivationRepartitioner</a> enables communication-aware repartitioning. The repartitioner samples fully addressed request messages and constructs a weighted graph:</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.activationrepartitioningextensions/methods/\">ActivationRepartitioningExtensions.AddActivationRepartitioner</a> 启用感知通信的重新分区。重新分区器对已完整确定地址的请求消息进行采样，并构建加权图：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-35","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>vertices represent migratable activations;</li>\n<li>edge weights represent observed calls;</li>\n<li>anchored or non-migratable grains constrain possible moves.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>顶点表示可迁移的激活实例；</li>\n<li>边的权重表示已观察到的调用；</li>\n<li>已锚定或不可迁移的 Grain 限制可行的移动。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-36","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Periodically, peer repartitioners exchange graph information and negotiate activation moves which improve locality while respecting an imbalance-tolerance rule. The default <code>RebalancerCompatibleRule</code> can incorporate the resource rebalancer’s cluster-imbalance report.</p>","zh":"<p>各对等重新分区器定期交换图信息，并协商激活实例移动方案，在遵守不均衡容忍规则的同时改善局部性。默认的 <code>RebalancerCompatibleRule</code> 可以纳入资源再平衡器的集群不均衡报告。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-37","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The most operationally significant <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrepartitioneroptions/\">ActivationRepartitionerOptions</a> are:</p>","zh":"<p>运维影响最显著的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrepartitioneroptions/\">ActivationRepartitionerOptions</a> 如下：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-38","type":"table","en":"<table><thead><tr><th>Option</th><th>Default</th><th>Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrepartitioneroptions/properties/\">MaxEdgeCount</a></td><td>10,000</td><td>Bounds the probabilistic top communication edges retained for a round.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrepartitioneroptions/properties/\">MaxUnprocessedEdges</a></td><td>100,000</td><td>Bounds the pending edge buffer; the oldest entries are discarded when full.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrepartitioneroptions/properties/\">MinRoundPeriod</a> / <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrepartitioneroptions/properties/\">MaxRoundPeriod</a></td><td>1 / 2 minutes</td><td>Defines the randomized interval between rounds.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrepartitioneroptions/properties/\">RecoveryPeriod</a></td><td>1 minute</td><td>Prevents a silo from immediately entering another round.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrepartitioneroptions/properties/\">AnchoringFilterEnabled</a></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>Reduces graph size by probabilistically collapsing well-partitioned local vertices.</td></tr></tbody></table>","zh":"<table><thead><tr><th>选项</th><th>默认值</th><th>效果</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrepartitioneroptions/properties/\">MaxEdgeCount</a></td><td>10,000</td><td>限制每轮以概率方式保留的高频通信边数量。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrepartitioneroptions/properties/\">MaxUnprocessedEdges</a></td><td>100,000</td><td>限制待处理边缓冲区的大小；缓冲区满时，丢弃最旧的条目。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrepartitioneroptions/properties/\">MinRoundPeriod</a> / <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrepartitioneroptions/properties/\">MaxRoundPeriod</a></td><td>1 分钟 / 2 分钟</td><td>定义轮次之间的随机间隔。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrepartitioneroptions/properties/\">RecoveryPeriod</a></td><td>1 分钟</td><td>防止 Silo 立即进入下一轮。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.activationrepartitioneroptions/properties/\">AnchoringFilterEnabled</a></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>通过以概率方式合并已合理分区的本地顶点来减小图的规模。</td></tr></tbody></table>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-39","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Larger edge and buffer limits improve the chance of retaining useful communication data but consume more memory. Shorter round and recovery periods react faster but increase coordination and migration churn. For large clusters, allow enough time for round exchanges; the options guidance recommends adding approximately 10 seconds per anticipated silo to the maximum round period. Evaluate effectiveness using cross-silo call volume and latency together with migration rate and repartitioner logs.</p>","zh":"<p>增大边数和缓冲区上限可以提高保留有用通信数据的概率，但会消耗更多内存。缩短轮次间隔和恢复期可以更快响应，但会增加协调和迁移变动。对于大型集群，应为每轮交换预留足够时间；选项指导建议，预计每增加一个 Silo，就在最大轮次间隔上增加约 10 秒。应结合跨 Silo 调用量、延迟、迁移速率和重新分区器日志来评估效果。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-40","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Implementation: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Placement/Repartitioning/ActivationRepartitioner.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>ActivationRepartitioner</code></a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Placement/Repartitioning/RepartitionerMessageFilter.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>RepartitionerMessageFilter</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>实现： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Placement/Repartitioning/ActivationRepartitioner.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>ActivationRepartitioner</code> </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Placement/Repartitioning/RepartitionerMessageFilter.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>RepartitionerMessageFilter</code> </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-41","type":"heading","anchor":"choosing-the-mechanism","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"choosing-the-mechanism\">Choosing the mechanism</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"choosing-the-mechanism\">选择机制</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-42","type":"table","en":"<table><thead><tr><th>Mechanism</th><th>When it acts</th><th>Primary signal</th><th>Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Resource-optimized placement</td><td>Activation creation</td><td>CPU, memory, capacity, activation count</td><td>Places the new activation</td></tr><tr><td>Activation rebalancer</td><td>Opt-in balancing sessions</td><td>Cluster resource imbalance</td><td>Random eligible activations</td></tr><tr><td>Activation repartitioner</td><td>Opt-in exchange rounds</td><td>Grain call graph and tolerance rule</td><td>Communication-aware activations</td></tr><tr><td>Load shedding</td><td>CPU or memory threshold exceeded</td><td>Local CPU and memory use</td><td>Rejects gateway requests, controls stream queue reads using CPU, and marks the silo overloaded</td></tr></tbody></table>","zh":"<table><thead><tr><th>机制</th><th>生效时机</th><th>主要信号</th><th>效果</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>资源优化放置</td><td>创建激活实例时</td><td>CPU、内存、容量、激活实例数量</td><td>放置新的激活实例</td></tr><tr><td>激活实例再平衡器</td><td>主动启用的均衡会话</td><td>集群资源不均衡</td><td>随机选择的符合条件的激活实例</td></tr><tr><td>激活实例重新分区器</td><td>主动启用的交换轮次</td><td>Grain 调用图和容忍规则</td><td>根据通信情况选择的激活实例</td></tr><tr><td>负载削减</td><td>超过 CPU 或内存阈值时</td><td>本地 CPU 和内存使用情况</td><td>拒绝网关请求、根据 CPU 使用率控制流队列读取，并将 Silo 标记为过载</td></tr></tbody></table>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"843f6fe8e0b61215-43","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Resource-optimized placement is the default and is usually the first mechanism to tune. Add the activation rebalancer for persistent count or memory skew and the repartitioner for call-locality problems after measuring the workload. Enable load shedding for overload protection. The movement protocols use <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/activation-lifecycle/\">activation migration</a>. Apply capacity planning, admission control, and deployment health monitoring alongside these runtime mechanisms. Operational guidance belongs in the <a href=\"#/docs/deployment/\">deployment section</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>资源优化放置是默认机制，通常也是首先需要调优的机制。测量工作负载后，如果激活实例数量或内存分布持续偏斜，可添加激活实例再平衡器；如果存在调用局部性问题，可添加重新分区器。启用负载削减以提供过载保护。移动协议使用 <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/activation-lifecycle/\"> 激活实例迁移 </a> 。应在采用这些运行时机制的同时，进行容量规划、接纳控制和部署健康监测。运维指导见 <a href=\"#/docs/deployment/\"> 部署一节 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"a4af1c81e68aed58":{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58","title":"Messaging pipeline and delivery semantics","titleZh":"消息传递管线与投递语义","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/messaging-delivery-guarantees/","sourceHash":"14e3f6ff21d71c1cf43784cd5494b888a994da02ecc0858bb6f9afdcb9545922","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Messaging pipeline and delivery semantics</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">消息传递管线与投递语义</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>An Orleans call is an asynchronous request-response exchange. Generated code, routing, the grain directory, activation scheduling, and callbacks all participate. The API resembles a local method call, but failures retain distributed-system ambiguity.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 调用是一次异步请求—响应交换。生成的代码、路由、Grain 目录、激活实例调度和回调都会参与其中。API 看起来像本地方法调用，但失败仍然具有分布式系统中的结果不确定性。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-2","type":"heading","anchor":"request-and-response-pipeline","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"request-and-response-pipeline\">Request and response pipeline</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"request-and-response-pipeline\">请求与响应管道</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-3","type":"diagram","en":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"186d5bd02991dada3724138c9b25d9dff058b8747644c7fc4636005aa4d2f154\" data-diagram-language=\"en\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rendering diagram…\">Rendering diagram…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>Original Mermaid source</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App as Caller\n    participant Proxy as Generated proxy\n    participant Out as Runtime client\n    participant Net as MessageCenter\n    participant Act as Target activation\n\n    App-&gt;&gt;Proxy: Invoke method\n    Proxy-&gt;&gt;Out: Generated invokable\n    Out-&gt;&gt;Out: Outgoing filters and callback\n    Out-&gt;&gt;Net: Address and send request\n    Net-&gt;&gt;Net: Resolve, route, or forward\n    Net-&gt;&gt;Act: Queue request\n    Act-&gt;&gt;Act: Incoming filters and grain turn\n    Act--&gt;&gt;Net: Response or rejection\n    Net--&gt;&gt;Out: Correlate callback\n    Out--&gt;&gt;App: Complete Task</code></pre></details></figure>","zh":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"186d5bd02991dada3724138c9b25d9dff058b8747644c7fc4636005aa4d2f154\" data-diagram-language=\"zh\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正在绘制图表…\">正在绘制图表…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看原始 Mermaid 图表代码</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App as Caller\n    participant Proxy as Generated proxy\n    participant Out as Runtime client\n    participant Net as MessageCenter\n    participant Act as Target activation\n\n    App-&gt;&gt;Proxy: Invoke method\n    Proxy-&gt;&gt;Out: Generated invokable\n    Out-&gt;&gt;Out: Outgoing filters and callback\n    Out-&gt;&gt;Net: Address and send request\n    Net-&gt;&gt;Net: Resolve, route, or forward\n    Net-&gt;&gt;Act: Queue request\n    Act-&gt;&gt;Act: Incoming filters and grain turn\n    Act--&gt;&gt;Net: Response or rejection\n    Net--&gt;&gt;Out: Correlate callback\n    Out--&gt;&gt;App: Complete Task</code></pre></details></figure>","diagram":"186d5bd02991dada3724138c9b25d9dff058b8747644c7fc4636005aa4d2f154","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The source generator emits a proxy and an invokable request type. <code>GrainReferenceRuntime</code> runs outgoing call filters and submits the request through <code>IRuntimeClient</code>. <code>MessageFactory</code> creates the message and correlation identity. <code>MessageCenter</code> resolves the activation address and selects a local dispatch, silo connection, or client gateway. On the target, <code>InsideRuntimeClient</code> runs incoming filters and invokes the generated method dispatcher.</p>","zh":"<p>源代码生成器生成代理和可调用请求类型。 <code>GrainReferenceRuntime</code> 执行传出调用筛选器，并通过 <code>IRuntimeClient</code> 提交请求。 <code>MessageFactory</code> 创建消息和关联身份。 <code>MessageCenter</code> 解析激活实例地址，并选择本地派发、Silo 连接或客户端网关。在目标端， <code>InsideRuntimeClient</code> 执行传入筛选器，并调用生成的方法派发器。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Runtime/GrainReferenceRuntime.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>GrainReferenceRuntime</code></a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Messaging/MessageFactory.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>MessageFactory</code></a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Messaging/MessageCenter.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>MessageCenter</code></a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Core/InsideRuntimeClient.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>InsideRuntimeClient</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>源码： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Runtime/GrainReferenceRuntime.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>GrainReferenceRuntime</code> </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Messaging/MessageFactory.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>MessageFactory</code> </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Messaging/MessageCenter.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>MessageCenter</code> </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Core/InsideRuntimeClient.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>InsideRuntimeClient</code> </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-6","type":"heading","anchor":"address-repair-and-dispatch-boundaries","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"address-repair-and-dispatch-boundaries\">Address repair and dispatch boundaries</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"address-repair-and-dispatch-boundaries\">地址修复与派发边界</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The target grain address is a routing hint whose validity <code>Catalog</code> and <code>ActivationData</code> confirm before dispatch. <code>MessageCenter</code> checks for a local delivery, a proxied client, a usable remote connection, and a known-dead target. At the target, <code>Catalog</code> and <code>ActivationData</code> validate the grain address and interface version before admitting the request. A stale activation can therefore be invalidated and the request forwarded or rerouted while preserving its logical message identity.</p>","zh":"<p>目标 Grain 地址是一个路由提示，其有效性由 <code>Catalog</code> 和 <code>ActivationData</code> 在派发前确认。 <code>MessageCenter</code> 检查本地投递、被代理的客户端、可用远程连接以及已知失效的目标。在目标端， <code>Catalog</code> 和 <code>ActivationData</code> 会在接纳请求之前验证 Grain 地址和接口版本。因此，过期的激活实例地址可以被标记为无效，而请求在保留其逻辑消息身份的同时被转发或重新路由。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The dispatch boundary is also where shutdown policy applies. When application messages are blocked, responses and membership traffic remain eligible while new application requests are rejected or dropped. This lets the lifecycle protocol drain while the stopping silo admits responses and membership traffic and rejects new application work.</p>","zh":"<p>派发边界也是应用关闭策略的位置。当应用消息被阻止时，响应和成员管理流量仍然可以通过，而新的应用请求会被拒绝或丢弃。这让生命周期协议能够完成排空：正在停止的 Silo 继续接收响应和成员管理流量，同时拒绝新的应用工作。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-9","type":"heading","anchor":"routing-repair-is-not-call-retry","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"routing-repair-is-not-call-retry\">Routing repair is not call retry</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"routing-repair-is-not-call-retry\">路由修复不等于调用重试</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>A message can encounter a stale activation address because an activation deactivated, moved, or its silo failed. The runtime can reject, invalidate, forward, or reroute that same logical request while locating the current activation. Forwarding is bounded by silo messaging options.</p>","zh":"<p>激活实例被停用、迁移或其 Silo 发生故障，都可能使消息遇到过期的激活实例地址。运行时在定位当前激活实例的过程中，可以拒绝、使地址失效、转发或重新路由同一个逻辑请求。转发次数受 Silo 消息选项限制。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>This internal address repair must not be confused with retrying an application call after its response timeout. Orleans does <strong>not</strong> automatically resubmit a call because the caller’s response timer elapsed.</p>","zh":"<p>这种内部地址修复，不应与响应超时后重试应用调用混淆。Orleans <strong> 不会 </strong> 因为调用方的响应计时器到期就自动重新提交调用。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Transport code can also retry a failed socket send. That repairs a transport attempt using the same message identity; it is not a new application invocation policy.</p>","zh":"<p>传输代码也可能重试失败的套接字发送。它使用相同的消息身份修复一次传输尝试，并不是新的应用调用策略。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-13","type":"heading","anchor":"response-timeout-means-unknown-outcome","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"response-timeout-means-unknown-outcome\">Response timeout means unknown outcome</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"response-timeout-means-unknown-outcome\">响应超时表示结果未知</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/properties/\">MessagingOptions.ResponseTimeout</a> defaults to 30 seconds, or 30 minutes when a debugger is attached. <code>CallbackData</code> completes the caller with <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.timeoutexception\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TimeoutException</a> when no response reaches the callback in time.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/properties/\">MessagingOptions.ResponseTimeout</a> 的默认值为 30 秒；附加调试器时为 30 分钟。如果响应未能及时到达回调， <code>CallbackData</code> 会使调用方以 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.timeoutexception\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> TimeoutException </a> 结束。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>At that point, any of these can be true:</p>","zh":"<p>此时，以下任一情况都可能成立：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-16","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>the request never reached the target;</li>\n<li>the request is queued but has not started;</li>\n<li>the grain method is still running;</li>\n<li>the grain method completed and its response was lost or delayed; or</li>\n<li>a response will arrive after the callback has already been removed.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>请求从未到达目标；</li>\n<li>请求已经排队，但尚未开始；</li>\n<li>Grain 方法仍在运行；</li>\n<li>Grain 方法已经完成，但其响应丢失或延迟；或者</li>\n<li>响应将在回调已经移除之后才到达。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The timeout therefore reports an <strong>unknown outcome</strong>, not a failed execution. By default, <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/properties/\">MessagingOptions.CancelRequestOnTimeout</a> is <code>false</code>. Enabling cancellation requests cooperative cancellation; it still cannot prove that no side effect occurred.</p>","zh":"<p>因此，超时报告的是 <strong> 结果未知 </strong> ，而不是执行失败。默认情况下， <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/properties/\">MessagingOptions.CancelRequestOnTimeout</a> 为 <code>false</code> 。启用取消会请求协作式取消，但仍然不能证明没有发生任何副作用。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>API: <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/\">MessagingOptions</a>. Implementation: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Configuration/Options/MessagingOptions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">messaging options</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Runtime/CallbackData.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>CallbackData</code></a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/test/Orleans.Runtime.Internal.Tests/TimeoutTests.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>TimeoutTests</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>API： <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/\">MessagingOptions</a> 。实现： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Configuration/Options/MessagingOptions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 消息选项 </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Runtime/CallbackData.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>CallbackData</code> </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/test/Orleans.Runtime.Internal.Tests/TimeoutTests.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>TimeoutTests</code> </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-19","type":"heading","anchor":"delivery-model","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"delivery-model\">Delivery model</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"delivery-model\">投递模型</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-20","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Without an application retry, Orleans submits one logical request and does not intentionally invoke it again after a response timeout. This is commonly described as <strong>at-most-once delivery</strong>. It is not a durable exactly-once transaction:</p>","zh":"<p>如果应用没有重试，Orleans 会提交一个逻辑请求，并且不会在响应超时后有意再次执行它。这通常称为 <strong> 至多一次投递 </strong> 。它不是持久化的恰好一次事务：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-21","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>a caller cannot distinguish non-delivery from completed execution after a timeout;</li>\n<li>a process crash can erase volatile duplicate-tracking and callback state;</li>\n<li>side effects can commit even when the response is not observed; and</li>\n<li>one-way messages provide no completion result.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>超时后，调用方无法区分未投递与已经执行完成；</li>\n<li>进程崩溃可能清除易失性的重复跟踪状态和回调状态；</li>\n<li>即使未观察到响应，副作用也可能已经提交；并且</li>\n<li>单向消息不提供完成结果。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-22","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>If application code retries a timed-out call, both attempts can execute. Orleans does not durably deduplicate arbitrary requests. Retried operations should be naturally idempotent or carry an application operation identifier recorded atomically with the side effect.</p>","zh":"<p>如果应用代码重试超时调用，两次尝试都可能执行。Orleans 不会对任意请求进行持久化去重。重试的操作应天然具备幂等性，或携带应用操作标识符，并将该标识符与副作用原子地记录。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-23","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Repeated retry can approximate at-least-once delivery only while the cluster and target eventually recover. It does not imply exactly once, ordering across retries, or bounded completion time.</p>","zh":"<p>只有在集群和目标最终能够恢复的前提下，反复重试才可能近似实现至少一次投递。它不意味着恰好一次，也不保证重试之间的顺序或有界的完成时间。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-24","type":"heading","anchor":"rejections-and-expiration","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"rejections-and-expiration\">Rejections and expiration</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"rejections-and-expiration\">拒绝与过期</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-25","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The runtime can return a rejection when it knows that it cannot process a request, for example because of invalid routing or overload. A rejection is stronger evidence than a timeout, but application code must still interpret the rejection type.</p>","zh":"<p>当运行时明确知道无法处理请求时，可以返回拒绝，例如路由无效或过载。与超时相比，拒绝提供了更有力的证据，但应用代码仍然必须解读具体的拒绝类型。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-26","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Messages have expiration metadata derived from the response timeout. With <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/properties/\">MessagingOptions.DropExpiredMessages</a> set to <code>true</code> (the default), an expired request or response can be dropped instead of consuming work which can no longer complete the original callback.</p>","zh":"<p>消息具有根据响应超时时间推导出的过期元数据。当 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/properties/\">MessagingOptions.DropExpiredMessages</a> 设为默认值 <code>true</code> 时，已过期的请求或响应可以被丢弃，避免继续消耗资源执行已经无法完成原始回调的工作。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-27","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Rejections carry more information than a timeout because the runtime has made an explicit decision for the current processing attempt. Earlier forwarded or transported attempts remain outcome-uncertain. Treat the rejection type as a routing or availability signal.</p>","zh":"<p>拒绝比超时包含更多信息，因为运行时已经对当前处理尝试作出了明确决定。更早的转发或传输尝试，其结果仍可能不确定。应将拒绝类型视为路由或可用性信号。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-28","type":"heading","anchor":"designing-callers","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"designing-callers\">Designing callers</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"designing-callers\">设计调用方</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-29","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Choose semantics at the application boundary:</p>","zh":"<p>在应用边界选择所需语义：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-30","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>use idempotent commands for safe retry;</li>\n<li>include operation IDs when duplicate side effects are unacceptable;</li>\n<li>query durable state after an unknown outcome when possible;</li>\n<li>use transactions or storage compare-and-swap for business invariants; and</li>\n<li>do not use a longer timeout as a substitute for overload handling.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>使用幂等命令，以便安全重试；</li>\n<li>如果不能接受重复副作用，应包含操作 ID；</li>\n<li>结果未知时，在可能的情况下查询持久化状态；</li>\n<li>使用事务或存储的比较并交换机制维护业务不变式；并且</li>\n<li>不要用更长的超时时间代替过载处理。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"a4af1c81e68aed58-31","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Operational timeout and connection tuning belongs in the <a href=\"#/docs/host/configuration-guide/\">hosting configuration guide</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>运维中的超时与连接调优请参阅 <a href=\"#/docs/host/configuration-guide/\"> 托管配置指南 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"ac74e081217ebdea":{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea","title":"Transport and networking internals","titleZh":"传输与网络内部机制","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/messaging-networking/","sourceHash":"97ef232dbfe503738dcc01f3d18909df6ae72b1c99a875b684238027af736382","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Transport and networking internals</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">传输与网络内部机制</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans separates message routing from transport management. <code>MessageCenter</code> decides where a message should go; <code>ConnectionManager</code> obtains a usable connection to the target silo; the connection implementation batches and frames messages into requests for a message transport. This separation lets routing repair activation addresses while the transport manages reads, writes, and completion callbacks.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 将消息路由与传输管理分离。 <code>MessageCenter</code> 决定消息应发往何处； <code>ConnectionManager</code> 获取一条通往目标 Silo 的可用连接；连接实现将消息分批并封装成帧，形成提交给消息传输层的请求。这种分离使路由能够修复激活实例地址，同时由传输层管理读取、写入和完成回调。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-2","type":"heading","anchor":"connection-lifecycle","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"connection-lifecycle\">Connection lifecycle</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"connection-lifecycle\">连接生命周期</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For each remote <code>SiloAddress</code>, <code>ConnectionManager</code> keeps a <code>ConnectionEntry</code> containing active connections, a pending connection attempt, and the last failure time. <code>GetConnection</code> reuses a suitable active connection. When active connections are exhausted, it starts one shared pending attempt per endpoint, and concurrent senders await that attempt.</p>","zh":"<p>对于每个远程 <code>SiloAddress</code> ， <code>ConnectionManager</code> 都会维护一个 <code>ConnectionEntry</code> ，其中包含活动连接、待完成的连接尝试，以及上次失败时间。 <code>GetConnection</code> 会复用合适的活动连接。如果没有可用的活动连接，它会为每个终结点启动一个共享的待完成尝试，并发发送方都会等待该尝试。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Connection establishment has a bounded <code>OpenConnectionTimeout</code>. A failed attempt clears the pending task, removes defunct connections, records the failure, and applies the configured retry delay before another attempt. A timeout classifies the transport attempt as failed; application processing outcome requires separate reconciliation.</p>","zh":"<p>连接建立受有界的 <code>OpenConnectionTimeout</code> 限制。尝试失败后，会清除待完成任务、移除失效连接、记录失败，并在再次尝试前应用配置的重试延迟。超时会将此次传输尝试判定为失败；应用处理的结果需要另行核实。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Silo connections become available for message sends after the peer’s protocol preamble is validated and the local preamble write completes. This handshake boundary keeps each preamble ahead of framed messages on the transport, including when a peer sends its preamble before the local write is queued. TCP, Unix-domain sockets, in-memory connections, and TLS-decorated connections share this publication boundary. TLS authentication completes before the transport processes the Orleans preamble and message requests.</p>","zh":"<p>在验证对等节点的协议前导信息、并完成本地前导信息写入之后，Silo 连接才可用于发送消息。这一握手边界确保双方的前导信息都位于传输层中的成帧消息之前，即使对等节点在本地写入入队之前就已发送前导信息，也同样如此。TCP、Unix 域套接字、内存内连接和经 TLS 装饰的连接共享这一就绪发布边界。TLS 身份验证先完成，传输层随后才处理 Orleans 前导信息和消息请求。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Outbound establishment flows its shutdown-linked <code>OpenConnectionTimeout</code> token through connector creation, TLS authentication, and protocol initialization. Listener binding checks startup cancellation before allocating or registering an endpoint. Inbound listeners flow their shutdown token through acceptance and initialization. TLS authentication links establishment cancellation, underlying transport closure, and <code>HandshakeTimeout</code>; the earliest signal interrupts authentication and completes queued requests with the failure. Protocol initialization checks cancellation before publishing readiness. Once initialization completes, connection lifetime is governed by transport closure and the owning manager or listener.</p>","zh":"<p>出站连接建立会将与关闭关联的 <code>OpenConnectionTimeout</code> 令牌传递到连接器创建、TLS 身份验证和协议初始化。监听器绑定在分配或注册终结点之前检查启动取消。入站监听器会在接受连接和初始化期间传递其关闭令牌。TLS 身份验证将连接建立取消、底层传输关闭和 <code>HandshakeTimeout</code> 关联起来；最早出现的信号会中断身份验证，并以失败结果完成排队的请求。协议初始化在发布就绪状态之前检查取消。初始化完成后，连接生命周期由传输关闭，以及拥有该连接的管理器或监听器控制。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The manager and listener close owned transports to interrupt pending preamble reads and writes during canceled establishment. Accepted transport requests complete before their buffers are released, so cancellation cleanup drains those operations before disposing the connection.</p>","zh":"<p>连接建立被取消时，管理器和监听器会关闭它们拥有的传输，以中断待完成的前导信息读取和写入。已接受的传输请求会在释放其缓冲区之前完成，因此，取消清理会先排空这些操作，再释放连接。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Networking/ConnectionManager.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>ConnectionManager</code></a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Networking/Connection.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>Connection</code></a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Networking/SiloConnection.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>SiloConnection</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>源码： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Networking/ConnectionManager.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>ConnectionManager</code> </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Networking/Connection.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>Connection</code> </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Networking/SiloConnection.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>SiloConnection</code> </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The TCP transport enables keep-alive on outbound and accepted sockets. By default, the operating system sends the first probe after 90 seconds of idle time, then probes every 30 seconds and allows 10 unanswered probes before terminating the connection. Accepted sockets use the current options for their named listener, so each silo or gateway listener applies its configured keep-alive policy to new connections. When the platform reports an unsupported keep-alive option, the transport logs that option and retains supported settings; tuning continues for the other supported options.</p>","zh":"<p>TCP 传输会在出站套接字和接受的套接字上启用保活。默认情况下，操作系统在空闲 90 秒后发送首次探测，此后每隔 30 秒探测一次，并允许 10 次未获响应的探测，之后才终止连接。接受的套接字使用其命名监听器的当前选项，因此，每个 Silo 或网关监听器都会将自身配置的保活策略应用于新连接。当平台报告不支持某个保活选项时，传输层会记录该选项并保留受支持的设置；其他受支持选项的调整仍会继续。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-10","type":"heading","anchor":"message-path-and-framing","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"message-path-and-framing\">Message path and framing</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"message-path-and-framing\">消息路径与分帧</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>When <code>MessageCenter.SendMessage</code> has a target silo, it reuses an existing connection or obtains one from <code>ConnectionManager</code>. A local target uses receive processing directly. A known-dead target causes a transient rejection for request and one-way messages, and expired messages are dropped before consuming transport work.</p>","zh":"<p>当 <code>MessageCenter.SendMessage</code> 已确定目标 Silo 时，它会复用现有连接，或从 <code>ConnectionManager</code> 获取连接。本地目标直接进入接收处理。对于已知失效的目标，请求消息和单向消息会收到暂时性拒绝；过期消息则在消耗传输工作之前被丢弃。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The connection pipeline performs the protocol preamble and then exchanges framed payloads. <code>MessageSerializer</code> encodes the message header and body using Orleans serialization. <code>MessageReadRequest</code> validates frame lengths before consuming the header and body. The body remains buffered until deserialization, forwarding, or disposal releases it. TLS decorates the message transport while preserving Orleans framing and the message protocol.</p>","zh":"<p>连接管道先执行协议前导信息交换，然后交换成帧的负载。 <code>MessageSerializer</code> 使用 Orleans 序列化对消息头和消息体进行编码。 <code>MessageReadRequest</code> 在读取消息头和消息体之前验证帧长度。消息体会保持在缓冲区中，直到反序列化、转发或释放操作将其释放。TLS 装饰消息传输层，同时保留 Orleans 的分帧和消息协议。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-13","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The connection accepts outgoing messages through an unbounded queue. Its send worker batches messages into write requests, and the transport writer observes flow control while concurrent senders continue adding messages to the connection queue. A slow connection can therefore accumulate queued messages until it recovers or closes. A successful write completes the request and releases its buffered message bodies; the grain result confirms application request completion. Disconnects remove the connection from the endpoint entry and cause later sends to establish a replacement.</p>","zh":"<p>连接通过无界队列接受出站消息。其发送工作任务将消息分批组合成写入请求，传输写入器遵守流量控制，而并发发送方则继续向连接队列添加消息。因此，缓慢的连接可能持续积累排队消息，直到连接恢复或关闭。写入成功会完成请求并释放其缓冲的消息体；Grain 的结果才确认应用请求已完成。断开连接会将该连接从终结点条目中移除，使后续发送建立替代连接。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-14","type":"heading","anchor":"failure-and-shutdown","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"failure-and-shutdown\">Failure and shutdown</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"failure-and-shutdown\">故障与关闭</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>When a connection terminates, failed write requests and queued send work reroute their messages through the connection-specific <code>RetryMessage</code> implementation. That implementation returns messages to <code>MessageCenter</code> for routing up to the retry limit, then rejects requests and drops other messages. A partially written request can have reached its target before failure, so applications reconcile ambiguous outcomes using their delivery and idempotency requirements.</p>","zh":"<p>连接终止时，失败的写入请求和排队的发送工作会通过该连接特定的 <code>RetryMessage</code> 实现重新路由其消息。该实现将消息交回 <code>MessageCenter</code> 进行路由，直到达到重试上限，之后拒绝请求并丢弃其他消息。部分写入的请求可能在故障发生之前就已到达目标，因此，应用应根据其投递和幂等性要求核实不明确的结果。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Shutdown first blocks new application traffic while allowing responses and membership traffic needed to complete the stop protocol. <code>MessageCenter</code> rejects or drops blocked messages, stops accepting client messages, and then closes connections. Inbound application requests arriving at a stopping silo receive transient rejections with targeted cache invalidation, allowing senders to remove routes to that silo. Other inbound application messages are dropped, and their buffered bodies are released.</p>","zh":"<p>关闭过程首先阻止新的应用流量，同时允许完成停止协议所需的响应和成员管理流量通过。 <code>MessageCenter</code> 拒绝或丢弃被阻止的消息，停止接受客户端消息，然后关闭连接。到达正在停止的 Silo 的入站应用请求会收到暂时性拒绝，并附带针对性的缓存失效信息，使发送方能够移除通往该 Silo 的路由。其他入站应用消息会被丢弃，其缓冲的消息体也会被释放。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><code>ConnectionManager</code> closes establishment admission before canceling pending attempts and signaling existing connections to close. Each admitted producer remains owned until it publishes its connection or completes failure cleanup, including its connection runner. Shutdown then closes any late publications and drains the remaining outbound runners through middleware cleanup. The shutdown cancellation source stays valid until those operations finish; a canceled host stop preserves it for operations still unwinding. Inbound listeners stop accepting connections and close their tracked connections before awaiting the manager’s closed signal and disposing their transport listener.</p>","zh":"<p><code>ConnectionManager</code> 先停止接纳新的连接建立操作，再取消待完成的尝试，并向现有连接发出关闭信号。每个已接纳的创建方都会继续受管理，直到它发布连接或完成失败清理，其中包括其连接运行器。随后，关闭过程会关闭任何迟到发布的连接，并通过中间件清理排空剩余的出站运行器。关闭取消源会一直保持有效，直到这些操作完成；即使宿主停止过程被取消，也会为仍在清理的操作保留它。入站监听器先停止接受连接，并关闭其跟踪的连接，然后等待管理器的已关闭信号，再释放其传输监听器。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Connection closure stops send-work admission and closes the message transport to release pending TLS handshakes, preamble exchange, and transport I/O. After the connection runner and send worker quiesce, transport disposal releases the decorated transport chain. A connection closed before its queued runner starts completes transport shutdown before protocol initialization.</p>","zh":"<p>连接关闭会停止接纳发送工作，并关闭消息传输，以解除待完成的 TLS 握手、前导信息交换和传输 I/O。连接运行器和发送工作任务静止后，传输释放操作会释放经过装饰的传输链。如果连接在其排队的运行器启动之前就已关闭，则会在协议初始化之前完成传输关闭。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-19","type":"heading","anchor":"design-trade-offs","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"design-trade-offs\">Design trade-offs</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"design-trade-offs\">设计权衡</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-20","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>Per-endpoint connection state avoids global coordination but means every silo must observe and repair its own broken paths.</li>\n<li>Reusing connections reduces handshake and allocation cost, while multiple connections can improve throughput and avoid head-of-line blocking.</li>\n<li>Dropping expired messages protects a saturated runtime from work whose callback deadline has elapsed. Applications use operation IDs and durable state to reconcile the operation’s outcome.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>按终结点维护连接状态可以避免全局协调，但也意味着每个 Silo 都必须自行观察和修复其损坏的路径。</li>\n<li>复用连接可以降低握手和分配成本，而多个连接可以提高吞吐量并避免队头阻塞。</li>\n<li>丢弃过期消息可以保护已饱和的运行时，避免处理回调截止时限已经过去的工作。应用使用操作 ID 和持久化状态来核实操作结果。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"ac74e081217ebdea-21","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For end-to-end semantics, see <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/messaging-delivery-guarantees/\">messaging and delivery semantics</a>. Network endpoint selection and firewall requirements belong in <a href=\"#/docs/deployment/networking/\">topology, networking, and clustering</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>端到端语义参见 <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/messaging-delivery-guarantees/\"> 消息传递与投递语义 </a> 。网络终结点选择和防火墙要求见 <a href=\"#/docs/deployment/networking/\"> 拓扑、网络与集群 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"c0ae2512609ec9a3":{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3","title":"Lifecycle implementation","titleZh":"生命周期实现","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/orleans-lifecycle/","sourceHash":"59523a9d5f601b0e0ce75e49db060e2be87ef2502f45da14825adfcc944d08d4","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Lifecycle implementation</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">生命周期实现</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans composes many independently registered services into one silo or client. Some services must start only after a dependency is ready and stop before that dependency disappears. The lifecycle abstraction gives those components an ordered protocol without placing every dependency in a central start method.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 将许多独立注册的服务组合成一个 Silo 或客户端。有些服务必须等到依赖项就绪后才能启动，并且必须在依赖项消失之前停止。生命周期抽象为这些组件提供有序协议，而无需将所有依赖关系都放进一个集中的启动方法中。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-2","type":"heading","anchor":"observable-and-observers-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"observable-and-observers-\">Observable and observers <span id=\"observable-lifecycle\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"observable-and-observers-\">可观察对象与观察者 <span id=\"observable-lifecycle\"> </span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleobservable/\">ILifecycleObservable</a> accepts subscriptions at integer stages. During startup it visits stages in ascending order; during shutdown it visits them in descending order. Every observer at a stage completes before the lifecycle advances.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleobservable/\">ILifecycleObservable</a> 接受整数阶段上的订阅。启动时，按升序访问各阶段；关闭时，按降序访问各阶段。只有当前阶段的每个观察者都完成后，生命周期才会前进。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleobserver/\">ILifecycleObserver</a> provides asynchronous <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleobserver/methods/\">OnStart</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleobserver/methods/\">OnStop</a> callbacks. <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleparticipant-1/\">ILifecycleParticipant&lt;T&gt;</a> is the enrollment contract: a participant receives the lifecycle and subscribes itself. Silo and client hosting discover their registered participants through dependency injection; grain-scoped services have an explicit enrollment owner.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleobserver/\">ILifecycleObserver</a> 提供异步的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleobserver/methods/\">OnStart</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleobserver/methods/\">OnStop</a> 回调。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleparticipant-1/\">ILifecycleParticipant&lt;T&gt;</a> 是参与注册协定：参与者接收生命周期并订阅自身。Silo 和客户端宿主通过依赖注入发现已注册的参与者；Grain 作用域内的服务则具有明确的参与注册负责人。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-5","type":"diagram","en":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"4006e2bc9eb87c0727d87a80fb59f1a4a45239eb24c440bc0ceecff7af3f5af1\" data-diagram-language=\"en\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rendering diagram…\">Rendering diagram…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>Original Mermaid source</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Host\n    participant Lifecycle\n    participant Membership\n    participant Runtime\n    participant Application\n\n    Host-&gt;&gt;Lifecycle: Start\n    Lifecycle-&gt;&gt;Membership: Low stage OnStart\n    Membership--&gt;&gt;Lifecycle: Ready\n    Lifecycle-&gt;&gt;Runtime: Runtime stage OnStart\n    Runtime--&gt;&gt;Lifecycle: Ready\n    Lifecycle-&gt;&gt;Application: Active stage OnStart\n    Application--&gt;&gt;Lifecycle: Ready\n    Host-&gt;&gt;Lifecycle: Stop\n    Lifecycle-&gt;&gt;Application: Active stage OnStop\n    Lifecycle-&gt;&gt;Runtime: Runtime stage OnStop\n    Lifecycle-&gt;&gt;Membership: Low stage OnStop</code></pre></details></figure>","zh":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"4006e2bc9eb87c0727d87a80fb59f1a4a45239eb24c440bc0ceecff7af3f5af1\" data-diagram-language=\"zh\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正在绘制图表…\">正在绘制图表…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看原始 Mermaid 图表代码</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Host\n    participant Lifecycle\n    participant Membership\n    participant Runtime\n    participant Application\n\n    Host-&gt;&gt;Lifecycle: Start\n    Lifecycle-&gt;&gt;Membership: Low stage OnStart\n    Membership--&gt;&gt;Lifecycle: Ready\n    Lifecycle-&gt;&gt;Runtime: Runtime stage OnStart\n    Runtime--&gt;&gt;Lifecycle: Ready\n    Lifecycle-&gt;&gt;Application: Active stage OnStart\n    Application--&gt;&gt;Lifecycle: Ready\n    Host-&gt;&gt;Lifecycle: Stop\n    Lifecycle-&gt;&gt;Application: Active stage OnStop\n    Lifecycle-&gt;&gt;Runtime: Runtime stage OnStop\n    Lifecycle-&gt;&gt;Membership: Low stage OnStop</code></pre></details></figure>","diagram":"4006e2bc9eb87c0727d87a80fb59f1a4a45239eb24c440bc0ceecff7af3f5af1","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The reverse shutdown order is the key invariant. A service can continue using dependencies which started at earlier stages until its own stop callback completes.</p>","zh":"<p>按相反顺序关闭是关键不变量。在服务自身的停止回调完成之前，它可以继续使用在更早阶段启动的依赖项。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-7","type":"heading","anchor":"silo-and-client-lifecycles","level":2,"en":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"lifecycle-observer\"></span><h2 id=\"silo-and-client-lifecycles\">Silo and client lifecycles</h2>","zh":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"lifecycle-observer\"></span><h2 id=\"silo-and-client-lifecycles\">Silo 与客户端生命周期</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.silolifecyclesubject/\">SiloLifecycleSubject</a> drives silo startup and shutdown. Membership, messaging, grain directory, activation collection, statistics, providers, and other runtime components participate at named <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.servicelifecyclestage/\">ServiceLifecycleStage</a> values.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.silolifecyclesubject/\">SiloLifecycleSubject</a> 驱动 Silo 的启动和关闭。成员管理、消息传递、Grain 目录、激活实例回收、统计信息、提供程序和其他运行时组件，在具名的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.servicelifecyclestage/\">ServiceLifecycleStage</a> 值对应的阶段参与生命周期。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The client uses the same pattern for gateway discovery, connections, stream providers, and the outside runtime client. The generic <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleobservable/\">ILifecycleObservable</a> also lets providers compose a private lifecycle when the silo-specific interface is unnecessary.</p>","zh":"<p>客户端对网关发现、连接、流提供程序和外部运行时客户端使用相同模式。不需要 Silo 专用接口时，通用的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleobservable/\">ILifecycleObservable</a> 也允许提供程序组合出私有生命周期。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The host-facing stage list and configuration examples are documented in <a href=\"#/docs/host/silo-lifecycle/\">silo lifecycle</a>. This page focuses on the protocol rather than where application startup code should be registered.</p>","zh":"<p>面向宿主的阶段列表和配置示例见 <a href=\"#/docs/host/silo-lifecycle/\"> Silo 生命周期 </a> 。本页侧重于协议，而不是应用启动代码应在何处注册。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-11","type":"heading","anchor":"grain-activation-composition","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"grain-activation-composition\">Grain activation composition</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"grain-activation-composition\">Grain 激活组合</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.iconfiguregraintypecomponents/\">IConfigureGrainTypeComponents</a> configures a shared plan for a grain type. A configurator can use <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.metadata.grainclassmap/\">GrainClassMap</a> to select implementation classes, then add synchronous actions with <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.graintypesharedcontext/methods/\">AddActivationSetup</a>. Selection and composition occur when creating the shared context; activations execute the cached actions.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.iconfiguregraintypecomponents/\">IConfigureGrainTypeComponents</a> 为某个 Grain 类型配置共享方案。配置器可以使用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.metadata.grainclassmap/\">GrainClassMap</a> 选择实现类，再通过 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.graintypesharedcontext/methods/\">AddActivationSetup</a> 添加同步操作。选择和组合发生在创建共享上下文时；各激活实例执行已缓存的操作。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-13","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.graintypesharedcontext/\">GrainTypeSharedContext</a> seals setup registration after the configurators finish. When constructing an activation, the runtime assigns the fully constructed grain object and records creation before invoking setup actions in addition order. It then enrolls the grain object and starts the lifecycle. This boundary also applies to custom grain activators and to individual stateless workers.</p>","zh":"<p>配置器完成后， <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.graintypesharedcontext/\">GrainTypeSharedContext</a> 会封闭设置操作的注册。在构造激活实例时，运行时先设置已完全构造的 Grain 对象并记录创建，然后按添加顺序调用设置操作。接着让 Grain 对象参与生命周期，并启动生命周期。这一边界也适用于自定义 Grain 激活器，以及各个无状态工作实例。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Setup delegates are shared and can run concurrently across activations. Resolve per-activation state through <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.igraincontext/properties/\">ActivationServices</a> inside the action. Existing DI registrations retain their explicit enrollment paths. Setup failures follow activation-construction failure handling: subsequent setup and lifecycle startup are skipped, and the assigned grain and scope are disposed.</p>","zh":"<p>设置委托是共享的，可以在不同激活实例上并发运行。应在操作内部通过 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.igraincontext/properties/\">ActivationServices</a> 解析每个激活实例各自的状态。现有 DI 注册保留其显式的参与注册路径。设置失败遵循激活实例构造失败的处理方式：跳过后续设置和生命周期启动，并释放已设置的 Grain 及其作用域。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>See <a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-lifecycle/::shared-activation-setup\">shared activation setup</a> for a compiled interface-selection example.</p>","zh":"<p>可编译的接口选择示例参见 <a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-lifecycle/::shared-activation-setup\"> 共享激活设置 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-16","type":"heading","anchor":"subscription-rules-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"subscription-rules-\">Subscription rules <span id=\"lifecycle-participation\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"subscription-rules-\">订阅规则 <span id=\"lifecycle-participation\"> </span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>A lifecycle participant should:</p>","zh":"<p>生命周期参与者应当：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-18","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>subscribe during composition, before lifecycle start;</li>\n<li>use a stable observer name for diagnostics;</li>\n<li>select the latest stage whose prerequisites are guaranteed;</li>\n<li>make <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleobserver/methods/\">OnStop</a> safe after a partial <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleobserver/methods/\">OnStart</a>;</li>\n<li>honor the supplied cancellation token; and</li>\n<li>release dependencies before their lower stage stops.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>在组合期间、生命周期启动之前订阅；</li>\n<li>使用稳定的观察者名称，以便诊断；</li>\n<li>选择先决条件能够得到保证的最晚阶段；</li>\n<li>确保 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleobserver/methods/\">OnStart</a> 仅部分完成后， <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleobserver/methods/\">OnStop</a> 仍可安全执行；</li>\n<li>遵守提供的取消令牌；以及</li>\n<li>在依赖项所处的较低阶段停止之前释放它们。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-19","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Avoid creating hidden ordering by resolving and starting another participant manually. Stage dependencies should remain visible in lifecycle subscriptions.</p>","zh":"<p>避免通过手动解析并启动另一个参与者来建立隐藏的顺序关系。阶段依赖关系应在生命周期订阅中保持可见。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-20","type":"heading","anchor":"failure-behavior","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"failure-behavior\">Failure behavior</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"failure-behavior\">失败行为</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-21","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Startup does not skip a failed observer and continue to a success-shaped state. The exception aborts lifecycle progress and the host reports startup failure. Shutdown attempts to unwind initialized stages under its cancellation deadline.</p>","zh":"<p>启动过程不会跳过失败的观察者，再继续进入看似成功的状态。异常会中止生命周期的推进，宿主会报告启动失败。关闭过程会在取消截止时限内尝试按相反顺序清理已初始化的阶段。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-22","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Cancellation bounds lifecycle observation; it cannot guarantee instantaneous cleanup of external resources. Provider code should keep shutdown idempotent and should not swallow failures which leave durable ownership ambiguous.</p>","zh":"<p>取消为生命周期观察设置了边界，但无法保证立即清理外部资源。提供程序代码应保持关闭操作的幂等性，并且不应吞掉那些会导致持久化所有权不明确的失败。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-23","type":"heading","anchor":"source","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"source\">Source</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"source\">来源</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c0ae2512609ec9a3-24","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.lifecyclesubject/\">LifecycleSubject</a> implements stage traversal; see its <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Lifecycle/LifecycleSubject.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">implementation</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.silolifecyclesubject/\">SiloLifecycleSubject</a> is the silo lifecycle; see its <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Lifecycle/SiloLifecycleSubject.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">implementation</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Hosting/DefaultSiloServices.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>DefaultSiloServices</code></a> shows participant registration.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.providers.streams.common.persistentstreamprovider/\">PersistentStreamProvider</a> is a named-provider example with separate initialize and active stages; see its <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Streaming/PersistentStreams/PersistentStreamProvider.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">lifecycle participation implementation</a>.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.lifecyclesubject/\">LifecycleSubject</a> 实现阶段遍历；参见其 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Lifecycle/LifecycleSubject.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 实现 </a> 。</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.silolifecyclesubject/\">SiloLifecycleSubject</a> 是 Silo 生命周期；参见其 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Lifecycle/SiloLifecycleSubject.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 实现 </a> 。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Hosting/DefaultSiloServices.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>DefaultSiloServices</code> </a> 展示了参与者注册。</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.providers.streams.common.persistentstreamprovider/\">PersistentStreamProvider</a> 是一个命名提供程序示例，具有独立的初始化阶段和活动阶段；参见其 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Streaming/PersistentStreams/PersistentStreamProvider.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 生命周期参与实现 </a> 。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"}]},"e0cda2d91b685bb1":{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1","title":"Provider authoring architecture","titleZh":"提供程序开发架构","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/provider-authoring/","sourceHash":"efaba646a7bb25a8e3631166b0a383648d3e55898e61b9c239f5d3aef170703e","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Provider authoring architecture</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">提供程序开发架构</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>An Orleans provider adapts an external system or alternate runtime implementation to a defined contract. Storage, clustering, reminders, grain directories, and persistent streams have different data-plane interfaces, but their hosting architecture follows the same pattern, built on the <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/extensions/options\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">.NET options pattern</a> and <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/extensions/dependency-injection/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">dependency injection</a>:</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 提供程序将外部系统或替代运行时实现适配到既定协定。存储、集群、提醒器、Grain 目录和持久流具有不同的数据平面接口，但其宿主架构遵循同一模式，建立在 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/extensions/options\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> .NET 选项模式 </a> 和 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/extensions/dependency-injection/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 依赖注入 </a> 之上：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-2","type":"list","en":"<ol>\n<li>bind a named configuration section;</li>\n<li>register named services and options;</li>\n<li>validate configuration during host startup;</li>\n<li>participate in lifecycle when resources need initialization; and</li>\n<li>surface failures instead of silently degrading to another backend.</li>\n</ol>","zh":"<ol>\n<li>绑定命名配置节；</li>\n<li>注册命名服务和选项；</li>\n<li>在宿主启动期间验证配置；</li>\n<li>资源需要初始化时参与生命周期；以及</li>\n<li>显式报告失败，而不是悄然降级到另一个后端。</li>\n</ol>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-3","type":"heading","anchor":"configuration-driven-provider-builders","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"configuration-driven-provider-builders\">Configuration-driven provider builders</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"configuration-driven-provider-builders\">由配置驱动的提供程序构建器</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.providers.iproviderbuilder-1/\">IProviderBuilder&lt;T&gt;</a> is the bridge from Orleans configuration to a silo or client builder:</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.providers.iproviderbuilder-1/\">IProviderBuilder&lt;T&gt;</a> 是将 Orleans 配置连接到 Silo 或客户端构建器的桥梁：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Provider packages associate a provider type string and category with a builder using assembly metadata. The host selects that builder from configuration, passes the provider name and section, and lets the builder call the same public registration API used by code-first configuration.</p>","zh":"<p>提供程序包使用程序集元数据，将提供程序类型字符串和类别与构建器关联起来。宿主根据配置选择该构建器，传入提供程序名称和配置节，并让构建器调用与代码优先配置相同的公共注册 API。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The Azure Queue stream implementation demonstrates this pattern: <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.hosting.azurequeuestreamproviderbuilder/\">AzureQueueStreamProviderBuilder</a> implements builders for both <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.isilobuilder/\">ISiloBuilder</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.hosting.iclientbuilder/\">IClientBuilder</a>. See its <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Azure/Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/Hosting/AzureQueueStreamProviderBuilder.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">implementation</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>Azure Queue 流实现展示了这一模式： <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.hosting.azurequeuestreamproviderbuilder/\">AzureQueueStreamProviderBuilder</a> 同时为 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.isilobuilder/\">ISiloBuilder</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.hosting.iclientbuilder/\">IClientBuilder</a> 实现了构建器。参见其 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Azure/Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/Hosting/AzureQueueStreamProviderBuilder.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 实现 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-7","type":"heading","anchor":"named-service-composition","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"named-service-composition\">Named-service composition</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"named-service-composition\">命名服务组合</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Many provider kinds allow multiple instances. The provider name is therefore part of service identity, options identity, logging identity, and runtime lookup. <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.hosting.namedserviceconfigurator/\">NamedServiceConfigurator</a> and its derived configurators register keyed components and named options without creating a private service provider.</p>","zh":"<p>许多种类的提供程序允许存在多个实例。因此，提供程序名称是服务身份、选项身份、日志身份和运行时查找的一部分。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.hosting.namedserviceconfigurator/\">NamedServiceConfigurator</a> 及其派生配置器注册按键区分的组件和命名选项，无需创建私有服务提供者。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>A registration extension should:</p>","zh":"<p>注册扩展应当：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-10","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>require a non-empty name when the provider category is named;</li>\n<li>register options through <code>AddOptions&lt;T&gt;(name)</code> or an Orleans configurator;</li>\n<li>register the contract and implementation under the same key;</li>\n<li>use <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/microsoft.extensions.dependencyinjection.extensions.servicecollectiondescriptorextensions.tryadd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TryAdd</a> only for truly shared defaults; and</li>\n<li>include the name in validators and diagnostics.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>在提供程序类别采用命名方式时，要求名称非空；</li>\n<li>通过 <code>AddOptions&lt;T&gt;(name)</code> 或 Orleans 配置器注册选项；</li>\n<li>将协定和实现注册在同一个键下；</li>\n<li>仅对真正共享的默认项使用 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/microsoft.extensions.dependencyinjection.extensions.servicecollectiondescriptorextensions.tryadd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> TryAdd </a> ；以及</li>\n<li>在验证器和诊断信息中包含名称。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Resolving an unkeyed singleton for a named component can make the first provider’s options leak into every other provider.</p>","zh":"<p>为命名组件解析不带键的单例，可能导致第一个提供程序的选项泄漏到其他所有提供程序中。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-12","type":"heading","anchor":"separate-control-plane-and-data-plane","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"separate-control-plane-and-data-plane\">Separate control plane and data plane</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"separate-control-plane-and-data-plane\">分离控制平面与数据平面</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-13","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The provider builder and options are the control plane. The runtime contract is the data plane:</p>","zh":"<p>提供程序构建器和选项构成控制平面。运行时协定构成数据平面：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-14","type":"table","en":"<table><thead><tr><th>Provider kind</th><th>Data-plane contract</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cluster membership</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.imembershiptable/\">IMembershipTable</a></td></tr><tr><td>Grain storage</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.storage.igrainstorage/\">IGrainStorage</a></td></tr><tr><td>Grain directory</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.graindirectory.igraindirectory/\">IGrainDirectory</a></td></tr><tr><td>Reminder table</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.reminders/orleans.iremindertable/\">IReminderTable</a></td></tr><tr><td>Persistent streams</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueueadapterfactory/\">IQueueAdapterFactory</a> and its adapter components</td></tr></tbody></table>","zh":"<table><thead><tr><th>提供程序种类</th><th>数据平面协定</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>集群成员信息</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.imembershiptable/\">IMembershipTable</a></td></tr><tr><td>Grain 存储</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.storage.igrainstorage/\">IGrainStorage</a></td></tr><tr><td>Grain 目录</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.graindirectory.igraindirectory/\">IGrainDirectory</a></td></tr><tr><td>提醒器表</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.reminders/orleans.iremindertable/\">IReminderTable</a></td></tr><tr><td>持久流</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueueadapterfactory/\">IQueueAdapterFactory</a> 及其适配器组件</td></tr></tbody></table>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Do not let configuration concerns weaken the data-plane contract. For example, a membership provider must preserve conditional updates and ordered versions regardless of whether credentials came from a connection string, a keyed SDK client, or managed identity.</p>","zh":"<p>不要让配置方面的考虑削弱数据平面协定。例如，无论凭据来自连接字符串、按键注册的 SDK 客户端，还是托管标识，成员管理提供程序都必须保持有条件更新和有序版本的语义。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-16","type":"heading","anchor":"validation","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"validation\">Validation</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"validation\">验证</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Options validation should fail before the silo joins the cluster or starts accepting traffic. Orleans providers commonly register an <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.iconfigurationvalidator/\">IConfigurationValidator</a> so validation can include named options and service dependencies which ordinary data-annotation validation cannot express.</p>","zh":"<p>选项验证应在 Silo 加入集群或开始接受流量之前报告失败。Orleans 提供程序通常注册一个 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.iconfigurationvalidator/\">IConfigurationValidator</a> ，使验证能够包含命名选项和服务依赖关系，而普通的数据注解验证无法表达这些要求。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Validate at least:</p>","zh":"<p>至少应验证：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-19","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>required endpoint, client, or credential source;</li>\n<li>mutually exclusive configuration forms;</li>\n<li>provider-specific naming and range constraints;</li>\n<li>compatibility between paired components; and</li>\n<li>capabilities required by the runtime contract.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>必需的终结点、客户端或凭据来源；</li>\n<li>互斥的配置形式；</li>\n<li>提供程序特定的命名和范围约束；</li>\n<li>成对组件之间的兼容性；以及</li>\n<li>运行时协定要求的能力。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-20","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Avoid broad exception handling which turns an inaccessible backend into an empty result. An empty membership table, missing grain state, or empty stream queue has domain meaning and must not represent a swallowed infrastructure failure.</p>","zh":"<p>避免宽泛地捕获异常，将无法访问的后端转化为空结果。空成员表、缺失的 Grain 状态或空流队列都具有领域含义，不得用来表示被吞掉的基础设施故障。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-21","type":"heading","anchor":"lifecycle-and-ownership","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"lifecycle-and-ownership\">Lifecycle and ownership</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"lifecycle-and-ownership\">生命周期与所有权</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-22","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Providers which allocate clients, receivers, leases, or background agents should implement or register an <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleparticipant-1/\">ILifecycleParticipant&lt;T&gt;</a>. Initialize after required runtime services are ready and stop before those services disappear.</p>","zh":"<p>分配客户端、接收器、租约或后台代理的提供程序，应实现或注册一个 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.ilifecycleparticipant-1/\">ILifecycleParticipant&lt;T&gt;</a> 。在所需运行时服务就绪后初始化，并在这些服务消失之前停止。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-23","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Ownership must be explicit. If the application supplies a keyed SDK client, the provider generally should not dispose an object it does not own. If the provider creates receivers per queue, it should stop and dispose them when queue ownership moves.</p>","zh":"<p>所有权必须明确。如果应用提供按键注册的 SDK 客户端，提供程序通常不应释放不属于自身的对象。如果提供程序为每个队列创建接收器，则应在队列所有权移动时停止并释放它们。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-24","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The persistent stream provider illustrates staged lifecycle composition: it creates the adapter during initialization, starts pulling agents at the active stage, then stops agents before closing. See <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.providers.streams.common.persistentstreamprovider/methods/\">PersistentStreamProvider.Participate</a> and its <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Streaming/PersistentStreams/PersistentStreamProvider.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">implementation</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>持久流提供程序展示了分阶段的生命周期组合：初始化期间创建适配器，在活动阶段启动拉取代理，然后在关闭之前停止代理。参见 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.providers.streams.common.persistentstreamprovider/methods/\">PersistentStreamProvider.Participate</a> 及其 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Streaming/PersistentStreams/PersistentStreamProvider.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 实现 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-25","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Membership callers use the cancellation-aware methods of <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.imembershiptable/\">IMembershipTable</a> for initialization, reads, and writes. Built-in providers forward tokens to backend APIs which support cancellation and bound waits on tokenless SDK operations while observing late faults. Custom providers implement cancellation according to their backend’s operation and resource lifetimes. Cancellation can race with a committed write, so conditional writes and table versions govern subsequent updates.</p>","zh":"<p>成员管理调用方使用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.imembershiptable/\">IMembershipTable</a> 中支持取消的方法进行初始化、读取和写入。内置提供程序将令牌传递给支持取消的后端 API；对于不接受令牌的 SDK 操作，则限制等待时间，并观测迟到的故障。自定义提供程序根据后端的操作和资源生命周期实现取消。取消可能与已提交的写入发生竞态，因此，后续更新由有条件写入和表版本控制。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-26","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Return completed backend results, and observe cancellation before starting further I/O. Mapping an already-returned result preserves that operation’s outcome.</p>","zh":"<p>返回后端已完成的结果，并在开始进一步 I/O 之前检查取消。对已经返回的结果进行映射，会保留该操作的结果。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-27","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Shared membership refreshes live until the membership manager is disposed. Each caller owns its wait, while periodic maintenance and its queued cleanup requests stop with the silo lifecycle. This keeps membership reads available during shutdown.</p>","zh":"<p>共享的成员信息刷新操作会一直存续，直到成员管理器被释放。每个调用方负责自己的等待，而定期维护及其排队的清理请求会随 Silo 生命周期停止。这使成员读取在关闭期间仍然可用。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-28","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Membership table RPCs propagate cancellation separately from application arguments. Each receiver applies its implementation’s cancellation behavior.</p>","zh":"<p>成员表 RPC 将取消与应用参数分开传播。每个接收方应用其实现自身的取消行为。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-29","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>When a lifecycle callback must execute its cancellation or cleanup logic, schedule it with <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.tasks.task.run\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Run</a> and pass the cancellation token to the operation inside the callback. The callback then owns how cancellation completes its work.</p>","zh":"<p>如果生命周期回调必须执行自身的取消或清理逻辑，应通过 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.tasks.task.run\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Run </a> 调度该回调，并将取消令牌传给回调内部的操作。这样，回调就负责决定取消如何完成其工作。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-30","type":"heading","anchor":"membership-snapshots","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"membership-snapshots\">Membership snapshots</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"membership-snapshots\">成员快照</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-31","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Use <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.imembershiptable/methods/\">ReadAllAsync</a> to obtain the membership rows and their corresponding table version in one atomic snapshot. <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.membershiptabledata/methods/\">TryGet</a> selects a silo’s entry and row ETag from that snapshot.</p>","zh":"<p>使用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.imembershiptable/methods/\">ReadAllAsync</a> 在一个原子快照中获取成员行及其对应的表版本。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.membershiptabledata/methods/\">TryGet</a> 从该快照中选出某个 Silo 的条目和行 ETag。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-32","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Conditional writes use <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.tableversion/methods/\">Next</a> from the observed snapshot and return their success status. Refresh the snapshot to obtain the current table ETag before selecting another mutation. Row ETags follow each provider’s metadata policy and can change during heartbeat-only activity. Canonical updates require an existing row and a matching table ETag; additional row conditions remain heartbeat-neutral.</p>","zh":"<p>有条件写入使用已观察快照中的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.tableversion/methods/\"> Next </a> ，并返回是否成功。在选择下一次修改之前，先刷新快照以获取当前表 ETag。行 ETag 遵循各提供程序的元数据策略，可能在仅有心跳活动时发生变化。规范更新要求行已存在且表 ETag 匹配；附加的行条件则不受心跳影响。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-33","type":"heading","anchor":"testing-a-provider","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"testing-a-provider\">Testing a provider</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"testing-a-provider\">测试提供程序</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-34","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Contract tests should cover more than successful round trips:</p>","zh":"<p>协定测试不应只覆盖成功的往返操作，还应包括：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-35","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>concurrent conditional updates and stale version rejection;</li>\n<li>duplicate registration or delivery behavior;</li>\n<li>cancellation and timeout propagation;</li>\n<li>startup validation;</li>\n<li>backend unavailability without silent fallback;</li>\n<li>resource cleanup after lifecycle stop;</li>\n<li>multiple named instances with isolated options; and</li>\n<li>rolling-upgrade compatibility of stored or transmitted data.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>并发的有条件更新，以及对陈旧版本的拒绝；</li>\n<li>重复注册或重复投递的行为；</li>\n<li>取消和超时的传播；</li>\n<li>启动验证；</li>\n<li>后端不可用时不发生静默回退；</li>\n<li>生命周期停止后的资源清理；</li>\n<li>多个命名实例各自具有隔离的选项；以及</li>\n<li>存储或传输数据在滚动升级中的兼容性。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-36","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Use <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/testing/\">TestingHost architecture</a> to understand which runtime services a test cluster substitutes. Provider tests which depend on a real backend should state those preconditions and should not treat an emulator’s weaker consistency as proof of the production contract.</p>","zh":"<p>通过 <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/testing/\"> TestingHost 架构 </a> 了解测试集群替换了哪些运行时服务。依赖真实后端的提供程序测试应说明这些前提条件，不应将模拟器较弱的一致性视为生产协定得到满足的证明。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-37","type":"heading","anchor":"membership-provider-conformance","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"membership-provider-conformance\">Membership provider conformance</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"membership-provider-conformance\">成员管理提供程序的符合性</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-38","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><code>Microsoft.Orleans.Clustering.TestKit</code> supplies framework-neutral tests for <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.imembershiptable/\">IMembershipTable</a>. Create a fresh fixture for each direct scenario, with independent provider handles sharing a backend and using the fixture’s isolated cluster IDs. The fixture owns initialization and teardown.</p>","zh":"<p><code>Microsoft.Orleans.Clustering.TestKit</code> 为 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.imembershiptable/\">IMembershipTable</a> 提供与测试框架无关的测试。为每个直接场景创建新的测试夹具，使用共享同一后端的独立提供程序句柄，并使用夹具隔离的集群 ID。夹具负责初始化和清理。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-39","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Supply the fixture’s read-only deletion probe over the original backing scope. The kit checks populated data before deletion and verifies native deletion or store invalidation before owner disposal. Deletion ends that history; subsequent generated cases use fresh fixtures and owners.</p>","zh":"<p>为夹具提供作用于原始底层存储作用域的只读删除探针。测试工具包在删除之前检查已填充的数据，并在所有者释放之前验证原生删除或存储失效。删除结束该段历史；后续生成的用例使用新的夹具和所有者。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"e0cda2d91b685bb1-40","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Expose the direct runner methods as individual tests and run the Accordant-generated suite with a fresh-fixture factory. The tests cover atomic table-version CAS on existing rows, coherent canonical reads, heartbeat noninterference with the table version and previously captured update inputs, Dead-row cleanup, and cluster isolation. Row ETags are provider-defined metadata and can change after a heartbeat. Raw liveness reads can lag, and full-row writes can overwrite a heartbeat. Provider-native instrumentation verifies that each periodic heartbeat performs one blind liveness write with zero prerequisite reads or compare-and-swap operations. Retain failure diagnostics to reproduce generated histories. The <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Clustering.TestKit/README.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">package README</a> provides factory examples and the scenario inventory.</p>","zh":"<p>将直接运行器方法公开为独立测试，并使用创建新夹具的工厂运行 Accordant 生成的测试套件。测试覆盖：针对已有行的原子表版本比较并交换（CAS）、一致的规范读取、心跳不干扰表版本及先前捕获的更新输入、Dead 行清理，以及集群隔离。行 ETag 是提供程序定义的元数据，可能在一次心跳后发生变化。原始存活信息读取可能滞后，全行写入则可能覆盖心跳。提供程序原生的检测机制验证每次周期性心跳只执行一次存活信息盲写，不执行任何前置读取或比较并交换操作。应保留失败诊断信息，以便复现生成的操作历史。 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Clustering.TestKit/README.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 包 README </a> 提供工厂示例和场景清单。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"4ab6949dd85c3bd2":{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2","title":"Reminder implementation","titleZh":"提醒器实现","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/reminders/","sourceHash":"bbb35fa36ae1222b291b143b7b0ef9827ab1687c164376220ba364861a2ade87","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Reminder implementation</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">提醒器实现</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Reminders are durable schedules with volatile local execution. A reminder row is stored in an <code>IReminderTable</code>; the silo responsible for the grain’s consistent-ring range loads that row into <code>LocalReminderService</code> and runs the schedule locally. The table is the source of truth for registration, while the local <code>ReminderData</code> state is a cache and timer.</p>","zh":"<p>提醒器是具有持久性的调度计划，其本地执行状态是易失的。提醒器行存储在 <code>IReminderTable</code> 中；负责该 Grain 所在一致性环范围的 Silo 将该行加载到 <code>LocalReminderService</code> ，并在本地运行调度计划。表是注册信息的权威来源，而本地 <code>ReminderData</code> 状态则充当缓存和计时器。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-2","type":"heading","anchor":"registration-and-ownership","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"registration-and-ownership\">Registration and ownership</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"registration-and-ownership\">注册与所有权</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><code>ReminderRegistry</code> validates names, due times, periods, and the configured minimum period before forwarding the operation to the grain service for the grain’s current owner. <code>LocalReminderService</code> performs a responsibility check, upserts the row, and reconciles its local entry using the returned ETag. Conditional removal succeeds for the matching ETag and preserves newer registrations.</p>","zh":"<p><code>ReminderRegistry</code> 验证名称、到期时间、周期以及配置的最小周期，然后将操作转发给该 Grain 当前所有者上的 Grain 服务。 <code>LocalReminderService</code> 检查职责范围，对行执行插入或更新，并使用返回的 ETag 协调本地条目。有条件移除只在 ETag 匹配时成功，从而保留较新的注册。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The reminder service is a grain service attached to the consistent ring. Ownership changes when membership changes; a new owner reconstructs responsibility from the durable row during its next table read.</p>","zh":"<p>提醒器服务是附着在一致性环上的 Grain 服务。成员变更时，所有权随之变化；新所有者在下一次读取表时，根据持久化的行重建职责信息。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-5","type":"heading","anchor":"refresh-and-reconciliation","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"refresh-and-reconciliation\">Refresh and reconciliation</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"refresh-and-reconciliation\">刷新与协调</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>After the reminder table starts successfully, the service refreshes the ring range periodically. Reads are staggered and retried during initialization. Each refresh reads the range, compares the table sequence with local mutations, starts or updates owned entries whose next tick is within <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.reminders/orleans.hosting.reminderoptions/properties/\">ReminderLoadingWindow</a>, and stops entries which disappeared, moved elsewhere, or no longer fall within the loading window. A local sequence prevents a concurrent registration or removal from being overwritten by an older refresh result.</p>","zh":"<p>提醒器表成功启动后，服务会定期刷新其负责的环范围。初始化期间，读取会错开执行，并在失败时重试。每次刷新读取该范围，将表序列与本地修改进行比较，启动或更新由本节点拥有且下一次 tick 落在 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.reminders/orleans.hosting.reminderoptions/properties/\">ReminderLoadingWindow</a> 内的条目，并停止那些已消失、已移至其他位置或不再位于加载窗口内的条目。本地序列可防止并发注册或移除被较旧的刷新结果覆盖。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The reminder table contract returns every row in the owner’s consistent-hash range. A refresh therefore transfers and materializes all owned rows before applying the loading window. Resident schedules scale with reminders due within the window, while refresh I/O, deserialization, and peak allocations scale with all reminders owned by the silo.</p>","zh":"<p>提醒器表协定返回所有者的一致性哈希范围内的每一行。因此，刷新会先传输并实例化所有归属该节点的行，再应用加载窗口。常驻调度计划的规模取决于窗口内到期的提醒器数量，而刷新 I/O、反序列化和峰值分配量则随该 Silo 拥有的全部提醒器数量增长。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Reminder ownership uses periodic reconciliation. A brief ownership overlap during membership convergence is possible; ETags, responsibility checks, and the service’s delivery state converge the overlap toward the current owner.</p>","zh":"<p>提醒器所有权采用定期核对协调。成员信息收敛期间，所有权可能短暂重叠；ETag、职责检查和服务的投递状态会使重叠逐步收敛到当前所有者。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-9","type":"heading","anchor":"tick-delivery","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"tick-delivery\">Tick delivery</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"tick-delivery\">Tick 投递</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Each local reminder reports one of three states: stopped, running, or tombstone. A stopped reminder keeps its run task inactive. A running reminder computes the next due time from the stored start time and period, waits using the reminder <code>TimeProvider</code>, and invokes the target grain through the normal messaging path. A tombstone records a stop reason while refresh reconciliation observes the scheduling decision.</p>","zh":"<p>每个本地提醒器报告以下三种状态之一：已停止、运行中或墓碑。已停止的提醒器使其运行任务保持非活动状态。运行中的提醒器根据存储的开始时间和周期计算下一次到期时间，使用提醒器的 <code>TimeProvider</code> 等待，并通过正常消息路径调用目标 Grain。墓碑状态记录停止原因，同时刷新协调过程会观察该调度决策。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Each delivery owns an <code>AdmissionGate</code> token through callback completion and outcome reporting. Stopping the service closes admission, waits for admitted deliveries to finish, and then stops the local reminder loops. Cancellation of a stop wait releases the caller while draining and cleanup continue. A concurrent start waits for that cleanup to finish before creating a fresh gate, and table reconciliation recreates local schedules from durable rows.</p>","zh":"<p>每次投递都持有一个 <code>AdmissionGate</code> 令牌，直到回调完成并报告结果。停止服务时，先关闭接纳入口，等待已接纳的投递完成，再停止本地提醒器循环。取消停止等待会让调用方返回，而排空和清理仍继续进行。并发的启动会等待该清理完成，再创建新的门控；表协调则根据持久化的行重建本地调度计划。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The provider durably stores the schedule, while owners generate individual ticks in memory. After owner or process failure, the next owner reconstructs the schedule and calculates the next delivery from current time. Applications reconcile timing gaps from durable business state, and idempotent callbacks tolerate duplicate execution.</p>","zh":"<p>提供程序持久化存储调度计划，而所有者在内存中生成各次 tick。所有者或进程发生故障后，下一个所有者重建调度计划，并根据当前时间计算下一次投递。应用根据持久化业务状态处理调度间隙，幂等回调则容忍重复执行。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-13","type":"heading","anchor":"storage-and-operational-boundaries","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"storage-and-operational-boundaries\">Storage and operational boundaries</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"storage-and-operational-boundaries\">存储与运维边界</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The in-memory table is suitable for development only. Production tables provide the durability and concurrency behavior required for ownership changes, but their consistency and availability characteristics remain provider-specific. Table startup is part of silo lifecycle initialization; failure to open the configured table prevents normal reminder service startup.</p>","zh":"<p>内存表仅适用于开发。生产环境的表提供所有权变更所需的持久性和并发行为，但其一致性和可用性特征仍由具体提供程序决定。表启动是 Silo 生命周期初始化的一部分；无法打开配置的表，会阻止提醒器服务正常启动。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The <a href=\"#/docs/grains/reminders/\">reminders guide</a> covers registration and application behavior. Reminder persistence, ring movement, refresh intervals, and callback failures determine observed scheduling behavior.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/grains/reminders/\"> 提醒器指南 </a> 介绍注册和应用行为。提醒器持久化、环变动、刷新间隔和回调失败共同决定实际观察到的调度行为。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"4ab6949dd85c3bd2-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Reminders/ReminderService/LocalReminderService.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>LocalReminderService</code></a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Reminders/ReminderService/ReminderRegistry.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>ReminderRegistry</code></a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Reminders/SystemTargetInterfaces/IReminderTable.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>IReminderTable</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>源码： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Reminders/ReminderService/LocalReminderService.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>LocalReminderService</code> </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Reminders/ReminderService/ReminderRegistry.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>ReminderRegistry</code> </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Reminders/SystemTargetInterfaces/IReminderTable.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>IReminderTable</code> </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"24f304eb9d524e58":{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58","title":"Rolling version skew","titleZh":"滚动升级中的版本差异","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/rolling-version-skew/","sourceHash":"078cb40fba346de9d081b318f132f8de835120bdc74e3d2b635d17d8c705979f","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Rolling version skew</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">滚动升级中的版本差异</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>During a rolling deployment, silos can advertise different versions of the same grain interface. Orleans separates two questions: <strong>compatibility</strong> asks whether a requested version can be served by a candidate version, and <strong>selection</strong> chooses which compatible candidate to use. The grain version manifest, compatibility directors, selectors, and placement service answer those questions together.</p>","zh":"<p>滚动部署期间，Silo 可能公布同一个 Grain 接口的不同版本。Orleans 将两个问题分开： <strong> 兼容性 </strong> 判断候选版本能否处理所请求的版本， <strong> 选择 </strong> 则决定使用哪个兼容候选版本。Grain 版本清单、兼容性决策器、选择器和放置服务共同回答这些问题。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-2","type":"heading","anchor":"version-discovery-and-selection","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"version-discovery-and-selection\">Version discovery and selection</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"version-discovery-and-selection\">版本发现与选择</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Each silo contributes supported interface versions to <code>GrainVersionManifest</code>. The cached selector manager keys its result by grain type, interface, and requested version. It obtains available versions, filters them through the configured compatibility director, selects one or more versions, and maps those versions to suitable silos. The cache is invalidated when version or compatibility strategies change.</p>","zh":"<p>每个 Silo 都将其支持的接口版本提供给 <code>GrainVersionManifest</code> 。缓存版本选择器管理器使用 Grain 类型、接口和请求版本作为结果缓存的键。它获取可用版本，通过配置的兼容性决策器进行筛选，选择一个或多个版本，并将这些版本映射到合适的 Silo。版本策略或兼容性策略变化时，缓存会失效。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The built-in strategies have intentionally different upgrade behavior:</p>","zh":"<p>内置策略有意采用不同的升级行为：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-5","type":"table","en":"<table><thead><tr><th>Strategy</th><th>Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Strict compatibility</td><td>Only the same interface version is eligible.</td></tr><tr><td>Backward compatibility</td><td>A newer implementation may serve an older request when the director says it is compatible.</td></tr><tr><td>All versions compatible</td><td>Every advertised version is eligible.</td></tr><tr><td>Latest selector</td><td>Choose the highest compatible version.</td></tr><tr><td>Minimum selector</td><td>Choose the lowest compatible version.</td></tr><tr><td>All compatible selector</td><td>Keep all compatible versions as placement candidates.</td></tr></tbody></table>","zh":"<table><thead><tr><th>策略</th><th>效果</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>严格兼容</td><td>只有相同的接口版本才符合条件。</td></tr><tr><td>向后兼容</td><td>当决策器判定兼容时，较新的实现可以处理较旧的请求。</td></tr><tr><td>所有版本兼容</td><td>所有公布的版本都符合条件。</td></tr><tr><td>最新版本选择器</td><td>选择最高的兼容版本。</td></tr><tr><td>最低版本选择器</td><td>选择最低的兼容版本。</td></tr><tr><td>所有兼容版本选择器</td><td>保留所有兼容版本，作为放置候选。</td></tr></tbody></table>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The selector converts the compatibility decision into a placement set; applications preserve contract compatibility across that set.</p>","zh":"<p>选择器将兼容性决策转化为放置集合；应用负责在该集合内保持协定兼容性。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-7","type":"heading","anchor":"activation-checks","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"activation-checks\">Activation checks</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"activation-checks\">激活实例检查</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Placement chooses a suitable silo, and an activation validates the incoming interface version against its local implementation. An incompatible activation invalidates the stale route and returns the existing message to routing. Version changes can therefore move activation or repeat routing while preserving the logical call.</p>","zh":"<p>放置机制选择合适的 Silo，而激活实例根据其本地实现验证传入的接口版本。不兼容的激活实例会使陈旧路由失效，并将现有消息交回路由处理。因此，版本变化可能导致激活实例移动或重复路由，同时仍保持同一个逻辑调用。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-9","type":"heading","anchor":"wire-compatibility-is-a-separate-contract","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"wire-compatibility-is-a-separate-contract\">Wire compatibility is a separate contract</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"wire-compatibility-is-a-separate-contract\">通信兼容性是独立协定</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Version routing requires request and response types readable by both old and new builds for as long as mixed traffic, queued messages, reminders, streams, or persisted state can cross the boundary. Keep serialization IDs stable, add fields with new IDs, retain aliases when CLR names move, and ensure custom codecs skip unknown fields. See <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/serialization/\">serialization and code generation internals</a> for the wire-level rules.</p>","zh":"<p>只要混合流量、排队消息、提醒器、流或持久化状态仍可能跨越版本边界，版本路由就要求新旧构建版本都能读取请求和响应类型。保持序列化 ID 稳定，为新增字段分配新的 ID，在 CLR 名称迁移时保留别名，并确保自定义编解码器跳过未知字段。通信层面的规则参见 <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/serialization/\"> 序列化与代码生成内部机制 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Grain-state compatibility remains an application schema responsibility. Both implementations read the stored representation and tolerate writes from the other while rollback or mixed placement remains possible.</p>","zh":"<p>Grain 状态兼容性仍由应用的数据架构负责。只要仍可能回滚或混合放置，两种实现就都应能够读取已存储的表示，并容忍另一种实现写入的数据。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-12","type":"heading","anchor":"failure-modes-and-rollout-implications","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"failure-modes-and-rollout-implications\">Failure modes and rollout implications</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"failure-modes-and-rollout-implications\">故障模式与逐步部署影响</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-13","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>An empty compatible-silo set causes placement to reject or time out the request.</li>\n<li>A stale activation triggers cache invalidation and routing repair for the same logical message; the runtime preserves its message identity while locating a compatible activation.</li>\n<li>Changing a selector or compatibility strategy resets the suitable-silo cache, so subsequent placements reflect the new policy.</li>\n<li>Removing the old implementation before all callers and durable data are compatible can turn a planned rolling deployment into an outage.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>兼容 Silo 集合为空时，放置会拒绝请求或使请求超时。</li>\n<li>陈旧激活实例会为同一逻辑消息触发缓存失效和路由修复；运行时在寻找兼容激活实例时保留消息身份。</li>\n<li>更改选择器或兼容性策略会重置合适 Silo 的缓存，使后续放置反映新的策略。</li>\n<li>在所有调用方和持久化数据都兼容之前移除旧实现，可能将计划中的滚动部署变成服务中断。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The <a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-versioning/grain-versioning/\">interface versioning guide</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/migration/deployment-and-rollback/\">deployment and rollback guidance</a> cover configuration and rollout procedures. This runtime decision chain connects interface manifests, compatibility selection, placement, activation validation, and wire compatibility.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-versioning/grain-versioning/\"> 接口版本控制指南 </a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/migration/deployment-and-rollback/\"> 部署与回滚指导 </a> 介绍配置和逐步部署流程。这条运行时决策链将接口清单、兼容性选择、放置、激活实例验证和通信兼容性连接起来。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"24f304eb9d524e58-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Manifest/GrainVersionManifest.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>GrainVersionManifest</code></a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Versions/CachedVersionSelectorManager.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>CachedVersionSelectorManager</code></a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Versions/Selector/AllCompatibleVersionsSelector.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>AllCompatibleVersionsSelector</code></a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Catalog/ActivationData.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>ActivationData</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>源码： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Manifest/GrainVersionManifest.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>GrainVersionManifest</code> </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Versions/CachedVersionSelectorManager.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>CachedVersionSelectorManager</code> </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Versions/Selector/AllCompatibleVersionsSelector.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>AllCompatibleVersionsSelector</code> </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Catalog/ActivationData.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>ActivationData</code> </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"c931bd92b33eb627":{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627","title":"Runtime architecture","titleZh":"运行时架构","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/runtime-architecture/","sourceHash":"1242d41b5c64db1d259578a781920e129831f4b219e35bccafa0e61050007c68","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Runtime architecture</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">运行时架构</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans presents a location-transparent grain reference, an abstraction introduced in the <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/publication/orleans-distributed-virtual-actors-for-programmability-and-scalability/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Orleans virtual actor research paper</a>, but the runtime implements each call using several independently replaceable or failure-aware subsystems. The central invariant is that a grain identity is stable while its activation location is temporary.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 提供位置透明的 Grain 引用，这一抽象最早在 <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/publication/orleans-distributed-virtual-actors-for-programmability-and-scalability/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Orleans 虚拟 Actor 研究论文 </a> 中提出；运行时则通过多个可以独立替换或能够处理故障的子系统实现每次调用。核心不变式是：Grain 身份稳定，而其激活位置是临时的。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-2","type":"diagram","en":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"3df3d8d581ec3d6aefa6631fff7562c98674fb076ed8d51ac90d1aed70e5e17f\" data-diagram-language=\"en\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rendering diagram…\">Rendering diagram…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>Original Mermaid source</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart LR\n    App[Application code] --&gt; Proxy[Generated grain proxy]\n    Proxy --&gt; GRef[GrainReferenceRuntime]\n    GRef --&gt; Client[OutsideRuntimeClient]\n    Client --&gt; Gateway[Client gateway]\n    Gateway --&gt; MC[MessageCenter]\n    MC --&gt; Directory[Grain locator and directory]\n    Directory --&gt; Placement[Placement service]\n    Placement --&gt; Catalog[Catalog and ActivationData]\n    Catalog --&gt; Scheduler[WorkItemGroup scheduler]\n    Scheduler --&gt; Grain[Grain method]\n    Grain --&gt; MC\n    MC --&gt; Client</code></pre></details></figure>","zh":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"3df3d8d581ec3d6aefa6631fff7562c98674fb076ed8d51ac90d1aed70e5e17f\" data-diagram-language=\"zh\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正在绘制图表…\">正在绘制图表…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看原始 Mermaid 图表代码</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart LR\n    App[Application code] --&gt; Proxy[Generated grain proxy]\n    Proxy --&gt; GRef[GrainReferenceRuntime]\n    GRef --&gt; Client[OutsideRuntimeClient]\n    Client --&gt; Gateway[Client gateway]\n    Gateway --&gt; MC[MessageCenter]\n    MC --&gt; Directory[Grain locator and directory]\n    Directory --&gt; Placement[Placement service]\n    Placement --&gt; Catalog[Catalog and ActivationData]\n    Catalog --&gt; Scheduler[WorkItemGroup scheduler]\n    Scheduler --&gt; Grain[Grain method]\n    Grain --&gt; MC\n    MC --&gt; Client</code></pre></details></figure>","diagram":"3df3d8d581ec3d6aefa6631fff7562c98674fb076ed8d51ac90d1aed70e5e17f","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-3","type":"heading","anchor":"host-composition","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"host-composition\">Host composition</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"host-composition\">宿主组成</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>A silo is a <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/extensions/generic-host\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">.NET Generic Host</a> with Orleans services registered through <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/extensions/dependency-injection/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">.NET dependency injection</a>. <code>SiloHostedService</code> starts and stops <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.silo/\">Silo</a>, which drives the ordered silo lifecycle. The default registration set composes:</p>","zh":"<p>Silo 是一个通过 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/extensions/dependency-injection/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> .NET 依赖注入 </a> 注册 Orleans 服务的 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/extensions/generic-host\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> .NET 通用宿主 </a> 。 <code>SiloHostedService</code> 启动和停止 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.silo/\"> Silo </a> ，后者驱动有序的 Silo 生命周期。默认服务注册由以下部分组成：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-5","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li><code>MessageCenter</code> for network connections, routing, forwarding, gateways, and dispatch.</li>\n<li><code>MembershipTableManager</code>, <code>MembershipAgent</code>, <code>ClusterHealthMonitor</code>, and <code>ClusterMembershipService</code> for membership.</li>\n<li><code>DistributedGrainDirectory</code>, <code>GrainLocator</code>, and <code>CachedGrainLocator</code> for activation location.</li>\n<li><code>PlacementService</code> and keyed placement directors for new activation selection.</li>\n<li><code>ActivationDirectory</code>, <code>Catalog</code>, <code>ActivationData</code>, and <code>ActivationCollector</code> for local activation ownership.</li>\n<li><code>InsideRuntimeClient</code> for invoking local targets and producing responses.</li>\n<li><code>DeploymentLoadPublisher</code> and environment statistics for placement and overload decisions.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li><code>MessageCenter</code> ，负责网络连接、路由、转发、网关和派发。</li>\n<li><code>MembershipTableManager</code> 、 <code>MembershipAgent</code> 、 <code>ClusterHealthMonitor</code> 和 <code>ClusterMembershipService</code> ，负责成员管理。</li>\n<li><code>DistributedGrainDirectory</code> 、 <code>GrainLocator</code> 和 <code>CachedGrainLocator</code> ，负责定位激活实例。</li>\n<li><code>PlacementService</code> 和按键注册的放置决策器，负责为新激活实例选择位置。</li>\n<li><code>ActivationDirectory</code> 、 <code>Catalog</code> 、 <code>ActivationData</code> 和 <code>ActivationCollector</code> ，负责管理本地激活实例。</li>\n<li><code>InsideRuntimeClient</code> ，负责调用本地目标并生成响应。</li>\n<li><code>DeploymentLoadPublisher</code> 和环境统计信息，用于放置和过载决策。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>See <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Hosting/DefaultSiloServices.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>DefaultSiloServices</code></a> for the composition root and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.silo/\">Silo</a> plus its <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Silo/Silo.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">implementation</a> for lifecycle orchestration.</p>","zh":"<p>组合根请参阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Hosting/DefaultSiloServices.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>DefaultSiloServices</code> </a> ；生命周期编排请参阅 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.runtime.silo/\"> Silo </a> 及其 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Silo/Silo.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 实现 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>An external client has no activation catalog or placement service. <code>ClusterClient</code> starts an <code>OutsideRuntimeClient</code>, discovers gateways, maintains gateway connections, and sends requests through a client <code>MessageCenter</code>. A silo also embeds a runtime client, but its <code>InsideRuntimeClient</code> can dispatch directly to local activations and system targets.</p>","zh":"<p>外部客户端不具有激活实例目录或放置服务。 <code>ClusterClient</code> 启动 <code>OutsideRuntimeClient</code> ，发现网关、维护网关连接，并通过客户端的 <code>MessageCenter</code> 发送请求。Silo 也内嵌运行时客户端，但其 <code>InsideRuntimeClient</code> 可以直接派发到本地激活实例和系统目标。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-8","type":"heading","anchor":"a-request-through-the-runtime","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"a-request-through-the-runtime\">A request through the runtime</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"a-request-through-the-runtime\">请求如何经过运行时</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-9","type":"list","en":"<ol>\n<li>The source generator emits a proxy method and an invokable request type for each grain interface method.</li>\n<li>The proxy passes the invokable to <code>GrainReferenceRuntime</code>. Outgoing call filters can inspect or replace the invocation.</li>\n<li>The runtime creates a <code>Message</code>, assigns its correlation identity and target grain, registers a response callback, and sends it through <code>MessageCenter</code>.</li>\n<li>A client sends through a gateway. A silo can route directly to the target silo when the activation address is known.</li>\n<li>The receiving <code>MessageCenter</code> resolves the activation address. A cache hit can avoid a directory round trip. A stale address can be invalidated and rerouted.</li>\n<li>If no activation exists, the directory and <code>PlacementService</code> coordinate creation on a compatible silo.</li>\n<li><code>Catalog</code> creates an <code>ActivationData</code>; activation runs before queued application requests are dispatched.</li>\n<li><code>ActivationData</code> places the request on the activation scheduler. Incoming call filters and the generated invoker execute the grain method.</li>\n<li><code>InsideRuntimeClient</code> creates a response or rejection. The response follows the original correlation identity to the waiting callback.</li>\n</ol>","zh":"<ol>\n<li>源代码生成器为每个 Grain 接口方法生成一个代理方法和一个可调用请求类型。</li>\n<li>代理将可调用请求传给 <code>GrainReferenceRuntime</code> 。传出调用筛选器可以检查或替换该调用。</li>\n<li>运行时创建 <code>Message</code> ，分配其关联身份和目标 Grain，注册响应回调，然后通过 <code>MessageCenter</code> 发送。</li>\n<li>客户端通过网关发送。Silo 在知道激活实例地址时，可以直接路由到目标 Silo。</li>\n<li>接收端的 <code>MessageCenter</code> 解析激活实例地址。缓存命中可以避免一次目录往返。过期地址可以被标记为无效，并重新路由。</li>\n<li>如果不存在激活实例，目录与 <code>PlacementService</code> 会协调在兼容的 Silo 上创建它。</li>\n<li><code>Catalog</code> 创建 <code>ActivationData</code> ；在派发队列中的应用请求之前，先执行激活过程。</li>\n<li><code>ActivationData</code> 将请求交给激活实例调度器。传入调用筛选器和生成的调用器执行 Grain 方法。</li>\n<li><code>InsideRuntimeClient</code> 创建响应或拒绝结果。响应根据原始关联身份返回等待中的回调。</li>\n</ol>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The relevant implementations are <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Runtime/GrainReferenceRuntime.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>GrainReferenceRuntime</code></a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Runtime/OutsideRuntimeClient.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>OutsideRuntimeClient</code></a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Messaging/MessageCenter.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>MessageCenter</code></a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Catalog/Catalog.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>Catalog</code></a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Core/InsideRuntimeClient.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>InsideRuntimeClient</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>相关实现包括 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Runtime/GrainReferenceRuntime.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>GrainReferenceRuntime</code> </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Core/Runtime/OutsideRuntimeClient.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>OutsideRuntimeClient</code> </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Messaging/MessageCenter.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>MessageCenter</code> </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Catalog/Catalog.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>Catalog</code> </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Core/InsideRuntimeClient.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>InsideRuntimeClient</code> </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-11","type":"heading","anchor":"system-targets","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"system-targets\">System targets</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"system-targets\">系统目标</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>System targets are addressable runtime components which use Orleans messaging and single-threaded scheduling without virtual activation. The runtime constructs them at explicit silo addresses. Membership services, persistent stream pulling agents, and activation balancing protocols use system targets because they need the messaging and scheduling model but must not be location-transparent virtual actors.</p>","zh":"<p>系统目标是可寻址的运行时组件，使用 Orleans 消息和单线程调度，但不进行虚拟激活。运行时在明确的 Silo 地址上构造它们。成员管理服务、持久化流拉取代理和激活实例平衡协议使用系统目标，因为它们需要消息与调度模型，却不能成为位置透明的虚拟 Actor。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-13","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Unlike a grain, a system target:</p>","zh":"<p>与 Grain 不同，系统目标：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-14","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>has a concrete silo location;</li>\n<li>is created and registered by runtime code;</li>\n<li>is not activated by placement or grain-directory lookup; and</li>\n<li>participates in runtime lifecycle rather than application grain lifecycle.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>具有具体的 Silo 位置；</li>\n<li>由运行时代码创建和注册；</li>\n<li>不会因放置或 Grain 目录查找而激活；并且</li>\n<li>参与运行时生命周期，而不是应用 Grain 生命周期。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-15","type":"heading","anchor":"consistency-boundaries","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"consistency-boundaries\">Consistency boundaries</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"consistency-boundaries\">一致性边界</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans does not implement one global transaction across these subsystems. Each boundary has a narrower contract:</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 不会在这些子系统之间实现一个全局事务。每个边界的协定都更有限：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-17","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>The membership table serializes membership updates into monotonically ordered views.</li>\n<li>The directory coordinates a grain identity with an activation address and repairs stale registrations.</li>\n<li>The activation scheduler serializes synchronous work items for one activation.</li>\n<li>Messaging correlates a request with a response but cannot infer whether a timed-out request executed.</li>\n<li>Persistence and streams define their own durability and acknowledgement points.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>成员表将成员更新串行化为单调有序的视图。</li>\n<li>目录协调 Grain 身份与激活实例地址之间的关系，并修复过期注册。</li>\n<li>激活实例调度器将单个激活实例的同步工作项串行执行。</li>\n<li>消息机制将请求与响应关联起来，但无法推断超时请求是否执行过。</li>\n<li>持久化和流各自定义其持久性和确认点。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Understanding those boundaries is essential when extending the runtime. A custom directory changes location consistency, not membership. A placement director chooses where a new activation starts, not how calls are scheduled. A stream adapter defines queue acknowledgement, not grain-call exactly-once semantics.</p>","zh":"<p>扩展运行时时，理解这些边界至关重要。自定义目录改变的是位置一致性，而不是成员管理。放置决策器选择新激活实例在哪里启动，而不是如何调度调用。流适配器定义队列确认行为，而不是 Grain 调用的恰好一次语义。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-19","type":"heading","anchor":"public-extension-surfaces","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"public-extension-surfaces\">Public extension surfaces</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"public-extension-surfaces\">公共扩展接口</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-20","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Prefer supported extension points over replacing internal runtime types:</p>","zh":"<p>应优先使用受支持的扩展点，而不是替换内部运行时类型：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-21","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.runtime.placement.iplacementdirector/\">IPlacementDirector</a> and placement filters customize candidate selection.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.graindirectory.igraindirectory/\">IGrainDirectory</a> supplies a named grain directory.</li>\n<li>serializer codecs, copiers, activators, and converters extend wire handling.</li>\n<li>stream queue adapters, mappers, balancers, caches, and failure handlers extend persistent streams.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.providers.iproviderbuilder-1/\">IProviderBuilder&lt;T&gt;</a> integrates configuration-driven providers.</li>\n<li>lifecycle participants order provider startup and shutdown.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.runtime.placement.iplacementdirector/\">IPlacementDirector</a> 和放置筛选器用于自定义候选选择。</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.graindirectory.igraindirectory/\">IGrainDirectory</a> 提供命名 Grain 目录。</li>\n<li>序列化编解码器、复制器、激活器和转换器用于扩展通信数据处理。</li>\n<li>流队列适配器、映射器、平衡器、缓存和失败处理器用于扩展持久化流。</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.providers.iproviderbuilder-1/\">IProviderBuilder&lt;T&gt;</a> 集成由配置驱动的提供程序。</li>\n<li>生命周期参与者安排提供程序启动和关闭的顺序。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"c931bd92b33eb627-22","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Internal names and algorithms are not compatibility guarantees. Public APIs, analyzer warnings, and documented wire identities are the compatibility boundaries.</p>","zh":"<p>内部名称和算法不是兼容性保证。公共 API、分析器警告以及文档化的通信身份，才是兼容性边界。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"d3e22320744daca0":{"id":"d3e22320744daca0","title":"Scheduling and turn execution","titleZh":"调度与执行轮次","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/scheduler/","sourceHash":"5feaa942e6198a7bccd9fb4acd8d1f27600f5fd668545013def2d2ff88d80197","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Scheduling and turn execution</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">调度与执行轮次</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans separates <strong>request scheduling</strong> from <strong>task scheduling</strong>:</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 将 <strong> 请求调度 </strong> 与 <strong> 任务调度 </strong> 分开：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-2","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>request scheduling decides which incoming calls may make progress for an activation;</li>\n<li>task scheduling executes each synchronous work item one at a time in that activation’s context.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>请求调度决定哪些传入调用可以在某个激活实例上向前推进；</li>\n<li>任务调度在该激活实例的上下文中，一次执行一个同步工作项。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>This distinction explains how reentrant calls can interleave without two pieces of grain code running in parallel on the same activation.</p>","zh":"<p>这一区别解释了为什么可重入调用能够交错执行，同时不会有两段 Grain 代码在同一激活实例上并行运行。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-4","type":"heading","anchor":"workitemgroup-and-activationtaskscheduler-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"workitemgroup-and-activationtaskscheduler-\"><code>WorkItemGroup</code> and <code>ActivationTaskScheduler</code> <span id=\"task-scheduling\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"workitemgroup-and-activationtaskscheduler-\"><code>WorkItemGroup</code> 与 <code>ActivationTaskScheduler</code> <span id=\"task-scheduling\"> </span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Each activation owns a <code>WorkItemGroup</code> and an <code>ActivationTaskScheduler</code>, which derives from the .NET <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.tasks.taskscheduler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TaskScheduler</a> abstraction. The task scheduler enqueues work into the group. The group implements a small state machine (<code>Waiting</code>, <code>Runnable</code>, and <code>Running</code>) and schedules itself onto the <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/standard/threading/the-managed-thread-pool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">.NET managed thread pool</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>每个激活实例都拥有一个 <code>WorkItemGroup</code> 和一个 <code>ActivationTaskScheduler</code> ，后者派生自 .NET 的 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.tasks.taskscheduler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> TaskScheduler </a> 抽象。任务调度器将工作加入该工作项组的队列。工作项组实现了一个小型状态机，包括 <code>Waiting</code> 、 <code>Runnable</code> 和 <code>Running</code> ，并将自身调度到 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/standard/threading/the-managed-thread-pool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> .NET 托管线程池 </a> 上。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-6","type":"diagram","en":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"63dc8b20fbea3b78ca220375deef47b7ac9123ce5283cc3e4105babaaa7b67f0\" data-diagram-language=\"en\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rendering diagram…\">Rendering diagram…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>Original Mermaid source</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart LR\n    Request[Admitted request]\n    Continuation[Async continuation]\n    Scheduler[ActivationTaskScheduler]\n    Queue[WorkItemGroup queue]\n    Pool[.NET thread pool]\n    Turn[One synchronous turn]\n\n    Request --&gt; Scheduler\n    Continuation --&gt; Scheduler\n    Scheduler --&gt; Queue\n    Queue --&gt; Pool\n    Pool --&gt; Turn\n    Turn --&gt;|more queued work| Pool</code></pre></details></figure>","zh":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"63dc8b20fbea3b78ca220375deef47b7ac9123ce5283cc3e4105babaaa7b67f0\" data-diagram-language=\"zh\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正在绘制图表…\">正在绘制图表…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看原始 Mermaid 图表代码</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart LR\n    Request[Admitted request]\n    Continuation[Async continuation]\n    Scheduler[ActivationTaskScheduler]\n    Queue[WorkItemGroup queue]\n    Pool[.NET thread pool]\n    Turn[One synchronous turn]\n\n    Request --&gt; Scheduler\n    Continuation --&gt; Scheduler\n    Scheduler --&gt; Queue\n    Queue --&gt; Pool\n    Pool --&gt; Turn\n    Turn --&gt;|more queued work| Pool</code></pre></details></figure>","diagram":"63dc8b20fbea3b78ca220375deef47b7ac9123ce5283cc3e4105babaaa7b67f0","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Only one thread can execute a <code>WorkItemGroup</code> at a time. That thread is not permanently assigned: different turns can run on different pool threads. The invariant is exclusive execution of the activation context, not thread affinity.</p>","zh":"<p>同一时刻，只有一个线程能够执行某个 <code>WorkItemGroup</code> 。该线程不是永久绑定的：不同执行轮次可以运行在不同的线程池线程上。所保证的不变式是激活实例上下文的独占执行，而不是线程亲和性。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Scheduler/WorkItemGroup.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>WorkItemGroup</code></a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Scheduler/ActivationTaskScheduler.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>ActivationTaskScheduler</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>源码： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Scheduler/WorkItemGroup.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>WorkItemGroup</code> </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Runtime/Scheduler/ActivationTaskScheduler.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>ActivationTaskScheduler</code> </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-9","type":"heading","anchor":"async-methods-become-multiple-turns","level":2,"en":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"task-scheduling-in-orleans\"></span><h2 id=\"async-methods-become-multiple-turns\">Async methods become multiple turns</h2>","zh":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"task-scheduling-in-orleans\"></span><h2 id=\"async-methods-become-multiple-turns\">异步方法会拆分为多个执行轮次</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>An async grain method runs synchronously until it awaits incomplete work. Its continuation is later queued back to the same activation scheduler. Code before the incomplete await executes in one turn; code after it executes in a later turn.</p>","zh":"<p>异步 Grain 方法会同步运行，直到等待尚未完成的工作。其后续执行部分稍后会重新加入同一个激活实例调度器的队列。在未完成的 await 之前的代码在一个执行轮次中运行，之后的代码则在较后的执行轮次中运行。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For a non-reentrant activation, other application requests normally wait while this request is incomplete. For reentrant or selectively interleavable calls, another request can run during the await. It still runs as a separate synchronous turn; it does not execute in parallel with either portion of the awaiting method.</p>","zh":"<p>对于非重入激活实例，在该请求尚未完成时，其他应用请求通常会等待。对于可重入或允许选择性交错的调用，另一个请求可以在 await 期间运行。但它仍然作为单独的同步执行轮次运行，不会与正在等待的方法前后任何一段代码并行执行。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Therefore, grain state is protected from parallel access by the scheduler but can still change across an <code>await</code> when interleaving is allowed. Code must recheck assumptions after awaits in reentrant grains.</p>","zh":"<p>因此，调度器保护 Grain 状态免受并行访问，但允许交错执行时，状态仍可能在一次 <code>await</code> 前后发生变化。可重入 Grain 中的代码必须在等待之后重新检查假设。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-13","type":"heading","anchor":"request-admission","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"request-admission\">Request admission</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"request-admission\">请求接纳</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><code>ActivationData</code> owns pending and running requests. It applies the grain’s concurrency policy, dispatches eligible messages, and signals completion so that another request can progress. Policies include:</p>","zh":"<p><code>ActivationData</code> 管理待处理和正在运行的请求。它应用 Grain 的并发策略，派发符合条件的消息，并在完成时发出信号，使另一个请求能够向前推进。策略包括：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-15","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>the default non-reentrant model;</li>\n<li>grain-wide reentrancy;</li>\n<li>call-chain reentrancy;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.alwaysinterleaveattribute/\">AlwaysInterleaveAttribute</a>; and</li>\n<li>predicate-based <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.mayinterleaveattribute/\">MayInterleaveAttribute</a>.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>默认的非重入模型；</li>\n<li>整个 Grain 范围的重入；</li>\n<li>调用链重入；</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.alwaysinterleaveattribute/\">AlwaysInterleaveAttribute</a> ；以及</li>\n<li>基于谓词的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.mayinterleaveattribute/\">MayInterleaveAttribute</a> 。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The user-facing rules are documented in <a href=\"#/docs/grains/request-scheduling/\">request scheduling</a>. Internally, request admission and task serialization remain separate layers.</p>","zh":"<p>面向用户的规则记录在 <a href=\"#/docs/grains/request-scheduling/\"> 请求调度 </a> 中。在内部，请求接纳与任务串行执行仍然是不同的层。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Admission is a state machine layered over the activation scheduler and shared thread pool. <code>ActivationData</code> keeps pending requests and running requests, evaluates an incoming request against every active request, and starts it when every pair is compatible under the current interleaving policy. Completion signals admission to reevaluate the queue. A request which is waiting on an incomplete task therefore occupies a logical slot according to the request policy, while its executing thread returns to the pool.</p>","zh":"<p>请求接纳是建立在激活实例调度器和共享线程池之上的状态机。 <code>ActivationData</code> 保存待处理请求和正在运行的请求，将传入请求与每个活跃请求进行比较，并在当前交错策略下每一对请求都兼容时启动它。请求完成会通知接纳逻辑重新评估队列。因此，等待未完成任务的请求仍会按照请求策略占据一个逻辑位置，而执行它的线程已经返回线程池。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Call-chain reentrancy is narrower than grain-wide reentrancy: it permits progress for calls which belong to the current chain while preserving the non-interleaving default for unrelated calls. <code>AlwaysInterleave</code> and <code>MayInterleave</code> are explicit opt-ins because they trade simpler invariants for throughput or avoidance of dependency cycles.</p>","zh":"<p>调用链重入的范围小于整个 Grain 的重入：它允许属于当前调用链的调用继续推进，同时对无关调用保留默认的不交错行为。 <code>AlwaysInterleave</code> 和 <code>MayInterleave</code> 都必须显式启用，因为它们以更复杂的不变式换取吞吐量，或避免依赖循环。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-19","type":"heading","anchor":"runtime-context-and-inline-execution","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"runtime-context-and-inline-execution\">Runtime context and inline execution</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"runtime-context-and-inline-execution\">运行时上下文与内联执行</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-20","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><code>ActivationTaskScheduler.TryExecuteTaskInline</code> permits inline execution only when the current <code>RuntimeContext</code> belongs to the same <code>WorkItemGroup</code> and the task was not already queued. Runtime helpers follow the same rule: execute inline in the matching grain context, otherwise enqueue.</p>","zh":"<p>只有当前 <code>RuntimeContext</code> 属于同一个 <code>WorkItemGroup</code> ，并且任务尚未入队时， <code>ActivationTaskScheduler.TryExecuteTaskInline</code> 才允许内联执行。运行时辅助方法遵循相同规则：在匹配的 Grain 上下文中直接内联执行，否则入队。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-21","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>This prevents a continuation or runtime callback from bypassing activation isolation simply because it originated on a thread which is already processing Orleans work.</p>","zh":"<p>这可以防止后续执行部分或运行时回调，仅仅因为来自一个已经在处理 Orleans 工作的线程，就绕过激活实例隔离。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-22","type":"heading","anchor":"blocking-and-escaping-the-scheduler","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"blocking-and-escaping-the-scheduler\">Blocking and escaping the scheduler</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"blocking-and-escaping-the-scheduler\">阻塞与脱离调度器</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-23","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Blocking a turn prevents every queued continuation and admitted request for that activation from progressing. Sync-over-async can deadlock when the awaited completion needs the same activation scheduler.</p>","zh":"<p>阻塞一个执行轮次，会阻止该激活实例队列中的所有后续执行部分，以及已接纳的请求继续推进。如果所等待的完成工作需要同一个激活实例调度器，同步等待异步操作就可能导致死锁。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-24","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.tasks.task.run\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Run</a> executes outside the activation scheduler. It can be useful for isolated CPU work, but code running there must not directly access mutable grain state or assume <code>RuntimeContext.Current</code> is the activation. Return immutable results and apply them in a scheduled continuation.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.tasks.task.run\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Run </a> 在激活实例调度器之外执行。它适合隔离的 CPU 工作，但在那里运行的代码不得直接访问可变的 Grain 状态，也不得假定 <code>RuntimeContext.Current</code> 就是当前激活实例。应返回不可变结果，并在由调度器安排的后续执行部分中应用它们。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-25","type":"heading","anchor":"fairness-and-diagnostics","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"fairness-and-diagnostics\">Fairness and diagnostics</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"fairness-and-diagnostics\">公平性与诊断</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-26","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><code>WorkItemGroup</code> drains work subject to runtime scheduling limits so one busy activation does not permanently own a thread-pool worker. Long synchronous turns still delay other work and are reported by runtime scheduling diagnostics. The <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/diagnostics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">.NET diagnostics tools</a> provide the underlying runtime traces, counters, and dumps used alongside Orleans telemetry.</p>","zh":"<p><code>WorkItemGroup</code> 在运行时调度限制内处理队列中的工作，避免一个繁忙的激活实例永久占用线程池工作线程。长时间的同步执行轮次仍然会延迟其他工作，运行时调度诊断会报告它们。 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/diagnostics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> .NET 诊断工具 </a> 提供底层运行时跟踪、计数器和转储，可与 Orleans 遥测配合使用。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-27","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Scheduling guarantees are local to an activation. They do not order calls across grains, create a distributed lock, or provide message exactly-once behavior.</p>","zh":"<p>调度保证仅限于单个激活实例。它不会为跨 Grain 调用排序，不会创建分布式锁，也不会提供消息恰好一次的行为。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"d3e22320744daca0-28","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Activations compete on the process-wide thread pool. A long synchronous turn consumes a worker and delays that activation’s requests; a burst of work across many activations increases that competition. Queue length and turn-duration diagnostics indicate capacity pressure and require additional evidence to diagnose deadlock.</p>","zh":"<p>各激活实例在进程共享的线程池上竞争。长时间的同步执行轮次会占用一个工作线程，并延迟该激活实例的请求；大量激活实例同时出现突发工作，会增加这种竞争。队列长度和执行轮次持续时间诊断能够表明容量压力，但要诊断死锁还需要额外证据。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"7ebe178e9cfab505":{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505","title":"Serialization and code generation internals","titleZh":"序列化与代码生成内部机制","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/serialization/","sourceHash":"bde9de8f04ca637ca45d33f191fbbadc6a55f48c03d39b529b1dadbf3cb28839","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Serialization and code generation internals</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">序列化与代码生成内部机制</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans serialization serves two related pipelines:</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 序列化服务于两条相关管道：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-2","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>value serialization, deep copying, and activation for message and storage payloads;</li>\n<li>RPC code generation for grain references, request objects, dispatch, and responses.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>针对消息和存储负载的值序列化、深复制和实例创建；</li>\n<li>针对 Grain 引用、请求对象、派发和响应的 RPC 代码生成。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Most application code uses generated components. Reflection-based discovery is deliberately not the default architecture: generated manifests make the participating types explicit and keep runtime dispatch compatible with <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/deploying/trimming/prepare-libraries-for-trimming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">trimming</a> and ahead-of-time compilation.</p>","zh":"<p>大多数应用代码使用生成的组件。默认架构有意不采用基于反射的发现机制：生成的清单明确列出参与的类型，使运行时派发能够兼容 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/deploying/trimming/prepare-libraries-for-trimming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 裁剪 </a> 和提前编译。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-4","type":"heading","anchor":"incremental-generator-pipeline","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"incremental-generator-pipeline\">Incremental generator pipeline</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"incremental-generator-pipeline\">增量生成器管道</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The Orleans source generator is a <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/csharp/roslyn-sdk/#source-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Roslyn source generator</a> implemented using the incremental generator APIs. It discovers types marked with <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generateserializerattribute/\">GenerateSerializerAttribute</a> and interfaces marked directly or transitively with <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generatemethodserializersattribute/\">GenerateMethodSerializersAttribute</a>. It also reads metadata emitted by referenced assemblies.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 源代码生成器是使用增量生成器 API 实现的 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/csharp/roslyn-sdk/#source-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Roslyn 源代码生成器 </a> 。它发现标有 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generateserializerattribute/\">GenerateSerializerAttribute</a> 的类型，以及直接或间接标有 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generatemethodserializersattribute/\">GenerateMethodSerializersAttribute</a> 的接口。它还读取被引用程序集生成的元数据。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-6","type":"diagram","en":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"e42e437973f5f4baa3c99858c14b399822fc1d74bdb5baca37f42c327dae486f\" data-diagram-language=\"en\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rendering diagram…\">Rendering diagram…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>Original Mermaid source</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart LR\n    Source[C# source and attributes]\n    Refs[Referenced assembly manifests]\n    Models[Serializable and proxy models]\n    Codecs[Field codecs, serializers, copiers, activators]\n    RPC[Proxy and invokable request types]\n    Manifest[Assembly type manifest provider]\n    Runtime[CodecProvider and GrainReferenceRuntime]\n\n    Source --&gt; Models\n    Refs --&gt; Models\n    Models --&gt; Codecs\n    Models --&gt; RPC\n    Models --&gt; Manifest\n    Codecs --&gt; Runtime\n    RPC --&gt; Runtime\n    Manifest --&gt; Runtime</code></pre></details></figure>","zh":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"e42e437973f5f4baa3c99858c14b399822fc1d74bdb5baca37f42c327dae486f\" data-diagram-language=\"zh\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正在绘制图表…\">正在绘制图表…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看原始 Mermaid 图表代码</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart LR\n    Source[C# source and attributes]\n    Refs[Referenced assembly manifests]\n    Models[Serializable and proxy models]\n    Codecs[Field codecs, serializers, copiers, activators]\n    RPC[Proxy and invokable request types]\n    Manifest[Assembly type manifest provider]\n    Runtime[CodecProvider and GrainReferenceRuntime]\n\n    Source --&gt; Models\n    Refs --&gt; Models\n    Models --&gt; Codecs\n    Models --&gt; RPC\n    Models --&gt; Manifest\n    Codecs --&gt; Runtime\n    RPC --&gt; Runtime\n    Manifest --&gt; Runtime</code></pre></details></figure>","diagram":"e42e437973f5f4baa3c99858c14b399822fc1d74bdb5baca37f42c327dae486f","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Generated output includes serializers, field codecs, deep copiers, activators, grain proxies, invokable method objects, dispatch metadata, aliases, and a type-manifest provider. Diagnostics reject inaccessible types, ambiguous field identity, unsupported RPC shapes, and missing cross-assembly generation metadata before the application starts.</p>","zh":"<p>生成的输出包括序列化器、字段编解码器、深复制器、激活器、Grain 代理、可调用方法对象、派发元数据、别名和类型清单提供程序。诊断会在应用启动之前，拒绝不可访问的类型、有歧义的字段身份、不受支持的 RPC 形式，以及缺失的跨程序集生成元数据。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.CodeGenerator/OrleansSourceGenerator.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>OrleansSourceGenerator</code></a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.CodeGenerator/ReferenceAssemblyDataProvider.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>ReferenceAssemblyDataProvider</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>源码： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.CodeGenerator/OrleansSourceGenerator.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>OrleansSourceGenerator</code> </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.CodeGenerator/ReferenceAssemblyDataProvider.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>ReferenceAssemblyDataProvider</code> </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-9","type":"heading","anchor":"field-identity-is-the-wire-contract","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"field-identity-is-the-wire-contract\">Field identity is the wire contract</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"field-identity-is-the-wire-contract\">字段身份就是通信协定</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a> identifies a serialized member within its declaring type. IDs are not field order and must remain stable as source is edited.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a> 在成员的声明类型内标识一个序列化成员。ID 并非字段顺序，修改源码时必须保持稳定。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For example, <code>[Id(0)]</code> and <code>[Id(1)]</code> identify two different members. Adding a new ID is compatible with readers which tolerate an omitted field. Reusing or renumbering an existing ID changes the meaning of bytes on the wire and can corrupt rolling upgrades or persisted data.</p>","zh":"<p>例如， <code>[Id(0)]</code> 和 <code>[Id(1)]</code> 标识两个不同的成员。对于能够容忍字段缺省的读取器，添加新 ID 是兼容的。复用现有 ID 或对其重新编号，会改变通信中字节的含义，并可能破坏滚动升级或持久化数据。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generateserializerattribute/properties/\">GenerateSerializerAttribute.GenerateFieldIds</a> defaults to <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generatefieldids/::fields\">GenerateFieldIds.None</a>. Automatic public-property IDs are available, but explicit IDs make compatibility review visible. Primary constructor parameters are included by default for records and excluded by default for other types.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generateserializerattribute/properties/\">GenerateSerializerAttribute.GenerateFieldIds</a> 默认为 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generatefieldids/::fields\">GenerateFieldIds.None</a> 。可以为公共属性自动生成 ID，但显式 ID 使兼容性审查更直观。对于记录类型，默认包含主构造函数参数；对于其他类型，默认不包含。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-13","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Aliases provide stable type identity when CLR names move. A type alias must remain unique in the manifest. Generic and compound aliases are resolved through the manifest’s alias tree.</p>","zh":"<p>当 CLR 名称迁移时，别名提供稳定的类型身份。类型别名必须在清单中保持唯一。泛型别名和复合别名通过清单的别名树解析。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-14","type":"heading","anchor":"writer-and-reader-sessions","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"writer-and-reader-sessions\">Writer and reader sessions</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"writer-and-reader-sessions\">写入器与读取器会话</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The wire protocol uses writer and reader sessions to track references and type information across a payload. Reference tracking preserves object identity and cycles. A field codec writes field headers and values; the matching codec reads or skips fields it understands.</p>","zh":"<p>通信协议使用写入器和读取器会话，在整个负载中跟踪引用和类型信息。引用跟踪保留对象身份和循环引用。字段编解码器写入字段头和值；与之匹配的编解码器读取或跳过它所理解的字段。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Deep copying is a separate operation used when Orleans must preserve isolation without crossing a transport boundary. Immutable values can bypass copying; mutable values require a generated or custom copier. Declaring a mutable type immutable trades safety for speed and must be justified by the type’s actual behavior.</p>","zh":"<p>深复制是一项独立操作，用于 Orleans 必须保持隔离、却无需跨越传输边界的场景。不可变值可以跳过复制；可变值需要生成的或自定义的复制器。将可变类型声明为不可变，是以安全性换取速度，必须有该类型的实际行为作为依据。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Field headers carry an ID and wire type, so readers can consume fields in a different source order. Generated readers dispatch known IDs and call <code>ConsumeUnknownField</code> for fields introduced by a newer writer. Additive evolution preserves wire types and stable IDs; changing either assigns incompatible meaning to existing payloads.</p>","zh":"<p>字段头携带 ID 和通信类型，因此，读取器可以按照不同于源码顺序的次序读取字段。生成的读取器对已知 ID 进行派发，并对较新写入器引入的字段调用 <code>ConsumeUnknownField</code> 。增量扩展必须保持通信类型和稳定 ID；更改其中任一项，都会为现有负载赋予不兼容的含义。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Reference tracking is scoped to a writer/reader session and preserves repeated references and cycles within one payload. Applications own identity and request deduplication across calls and retries. A deep copier uses a corresponding session so a copied graph has the same aliasing relationships as the serialized graph.</p>","zh":"<p>引用跟踪的作用域是一个写入器／读取器会话，用于保留单个负载内的重复引用和循环引用。跨调用和重试的身份管理与请求去重由应用负责。深复制器使用相应的会话，使复制后的对象图与序列化对象图具有相同的引用别名关系。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-19","type":"heading","anchor":"serialization-constructor-initialization","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"serialization-constructor-initialization\">Serialization constructor initialization</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"serialization-constructor-initialization\">序列化构造函数初始化</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-20","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.runtime.serialization.iserializable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ISerializable</a> reference types, deserialization allocates an uninitialized object and records it in the reader session before reading its fields. The serialization constructor initializes that same object, so references read from the payload resolve to the final instance, including cycles. <code>OnDeserializing</code> runs before constructor initialization; <code>OnDeserialized</code> and <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.runtime.serialization.ideserializationcallback.ondeserialization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OnDeserialization</a> run afterward.</p>","zh":"<p>对于 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.runtime.serialization.iserializable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> ISerializable </a> 引用类型，反序列化会先分配一个未初始化的对象，在读取其字段之前将其记录到读取器会话中。序列化构造函数初始化同一个对象，因此，从负载中读取的引用会解析到最终实例，循环引用也包括在内。 <code>OnDeserializing</code> 在构造函数初始化之前运行； <code>OnDeserialized</code> 和 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.runtime.serialization.ideserializationcallback.ondeserialization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> OnDeserialization </a> 在其后运行。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-21","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans caches constructor delegates by owner type and delegate shape and uses the same existing-instance initialization path on managed runtimes and NativeAOT. The base <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.exception\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Exception</a> serialization constructor uses a statically bound accessor on .NET 10 and later, including the fallback for exception subtypes which inherit the base serialization contract. Runtime-selected serialization constructors use reflection to initialize the existing object; the .NET Standard asset also uses reflection for the base exception constructor. Preserve public and non-public constructors on those types so native compilation retains the constructor metadata and implementation. Reflection invokes constructors with <code>BindingFlags.DoNotWrapExceptions</code>, preserving the original exception’s identity and constructor stack, including constructor-thrown <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.reflection.targetinvocationexception\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TargetInvocationException</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 按所属类型和委托形式缓存构造函数委托，并在托管运行时和 NativeAOT 上使用相同的已有实例初始化路径。在 .NET 10 及更高版本上，基类 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.exception\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Exception </a> 的序列化构造函数使用静态绑定的访问器，其中也包括继承基类序列化协定的异常子类型的回退路径。运行时选择的序列化构造函数使用反射初始化已有对象；面向 .NET Standard 的产物也使用反射调用基类异常构造函数。应保留这些类型的公共和非公共构造函数，以便本机编译保留构造函数元数据和实现。反射使用 <code>BindingFlags.DoNotWrapExceptions</code> 调用构造函数，保留原始异常的身份和构造函数堆栈，包括构造函数自身抛出的 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.reflection.targetinvocationexception\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> TargetInvocationException </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-22","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Boxed value-type delegates initialize the existing box. Statically closed value-type constructor delegates box the caller’s <code>ref</code> value, initialize that box, and copy it back in a <code>finally</code> block, including mutations performed before a constructor throws. Runtime-created generic value-type serializers and attributed callback delegates have additional runtime code-generation requirements. NativeAOT constructor support targets .NET 10 and later; native application support also depends on type manifests, codec factories, and callback paths used by the application.</p>","zh":"<p>针对已装箱值类型的委托会初始化现有的装箱对象。静态封闭的值类型构造函数委托会将调用方的 <code>ref</code> 值装箱，初始化该装箱对象，再在 <code>finally</code> 块中将其复制回去，其中也包括构造函数抛出异常之前完成的修改。运行时创建的泛型值类型序列化器和带特性的回调委托，还具有额外的运行时代码生成要求。NativeAOT 构造函数支持面向 .NET 10 及更高版本；本机应用支持还取决于应用使用的类型清单、编解码器工厂和回调路径。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-23","type":"heading","anchor":"rpc-generation","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"rpc-generation\">RPC generation</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"rpc-generation\">RPC 生成</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-24","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Grain-reference construction resolves the generated proxy from the registered type manifest and invokes its <code>(GrainReferenceShared, IdSpan)</code> constructor. The activator caches the constructor delegate and shares the runtime, interface version, invocation options, and serialization services across references for the same grain type and interface. Each reference retains its own grain key. JIT runtimes use an emitted constructor delegate; NativeAOT uses a cached reflection constructor invoker. Generated <code>AddInterfaceProxy</code> registrations preserve the public proxy constructor during trimming.</p>","zh":"<p>构造 Grain 引用时，会从已注册的类型清单解析生成的代理，并调用其 <code>(GrainReferenceShared, IdSpan)</code> 构造函数。激活器缓存构造函数委托，并在相同 Grain 类型和接口的引用之间共享运行时、接口版本、调用选项和序列化服务。每个引用保留自身的 Grain 键。JIT 运行时使用动态生成的构造函数委托；NativeAOT 使用缓存的反射构造函数调用器。生成的 <code>AddInterfaceProxy</code> 注册在裁剪期间保留公共代理构造函数。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-25","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For each grain interface method, generated code captures arguments in an invokable object. The generated proxy submits that object through its proxy base. On the target, generated dispatch metadata invokes the concrete implementation and encodes the response.</p>","zh":"<p>对于每个 Grain 接口方法，生成的代码都会将参数捕获到一个可调用对象中。生成的代理通过其代理基类提交该对象。在目标端，生成的派发元数据调用具体实现并对响应编码。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-26","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The request object is serializable like any other Orleans value. Stable method and interface metadata allow caller and target assemblies to evolve independently within the supported versioning rules. Outgoing and incoming call filters wrap the generated invocation; they do not replace serialization or dispatch.</p>","zh":"<p>请求对象与任何其他 Orleans 值一样可以序列化。稳定的方法和接口元数据，使调用方程序集和目标程序集能够在受支持的版本控制规则内独立演进。出站和入站调用筛选器环绕生成的调用执行；它们不替代序列化或派发。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-27","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The generated request type and response envelope are part of the rolling-upgrade boundary. Old readers skip newly introduced fields, new readers supply compatible defaults for omitted fields, and every compatible interface version uses decodable argument and result types. Method identity and interface version routing remain separate from value wire identity.</p>","zh":"<p>生成的请求类型和响应封装属于滚动升级边界的一部分。旧读取器跳过新引入的字段，新读取器为缺省字段提供兼容的默认值，每个兼容接口版本都使用可解码的参数类型和结果类型。方法身份与接口版本路由仍然独立于值的通信身份。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-28","type":"heading","anchor":"generated-call-path","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"generated-call-path\">Generated call path</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"generated-call-path\">生成的调用路径</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-29","type":"diagram","en":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"ce2eb362655e2c0bd503cbd23a1c9e4ec51a43c042dfb3c078ae0f1b9a624fe1\" data-diagram-language=\"en\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rendering diagram…\">Rendering diagram…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>Original Mermaid source</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App as Application\n    participant Proxy as Generated grain-reference proxy\n    participant Request as Generated IInvokable request\n    participant Client as GrainReferenceRuntime/runtime client\n    participant Message as Orleans message\n    participant Target as Target activation\n    participant Dispatch as Generated dispatch\n\n    App-&gt;&gt;Proxy: Call grain method\n    Proxy-&gt;&gt;Request: Allocate and capture arguments\n    Proxy-&gt;&gt;Client: Submit request through proxy base\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Message: Copy/serialize request and assign call metadata\n    Message-&gt;&gt;Target: Route to activation\n    Target-&gt;&gt;Request: Set target and run incoming filters\n    Request-&gt;&gt;Dispatch: Invoke generated method body\n    Dispatch-&gt;&gt;Target: Call grain implementation\n    Target--&gt;&gt;Request: Result or exception\n    Request--&gt;&gt;Client: Serialized Response\n    Client--&gt;&gt;Proxy: Complete invocation\n    Proxy--&gt;&gt;App: Return/complete caller-facing value</code></pre></details></figure>","zh":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"ce2eb362655e2c0bd503cbd23a1c9e4ec51a43c042dfb3c078ae0f1b9a624fe1\" data-diagram-language=\"zh\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正在绘制图表…\">正在绘制图表…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看原始 Mermaid 图表代码</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App as Application\n    participant Proxy as Generated grain-reference proxy\n    participant Request as Generated IInvokable request\n    participant Client as GrainReferenceRuntime/runtime client\n    participant Message as Orleans message\n    participant Target as Target activation\n    participant Dispatch as Generated dispatch\n\n    App-&gt;&gt;Proxy: Call grain method\n    Proxy-&gt;&gt;Request: Allocate and capture arguments\n    Proxy-&gt;&gt;Client: Submit request through proxy base\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Message: Copy/serialize request and assign call metadata\n    Message-&gt;&gt;Target: Route to activation\n    Target-&gt;&gt;Request: Set target and run incoming filters\n    Request-&gt;&gt;Dispatch: Invoke generated method body\n    Dispatch-&gt;&gt;Target: Call grain implementation\n    Target--&gt;&gt;Request: Result or exception\n    Request--&gt;&gt;Client: Serialized Response\n    Client--&gt;&gt;Proxy: Complete invocation\n    Proxy--&gt;&gt;App: Return/complete caller-facing value</code></pre></details></figure>","diagram":"ce2eb362655e2c0bd503cbd23a1c9e4ec51a43c042dfb3c078ae0f1b9a624fe1","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-30","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The stages preserve these boundaries:</p>","zh":"<p>各阶段保持以下边界：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-31","type":"list","en":"<ol>\n<li>The incremental generator discovers interfaces marked directly or transitively with <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generatemethodserializersattribute/\">GenerateMethodSerializersAttribute</a> and resolves the selected proxy base.</li>\n<li>It emits a proxy method and a generated request type implementing <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.invocation.iinvokable/\">IInvokable</a>. Each argument is a generated field.</li>\n<li>The request implements <code>GetArgumentCount</code>, <code>GetArgument</code>, and <code>SetArgument</code>. <a href=\"#/docs/grains/interceptors/\">Call filters</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/grains/request-scheduling/\">request scheduling predicates</a> use those accessors to inspect or replace arguments before dispatch.</li>\n<li>The proxy base submits the request through <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.grainreference/\">GrainReference</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.igrainreferenceruntime/\">IGrainReferenceRuntime</a>. Outgoing filters run around that submission.</li>\n<li>The runtime creates a message whose body is the invokable request. The request’s compound type identity and the message’s interface/version metadata let the receiver resolve the generated type and target contract.</li>\n<li>The target runtime resolves the activation, installs the target on the request, runs incoming filters, and calls <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.invocation.iinvokable/methods/\">Invoke</a>. Generated <code>InvokeInner</code> code dispatches directly to the grain implementation.</li>\n<li>The invokable base converts completion, result, or exception into a <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.invocation.response/\">Response</a>. The caller runtime completes the waiting operation.</li>\n</ol>","zh":"<ol>\n<li>增量生成器发现直接或间接标有 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generatemethodserializersattribute/\">GenerateMethodSerializersAttribute</a> 的接口，并解析所选代理基类。</li>\n<li>它生成代理方法，以及实现 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.invocation.iinvokable/\"> IInvokable </a> 的请求类型。每个参数都对应一个生成的字段。</li>\n<li>请求实现 <code>GetArgumentCount</code> 、 <code>GetArgument</code> 和 <code>SetArgument</code> 。 <a href=\"#/docs/grains/interceptors/\"> 调用筛选器 </a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/grains/request-scheduling/\"> 请求调度谓词 </a> 在派发之前，使用这些访问器检查或替换参数。</li>\n<li>代理基类通过 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.grainreference/\">GrainReference</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.igrainreferenceruntime/\">IGrainReferenceRuntime</a> 提交请求。出站筛选器环绕这一提交过程运行。</li>\n<li>运行时创建一条消息，其消息体就是可调用请求。请求的复合类型身份与消息的接口／版本元数据，使接收方能够解析生成的类型和目标协定。</li>\n<li>目标运行时解析激活实例，将目标设置到请求上，运行入站筛选器，并调用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.invocation.iinvokable/methods/\"> Invoke </a> 。生成的 <code>InvokeInner</code> 代码直接派发到 Grain 实现。</li>\n<li>可调用基类将完成、结果或异常转换为 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.invocation.response/\"> Response </a> 。调用方运行时完成正在等待的操作。</li>\n</ol>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-32","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For a return type marked through <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.invocation.returnvalueproxyattribute/\">ReturnValueProxyAttribute</a>, step 4 changes at the proxy boundary: generated code calls the configured initializer on the request and returns its value. The initializer owns request submission or another adapter protocol. The target still receives and dispatches the generated request according to the invokable base contract. See <a href=\"#/docs/grains/code-generation-customization/\">customize Orleans serialization code generation</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>对于通过 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.invocation.returnvalueproxyattribute/\">ReturnValueProxyAttribute</a> 标记的返回类型，第 4 步在代理边界处发生变化：生成的代码对请求调用配置的初始化器，并返回其值。初始化器负责提交请求或执行另一种适配器协议。目标端仍然依据可调用基类协定接收并派发生成的请求。参见 <a href=\"#/docs/grains/code-generation-customization/\"> 自定义 Orleans 序列化代码生成 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-33","type":"heading","anchor":"generated-components-and-responsibilities","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"generated-components-and-responsibilities\">Generated components and responsibilities</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"generated-components-and-responsibilities\">生成的组件及其职责</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-34","type":"table","en":"<table><thead><tr><th>Component</th><th>Responsibility</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Generated grain-reference proxy</td><td>Implements the grain interface, rents or creates a request, copies arguments into it, applies method options, and invokes the selected proxy-base method or return-value initializer.</td></tr><tr><td>Generated request type</td><td>Carries serialized arguments, exposes argument inspection and mutation, records interface and method metadata, accepts the target activation, and calls the grain implementation through <code>InvokeInner</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.invocation.iinvokable/\">IInvokable</a></td><td>Defines target binding, dispatch, argument access, cancellation hooks, method metadata, response timeout, and disposal.</td></tr><tr><td>Proxy base</td><td>Defines how each return family enters the client runtime. <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.grainreference/\">GrainReference</a> provides the built-in task, value-task, void, and async-enumerable mappings.</td></tr><tr><td>Invokable base</td><td>Defines target-side completion and response adaptation. Custom bases can also define a caller-facing adapter through <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.invocation.returnvalueproxyattribute/\">ReturnValueProxyAttribute</a>.</td></tr><tr><td>Generated metadata</td><td>Registers proxy implementations, grain implementations, codecs, activators, and compound request aliases in the assembly manifest.</td></tr></tbody></table>","zh":"<table><thead><tr><th>组件</th><th>职责</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>生成的 Grain 引用代理</td><td>实现 Grain 接口，从池中租用或创建请求，将参数复制到请求中，应用方法选项，并调用所选代理基类方法或返回值初始化器。</td></tr><tr><td>生成的请求类型</td><td>携带序列化参数，公开参数检查与修改功能，记录接口和方法元数据，接受目标激活实例，并通过 <code>InvokeInner</code> 调用 Grain 实现。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.invocation.iinvokable/\"> IInvokable </a></td><td>定义目标绑定、派发、参数访问、取消钩子、方法元数据、响应超时和释放。</td></tr><tr><td>代理基类</td><td>定义各类返回类型如何进入客户端运行时。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.grainreference/\">GrainReference</a> 提供内置的 Task、ValueTask、void 和异步可枚举类型映射。</td></tr><tr><td>可调用基类</td><td>定义目标端的完成处理和响应适配。自定义基类还可以通过 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.invocation.returnvalueproxyattribute/\">ReturnValueProxyAttribute</a> 定义面向调用方的适配器。</td></tr><tr><td>生成的元数据</td><td>在程序集清单中注册代理实现、Grain 实现、编解码器、激活器和复合请求别名。</td></tr></tbody></table>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-35","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Arguments and result values use normal Orleans.Serialization codecs and copiers. Exceptions are represented by exception responses and rethrown by the caller completion source. A grain call with a <code>CancellationToken</code> exposes cancellation through the generated request, allowing the runtime to propagate cooperative cancellation. Void methods set the one-way invocation option in their request base, so no response completion source waits for a result.</p>","zh":"<p>参数和结果值使用普通的 Orleans.Serialization 编解码器和复制器。异常由异常响应表示，并由调用方完成源重新抛出。带有 <code>CancellationToken</code> 的 Grain 调用通过生成的请求公开取消能力，使运行时能够传播协作式取消。void 方法在其请求基类中设置单向调用选项，因此不会有响应完成源等待结果。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-36","type":"heading","anchor":"request-identity-and-dispatch","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"request-identity-and-dispatch\">Request identity and dispatch</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"request-identity-and-dispatch\">请求身份与派发</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-37","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Generated request names are implementation details. Their wire identity is a compound alias containing:</p>","zh":"<p>生成的请求名称属于实现细节。其通信身份是一个复合别名，包含：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-38","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>the <code>inv</code> marker;</li>\n<li>the proxy-base identity;</li>\n<li>the grain interface type;</li>\n<li>the declaring interface for extension methods; and</li>\n<li>the method identity.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li><code>inv</code> 标记；</li>\n<li>代理基类身份；</li>\n<li>Grain 接口类型；</li>\n<li>扩展方法的声明接口；以及</li>\n<li>方法身份。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-39","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The method identity uses an explicit <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a> value, an <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.aliasattribute/\">AliasAttribute</a>, or a deterministic hash of the method signature. When an explicit identity differs from the generated hash, Orleans emits compatibility aliases for both identities. This lets manifest resolution identify the request type independently of its generated CLR name.</p>","zh":"<p>方法身份使用显式的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a> 值、 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.aliasattribute/\">AliasAttribute</a> ，或方法签名的确定性哈希。当显式身份与生成的哈希不同时，Orleans 会为这两种身份生成兼容性别名。这使清单解析能够独立于生成的 CLR 名称来识别请求类型。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-40","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The message also carries the grain interface type and version used by version selection. Type identity resolves the serialized request body; interface/version metadata selects compatible dispatch. These are related compatibility boundaries with separate responsibilities.</p>","zh":"<p>消息还携带版本选择所使用的 Grain 接口类型和版本。类型身份解析序列化的请求体；接口／版本元数据选择兼容的派发路径。这些是彼此相关、但职责独立的兼容性边界。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-41","type":"heading","anchor":"source-and-referenced-assembly-metadata","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"source-and-referenced-assembly-metadata\">Source and referenced assembly metadata</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"source-and-referenced-assembly-metadata\">源码与被引用程序集元数据</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-42","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Syntax providers create stable models for source-declared serializable types and proxy interfaces. A separate compilation-dependent stage scans source and referenced assembly metadata for application parts, aliases, compound aliases, serializer registrations, proxy interfaces, implementations, and assembly-level invokable mappings.</p>","zh":"<p>语法提供程序为源码中声明的可序列化类型和代理接口创建稳定模型。另一个依赖编译的阶段扫描源码和被引用程序集的元数据，查找应用部件、别名、复合别名、序列化器注册、代理接口、实现，以及程序集级的可调用类型映射。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-43","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The generator combines those models when it prepares proxy output and the type manifest. Equality comparers on normalized models preserve incremental caching when syntax-derived contracts remain unchanged. Compilation-dependent binding stays in the output preparation phase because return mappings, accessibility, generic constraints, constructors, and initializer overload resolution can change when references change.</p>","zh":"<p>生成器在准备代理输出和类型清单时组合这些模型。如果从语法派生的协定未变，规范化模型上的相等比较器就会保留增量缓存。依赖编译的绑定仍放在输出准备阶段，因为引用变化时，返回类型映射、可访问性、泛型约束、构造函数和初始化器重载解析都可能变化。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-44","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>This split allows an unrelated source edit to reuse proxy models while a referenced adapter or assembly-level mapping correctly invalidates generated proxy output.</p>","zh":"<p>这种划分使无关的源码编辑能够复用代理模型，同时确保被引用的适配器或程序集级映射发生变化时，正确地使生成的代理输出失效。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-45","type":"heading","anchor":"runtime-manifest-and-type-safety","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"runtime-manifest-and-type-safety\">Runtime manifest and type safety</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"runtime-manifest-and-type-safety\">运行时清单与类型安全</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-46","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Each generated assembly carries a <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.configuration.typemanifestproviderattribute/\">TypeManifestProviderAttribute</a>. <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.serializerbuilderextensions/methods/\">SerializerBuilderExtensions.AddAssembly</a> finds those providers and contributes their components to <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.configuration.typemanifestoptions/\">TypeManifestOptions</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>每个生成的程序集都携带一个 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.configuration.typemanifestproviderattribute/\">TypeManifestProviderAttribute</a> 。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.serializerbuilderextensions/methods/\">SerializerBuilderExtensions.AddAssembly</a> 找到这些提供程序，并将它们的组件加入 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.configuration.typemanifestoptions/\">TypeManifestOptions</a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-47","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The manifest records:</p>","zh":"<p>清单记录：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-48","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>activators, field codecs, serializers, copiers, and converters;</li>\n<li>RPC interfaces, proxies, and implementations;</li>\n<li>well-known numeric type IDs and aliases; and</li>\n<li>explicitly allowed types and assemblies.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>激活器、字段编解码器、序列化器、复制器和转换器；</li>\n<li>RPC 接口、代理和实现；</li>\n<li>约定的数字类型 ID 和别名；以及</li>\n<li>显式允许的类型和程序集。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-49","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.configuration.typemanifestoptions/properties/\">TypeManifestOptions.AllowAllTypes</a> defaults to <code>false</code>. This is a type-resolution boundary: receiving a formatted type name does not make every loadable CLR type valid input.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.configuration.typemanifestoptions/properties/\">TypeManifestOptions.AllowAllTypes</a> 默认为 <code>false</code> 。这是一个类型解析边界：收到格式化的类型名称，并不意味着所有可加载的 CLR 类型都会成为有效输入。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-50","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>API: <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.configuration.typemanifestoptions/\">TypeManifestOptions</a>, <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.iserializerbuilder/\">ISerializerBuilder</a>, and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.serializerbuilderextensions/methods/\">SerializerBuilderExtensions.AddAssembly</a>. Implementation: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Serialization/Configuration/TypeManifestOptions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">manifest options</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Serialization/Hosting/SerializerBuilderExtensions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">serializer builder extensions</a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Serialization/Hosting/ServiceCollectionExtensions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">serializer service registration</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>API： <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.configuration.typemanifestoptions/\">TypeManifestOptions</a> 、 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.iserializerbuilder/\">ISerializerBuilder</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.serializerbuilderextensions/methods/\">SerializerBuilderExtensions.AddAssembly</a> 。实现： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Serialization/Configuration/TypeManifestOptions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 清单选项 </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Serialization/Hosting/SerializerBuilderExtensions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 序列化器构建器扩展 </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Serialization/Hosting/ServiceCollectionExtensions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 序列化器服务注册 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-51","type":"heading","anchor":"default-object-activation","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"default-object-activation\">Default object activation</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"default-object-activation\">默认对象激活</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-52","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The default serializer activator invokes a public parameterless constructor, including an explicit parameterless value-type constructor, for each new instance. For types with no public parameterless constructor, it allocates an uninitialized instance with zero-initialized fields. A registered custom activator controls construction for its target type.</p>","zh":"<p>默认序列化器激活器为每个新实例调用公共无参数构造函数，其中也包括显式声明的无参数值类型构造函数。对于没有公共无参数构造函数的类型，它分配一个未初始化的实例，其字段初始化为零。已注册的自定义激活器控制其目标类型的构造。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-53","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The default activator caches whether the type has a public parameterless constructor and uses generic construction through <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.activator.createinstance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CreateInstance</a> on both managed runtimes and NativeAOT. The runtime supplies the constructor and allocator implementation. Generic construction wraps constructor failures in <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.reflection.targetinvocationexception\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TargetInvocationException</a>; the activator removes that outer wrapper and propagates the original constructor exception, preserving its identity, inner exception, and stack trace. Closed default activator types carry the constructor-preservation annotations required by constructor lookup and uninitialized allocation.</p>","zh":"<p>默认激活器缓存类型是否具有公共无参数构造函数，并在托管运行时和 NativeAOT 上都通过 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.activator.createinstance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> CreateInstance </a> 进行泛型构造。运行时提供构造函数和分配器实现。泛型构造会将构造函数失败包装在 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.reflection.targetinvocationexception\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> TargetInvocationException </a> 中；激活器移除这层外部包装，传播原始构造函数异常，同时保留其身份、内部异常和堆栈跟踪。封闭的默认激活器类型携带构造函数查找和未初始化分配所需的构造函数保留注解。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-54","type":"heading","anchor":"extension-points","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"extension-points\">Extension points</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"extension-points\">扩展点</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-55","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Use the registration APIs exposed by <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.iserializerbuilder/\">ISerializerBuilder</a> for:</p>","zh":"<p>通过 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.iserializerbuilder/\">ISerializerBuilder</a> 公开的注册 API 注册以下组件：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-56","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>a field codec when a type needs custom wire encoding;</li>\n<li>a deep copier when generated member-wise copy is unsuitable;</li>\n<li>an activator when construction needs special handling;</li>\n<li>a serializer when the type owns an external format; or</li>\n<li>a converter which maps a type to a supported surrogate.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>当类型需要自定义通信编码时，注册字段编解码器；</li>\n<li>当生成的逐成员复制不适用时，注册深复制器；</li>\n<li>当构造需要特殊处理时，注册激活器；</li>\n<li>当类型负责自身的外部格式时，注册序列化器；或者</li>\n<li>注册将类型映射到受支持代理项的转换器。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-57","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Keep codec and copier behavior paired. A custom serializer which preserves a graph while its copier loses reference identity can produce different local and remote call behavior.</p>","zh":"<p>保持编解码器和复制器行为一致。如果自定义序列化器保留对象图，而其复制器丢失引用身份，就可能导致本地调用和远程调用表现不同。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-58","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>A custom <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.cloning.ideepcopier-1/\">IDeepCopier&lt;T&gt;</a> accepts null input for reference types. It returns null for null input and a non-null copy for non-null input. Hand-written implementations with nullable analysis enabled must use nullable input and return types and annotate the return with <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.diagnostics.codeanalysis.notnullifnotnullattribute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NotNullIfNotNullAttribute</a>. Existing implementations with non-nullable input report CS8767 for implicit implementations or CS8769 for explicit implementations, which becomes a build error when nullable warnings are treated as errors.</p>","zh":"<p>自定义 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization/orleans.serialization.cloning.ideepcopier-1/\">IDeepCopier&lt;T&gt;</a> 对引用类型接受 null 输入。输入为 null 时返回 null，输入非 null 时返回非 null 的副本。启用可空性分析的手写实现，必须使用可空输入类型和返回类型，并使用 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.diagnostics.codeanalysis.notnullifnotnullattribute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> NotNullIfNotNullAttribute </a> 标注返回值。现有的非可空输入实现中，隐式实现会报告 CS8767，显式实现会报告 CS8769；将可空性警告视为错误时，这些诊断会导致构建失败。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-59","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>RPC code-generation extensions can register custom invokable bases and caller-facing return adapters. See <a href=\"#/docs/grains/code-generation-customization/\">customize Orleans serialization code generation</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>RPC 代码生成扩展可以注册自定义可调用基类和面向调用方的返回值适配器。参见 <a href=\"#/docs/grains/code-generation-customization/\"> 自定义 Orleans 序列化代码生成 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"7ebe178e9cfab505-60","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Configuration examples belong in the <a href=\"#/docs/host/configuration-guide/serialization/\">serialization configuration guide</a>. The <a href=\"#/docs/grains/code-generation/\">source-generation guide</a> covers application-facing generation rules. Runtime call behavior is described in <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/messaging-delivery-guarantees/\">messaging and delivery semantics</a>. Implementation behavior is exercised by <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/test/Orleans.Serialization.UnitTests/GeneratedSerializerTests.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>GeneratedSerializerTests</code></a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/test/Orleans.Serialization.UnitTests/GeneratedSerializerBitwiseCompatibilityTests.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>GeneratedSerializerBitwiseCompatibilityTests</code></a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/test/Orleans.CodeGenerator.Tests/CustomReturnTypeTests.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>CustomReturnTypeTests</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>配置示例见 <a href=\"#/docs/host/configuration-guide/serialization/\"> 序列化配置指南 </a> 。 <a href=\"#/docs/grains/code-generation/\"> 源代码生成指南 </a> 介绍面向应用的生成规则。运行时调用行为见 <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/messaging-delivery-guarantees/\"> 消息传递与投递语义 </a> 。 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/test/Orleans.Serialization.UnitTests/GeneratedSerializerTests.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>GeneratedSerializerTests</code> </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/test/Orleans.Serialization.UnitTests/GeneratedSerializerBitwiseCompatibilityTests.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>GeneratedSerializerBitwiseCompatibilityTests</code> </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/test/Orleans.CodeGenerator.Tests/CustomReturnTypeTests.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>CustomReturnTypeTests</code> </a> 对实现行为进行测试。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"3e72b6edecb18b2e":{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e","title":"Persistent stream pulling architecture","titleZh":"持久流拉取架构","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/streams-implementation/","sourceHash":"c332e7d69f5b98791011015d761d0c09c8da07de33314482b3080fba664a6fb7","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Persistent stream pulling architecture</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">持久流拉取架构</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>A persistent stream provider connects Orleans streams to a durable queue technology. Producers enqueue through an adapter. Silo-local pulling agents own queue partitions, read batches, cache them, discover subscriptions, and deliver events through ordinary Orleans calls.</p>","zh":"<p>持久流提供程序将 Orleans 流连接到具有持久性的队列技术。生产者通过适配器入队。Silo 本地的拉取代理拥有队列分区，读取并缓存批次，发现订阅，再通过普通 Orleans 调用投递事件。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>This page describes the runtime mechanism. For stream APIs and provider selection, see the <a href=\"#/docs/streaming/\">streaming documentation</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>本页介绍运行时机制。流 API 和提供程序选择参见 <a href=\"#/docs/streaming/\"> 流式处理文档 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-3","type":"diagram","en":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"743557d2a48d47cdab85f9a342882700a6d3daddb03c9e55795b6f8f1d9b3e8a\" data-diagram-language=\"en\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rendering diagram…\">Rendering diagram…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>Original Mermaid source</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart LR\n    Producer[Stream producer]\n    Adapter[IQueueAdapter]\n    Queue[(Durable queue)]\n    Balancer[IStreamQueueBalancer]\n    Manager[PersistentStreamPullingManager]\n    Agent[Pulling agent SystemTarget]\n    Cache[IQueueCache]\n    PubSub[Stream pub-sub]\n    Consumers[Grain/client consumers]\n\n    Producer --&gt; Adapter\n    Adapter --&gt; Queue\n    Balancer --&gt; Manager\n    Manager --&gt; Agent\n    Agent --&gt; Queue\n    Agent --&gt; Cache\n    Agent &lt;--&gt; PubSub\n    Cache --&gt; Agent\n    Agent --&gt; Consumers</code></pre></details></figure>","zh":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"743557d2a48d47cdab85f9a342882700a6d3daddb03c9e55795b6f8f1d9b3e8a\" data-diagram-language=\"zh\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正在绘制图表…\">正在绘制图表…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看原始 Mermaid 图表代码</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart LR\n    Producer[Stream producer]\n    Adapter[IQueueAdapter]\n    Queue[(Durable queue)]\n    Balancer[IStreamQueueBalancer]\n    Manager[PersistentStreamPullingManager]\n    Agent[Pulling agent SystemTarget]\n    Cache[IQueueCache]\n    PubSub[Stream pub-sub]\n    Consumers[Grain/client consumers]\n\n    Producer --&gt; Adapter\n    Adapter --&gt; Queue\n    Balancer --&gt; Manager\n    Manager --&gt; Agent\n    Agent --&gt; Queue\n    Agent --&gt; Cache\n    Agent &lt;--&gt; PubSub\n    Cache --&gt; Agent\n    Agent --&gt; Consumers</code></pre></details></figure>","diagram":"743557d2a48d47cdab85f9a342882700a6d3daddb03c9e55795b6f8f1d9b3e8a","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-4","type":"heading","anchor":"provider-composition-and-lifecycle-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"provider-composition-and-lifecycle-\">Provider composition and lifecycle <span id=\"persistent-streams\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"provider-composition-and-lifecycle-\">提供程序组合与生命周期 <span id=\"persistent-streams\"> </span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.providers.streams.common.persistentstreamprovider/\">PersistentStreamProvider</a> is the common implementation. A provider-specific <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueueadapterfactory/\">IQueueAdapterFactory</a> creates:</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.providers.streams.common.persistentstreamprovider/\">PersistentStreamProvider</a> 是通用实现。提供程序特定的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueueadapterfactory/\">IQueueAdapterFactory</a> 创建以下组件：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-6","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>an <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueueadapter/\">IQueueAdapter</a> for enqueue and receive semantics;</li>\n<li>an <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.istreamqueuemapper/\">IStreamQueueMapper</a> for stream-to-queue mapping;</li>\n<li>an <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.istreamqueuebalancer/\">IStreamQueueBalancer</a> for silo ownership;</li>\n<li>an <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueueadaptercache/\">IQueueAdapterCache</a> for per-agent caches; and</li>\n<li>optional failure handlers, filters, and backoff providers.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>用于入队和接收语义的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueueadapter/\">IQueueAdapter</a> ；</li>\n<li>用于流到队列映射的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.istreamqueuemapper/\">IStreamQueueMapper</a> ；</li>\n<li>用于 Silo 所有权分配的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.istreamqueuebalancer/\">IStreamQueueBalancer</a> ；</li>\n<li>用于各代理缓存的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueueadaptercache/\">IQueueAdapterCache</a> ；以及</li>\n<li>可选的失败处理器、筛选器和退避提供程序。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>During lifecycle initialization the provider resolves its named adapter factory and creates the adapter. At the active stage it initializes the pulling manager and starts agents. Shutdown stops agents before the provider closes.</p>","zh":"<p>生命周期初始化期间，提供程序解析其命名适配器工厂并创建适配器。在活动阶段，它初始化拉取管理器并启动代理。关闭时，在提供程序关闭之前先停止代理。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>By default, pulling agents start automatically. Explicit grain-based and implicit subscriptions are both enabled.</p>","zh":"<p>默认情况下，拉取代理自动启动。基于 Grain 的显式订阅和隐式订阅均已启用。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>API: <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.providers.streams.common.persistentstreamprovider/\">PersistentStreamProvider</a>. Implementation: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Streaming/PersistentStreams/PersistentStreamProvider.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">provider lifecycle</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Streaming/PersistentStreams/Options/PersistentStreamProviderOptions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">provider options</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>API： <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.providers.streams.common.persistentstreamprovider/\">PersistentStreamProvider</a> 。实现： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Streaming/PersistentStreams/PersistentStreamProvider.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 提供程序生命周期 </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Streaming/PersistentStreams/Options/PersistentStreamProviderOptions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 提供程序选项 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-10","type":"heading","anchor":"queue-mapping-and-ownership-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"queue-mapping-and-ownership-\">Queue mapping and ownership <span id=\"streamqueuemapper-and-streamqueuebalancer\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"queue-mapping-and-ownership-\">队列映射与所有权 <span id=\"streamqueuemapper-and-streamqueuebalancer\"> </span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The queue mapper deterministically assigns a stream identity to a queue. All producers and consumers for a provider must use compatible mapping or events can be written to queues which no intended agent reads.</p>","zh":"<p>队列映射器以确定性方式将流身份分配到队列。同一个提供程序的所有生产者和消费者都必须使用兼容的映射，否则，事件可能被写入预期代理均不读取的队列。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The queue balancer assigns queues to silos and publishes sequenced ownership changes. <code>PersistentStreamPullingManager</code> is a silo-local system target which serializes those notifications, ignores stale sequences, and starts or stops one pulling agent per owned queue. When membership changes, queues move among managers; agents themselves are not virtual and do not migrate.</p>","zh":"<p>队列均衡器将队列分配给 Silo，并发布带序号的所有权变更。 <code>PersistentStreamPullingManager</code> 是 Silo 本地的系统目标，它将这些通知串行化，忽略陈旧序号，并为每个拥有的队列启动或停止一个拉取代理。成员变更时，队列在管理器之间转移；代理本身不是虚拟的，也不会迁移。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-13","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Streaming/PersistentStreams/PersistentStreamPullingManager.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>PersistentStreamPullingManager</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>源码： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Streaming/PersistentStreams/PersistentStreamPullingManager.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>PersistentStreamPullingManager</code> </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-14","type":"heading","anchor":"pulling-agent-loop-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"pulling-agent-loop-\">Pulling-agent loop <span id=\"pulling-agents\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"pulling-agent-loop-\">拉取代理循环 <span id=\"pulling-agents\"> </span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Each <code>PersistentStreamPullingAgent</code> is a system target with single-threaded Orleans scheduling. Its loop:</p>","zh":"<p>每个 <code>PersistentStreamPullingAgent</code> 都是使用 Orleans 单线程调度的系统目标。其循环执行以下操作：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-16","type":"list","en":"<ol>\n<li>asks the adapter receiver for a batch;</li>\n<li>adds batch containers to its queue cache;</li>\n<li>groups cached items by stream;</li>\n<li>resolves and caches pub-sub registrations;</li>\n<li>advances each subscription’s cursor independently;</li>\n<li>sends events through Orleans messaging;</li>\n<li>records delivery progress and failure; and</li>\n<li>purges only data which the cache says is safe to remove.</li>\n</ol>","zh":"<ol>\n<li>向适配器接收器请求一个批次；</li>\n<li>将批容器加入其队列缓存；</li>\n<li>按流对缓存项分组；</li>\n<li>解析并缓存发布订阅注册信息；</li>\n<li>独立推进每个订阅的游标；</li>\n<li>通过 Orleans 消息传递发送事件；</li>\n<li>记录投递进度和失败；以及</li>\n<li>仅清除缓存判定为可以安全移除的数据。</li>\n</ol>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The default maximum adapter batch-container batch size is 1 and the empty-poll period is 100 ms. These defaults are runtime behavior, not a universal throughput recommendation.</p>","zh":"<p>单次获取适配器批容器的默认最大批量为 1，空轮询周期为 100 毫秒。这些默认值描述运行时行为，并非通用的吞吐量建议。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-18","type":"heading","anchor":"shutdown-and-queue-handoff","level":3,"en":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"pulling-protocol\"></span><h3 id=\"shutdown-and-queue-handoff\">Shutdown and queue handoff</h3>","zh":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"pulling-protocol\"></span><h3 id=\"shutdown-and-queue-handoff\">关闭与队列移交</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-19","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>When an agent stops, it closes admission for new background work and stops its polling timer. It waits for receiver initialization, the active queue pump, and accepted producer registrations, subscription handshakes, and deliveries to finish. Accepted work completes its token bookkeeping and releases registration pins and batch protection while the cache and receiver remain available. Outstanding calls retain their existing messaging timeouts and retry limits while accepted work drains.</p>","zh":"<p>代理停止时，会停止接纳新的后台工作，并停止其轮询计时器。它等待接收器初始化、活动的队列泵，以及已接受的生产者注册、订阅握手和投递完成。在缓存和接收器仍可用的情况下，已接受的工作完成其令牌记账，并释放注册保留标记和批次保护。已接受的工作排空期间，未完成调用保留原有的消息超时和重试上限。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-20","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The agent then reports final delivery progress to the cache, disposes subscription cursors, and shuts down the receiver so provider-specific checkpoint flushing observes the completed progress. Registrations pending when shutdown starts keep the existing checkpoint, since their subscriber positions are still uncertain. Producer unregistration follows receiver cleanup. When the manager reuses an agent for a reassigned queue, initialization waits for that full cleanup and opens admission for the new run.</p>","zh":"<p>随后，代理向缓存报告最终投递进度，释放订阅游标，并关闭接收器，使提供程序特定的检查点刷写能够观察到已完成的进度。关闭开始时仍待完成的注册会保留现有检查点，因为其订阅者位置仍不确定。生产者注销在接收器清理之后进行。管理器为重新分配的队列复用代理时，初始化会等待上述完整清理完成，再为新一轮运行打开接纳入口。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-21","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Explicit subscription notifications receive an immediate acknowledgement while the agent tracks their asynchronous handshake through completion. This lets the subscribing consumer finish its current call and respond to the handshake.</p>","zh":"<p>显式订阅通知会立即收到确认，同时代理持续跟踪其异步握手直至完成。这使正在订阅的消费者能够先完成当前调用，再响应握手。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-22","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>A completed handshake establishes the subscription’s current cursor and replay position. The latest requested handshake owns reconciliation; responses from superseded requests preserve that ownership. Delivery completions and error handling from an older handshake generation release their work while preserving the replacement position, so final checkpoint progress reflects the accepted rewind.</p>","zh":"<p>握手完成后，确立订阅的当前游标和回放位置。最新请求的握手拥有协调权；被取代请求的响应会保留这一归属。旧握手代次的投递完成处理和错误处理，会释放其工作，同时保留替代位置，使最终检查点进度反映已接受的回退位置。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-23","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>A failed re-handshake leaves the subscription’s position uncertain even when it was previously registered. The agent retains the stream entry across idle cleanup and keeps the existing checkpoint until a successful handshake reconciles that position.</p>","zh":"<p>重新握手失败会使订阅位置变得不确定，即使它此前已经注册。代理在空闲清理期间保留该流条目，并保持现有检查点，直到一次成功握手协调好该位置。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-24","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Subscription removal revokes in-flight handshake and delivery ownership. A terminal pub-sub action issued under valid ownership completes cleanup for that subscription identity, including when a cursor reconciliation overlaps its persistence.</p>","zh":"<p>移除订阅会撤销正在进行的握手和投递的所有权。在有效所有权下发出的终结性发布订阅操作，会完成该订阅身份的清理，即使游标协调与其持久化过程重叠，也同样如此。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-25","type":"heading","anchor":"cache-and-cursor-invariants-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"cache-and-cursor-invariants-\">Cache and cursor invariants <span id=\"queue-cache\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"cache-and-cursor-invariants-\">缓存与游标不变量 <span id=\"queue-cache\"> </span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-26","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>An <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueuecache/\">IQueueCache</a> decouples queue reads from consumer delivery. Each subscription has an <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueuecachecursor/\">IQueueCacheCursor</a>, so a slow consumer does not directly block a fast consumer at a later cursor.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueuecache/\">IQueueCache</a> 将队列读取与消费者投递解耦。每个订阅都有一个 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueuecachecursor/\">IQueueCacheCursor</a> ，因此，慢速消费者不会直接阻塞处于较后游标位置的快速消费者。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-27","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The cache tracks the earliest delivery progress across active subscriptions. Purging must not remove an item still needed by any cursor. <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.providers.streams.common.simplequeuecache/\">SimpleQueueCache</a> uses pressure buckets to stop or slow reads as lag grows instead of discarding undelivered events. Its default capacity is 4,096 batch containers.</p>","zh":"<p>缓存跟踪所有活动订阅中最靠前的投递进度。清除操作不得移除任何游标仍然需要的项。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.providers.streams.common.simplequeuecache/\">SimpleQueueCache</a> 使用压力桶，在积压增大时停止或减慢读取，而不是丢弃尚未投递的事件。其默认容量为 4,096 个批容器。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-28","type":"diagram","en":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"7dcdcb76ed4f00de568f1aebd83fa383c6206d1d2044fe36517aa8500197af40\" data-diagram-language=\"en\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rendering diagram…\">Rendering diagram…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>Original Mermaid source</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart TB\n    New[New queue batches] --&gt; Cache[Queue cache]\n    Cache --&gt; C1[Cursor A: fast]\n    Cache --&gt; C2[Cursor B: slow]\n    C1 --&gt; P1[Consumer A]\n    C2 --&gt; P2[Consumer B]\n    C1 --&gt; Progress[Earliest safe progress]\n    C2 --&gt; Progress\n    Progress --&gt; Purge[Purge or apply backpressure]</code></pre></details></figure>","zh":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"7dcdcb76ed4f00de568f1aebd83fa383c6206d1d2044fe36517aa8500197af40\" data-diagram-language=\"zh\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正在绘制图表…\">正在绘制图表…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看原始 Mermaid 图表代码</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart TB\n    New[New queue batches] --&gt; Cache[Queue cache]\n    Cache --&gt; C1[Cursor A: fast]\n    Cache --&gt; C2[Cursor B: slow]\n    C1 --&gt; P1[Consumer A]\n    C2 --&gt; P2[Consumer B]\n    C1 --&gt; Progress[Earliest safe progress]\n    C2 --&gt; Progress\n    Progress --&gt; Purge[Purge or apply backpressure]</code></pre></details></figure>","diagram":"7dcdcb76ed4f00de568f1aebd83fa383c6206d1d2044fe36517aa8500197af40","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-29","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Cache capacity is not durability. The queue remains the durable boundary, subject to the adapter’s acknowledgement contract.</p>","zh":"<p>缓存容量不等于持久性。队列仍是持久性边界，并受适配器确认协定约束。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-30","type":"heading","anchor":"pub-sub-handshake","level":2,"en":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"backpressure\"></span><h2 id=\"pub-sub-handshake\">Pub-sub handshake</h2>","zh":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"backpressure\"></span><h2 id=\"pub-sub-handshake\">发布订阅握手</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-31","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The agent registers as a producer for each stream and obtains subscription records from stream pub-sub. It holds a pin cursor while subscription handshakes complete so cache cleanup cannot pass the requested start token. New subscription notifications update the agent’s local pub-sub cache.</p>","zh":"<p>代理为每个流注册为生产者，并从流发布订阅系统获取订阅记录。在订阅握手完成期间，它持有固定游标，使缓存清理无法越过请求的起始令牌。新订阅通知会更新代理的本地发布订阅缓存。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-32","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Sequence tokens allow a rewindable adapter to start from a supported historical position. An adapter whose <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueueadapter/properties/\">IQueueAdapter.IsRewindable</a> property is <code>false</code> must reject unsupported tokens rather than pretending to honor them.</p>","zh":"<p>序列令牌使可回退的适配器能够从受支持的历史位置开始。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueueadapter/properties/\">IQueueAdapter.IsRewindable</a> 属性为 <code>false</code> 的适配器，必须拒绝不受支持的令牌，而不是假装遵从它们。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-33","type":"heading","anchor":"delivery-and-failure-semantics","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"delivery-and-failure-semantics\">Delivery and failure semantics</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"delivery-and-failure-semantics\">投递与失败语义</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-34","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The agent normally awaits delivery before advancing a subscription cursor, creating per-subscription backpressure. When delivery fails, it invokes the configured <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.istreamfailurehandler/\">IStreamFailureHandler</a>. Depending on provider policy, an explicit subscription can be faulted and removed.</p>","zh":"<p>代理通常会等待投递完成后，再推进订阅游标，从而形成每个订阅各自的背压。投递失败时，它调用配置的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.istreamfailurehandler/\">IStreamFailureHandler</a> 。根据提供程序策略，显式订阅可能被标记为故障并移除。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-35","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Persistent streams are not universally exactly once. Semantics depend on:</p>","zh":"<p>持久流并不普遍提供恰好一次语义。具体语义取决于：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-36","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>when the external queue considers a message acknowledged;</li>\n<li>whether the adapter can redeliver after receiver or silo failure;</li>\n<li>cache checkpoint behavior;</li>\n<li>consumer idempotency; and</li>\n<li>provider-specific sequence tokens.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>外部队列何时将消息视为已确认；</li>\n<li>接收器或 Silo 发生故障后，适配器是否能够重新投递；</li>\n<li>缓存检查点行为；</li>\n<li>消费者幂等性；以及</li>\n<li>提供程序特定的序列令牌。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-37","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>A queue message can be delivered again after ownership change or failure. Consumers which perform durable side effects should be idempotent.</p>","zh":"<p>所有权变更或发生故障后，队列消息可能再次投递。执行持久化副作用的消费者应具有幂等性。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-38","type":"heading","anchor":"extension-contracts","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"extension-contracts\">Extension contracts</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"extension-contracts\">扩展协定</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-39","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Provider authors should keep these responsibilities separate:</p>","zh":"<p>提供程序作者应将以下职责分离：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-40","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueueadapter/\">IQueueAdapter</a> defines external queue reads/writes and rewindability.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueueadapterreceiver/\">IQueueAdapterReceiver</a> defines receive, acknowledgement, and shutdown.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.istreamqueuemapper/\">IStreamQueueMapper</a> defines stable partition mapping.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.istreamqueuebalancer/\">IStreamQueueBalancer</a> defines cluster ownership.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueuecache/\">IQueueCache</a> and its cursors define buffering and safe purge.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.istreamfailurehandler/\">IStreamFailureHandler</a> defines delivery failure policy.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueueadapter/\">IQueueAdapter</a> 定义外部队列读写和回退能力。</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueueadapterreceiver/\">IQueueAdapterReceiver</a> 定义接收、确认和关闭。</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.istreamqueuemapper/\">IStreamQueueMapper</a> 定义稳定的分区映射。</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.istreamqueuebalancer/\">IStreamQueueBalancer</a> 定义集群所有权。</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueuecache/\">IQueueCache</a> 及其游标定义缓冲和安全清除。</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.istreamfailurehandler/\">IStreamFailureHandler</a> 定义投递失败策略。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3e72b6edecb18b2e-41","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>See <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/provider-authoring/\">provider authoring</a> for hosting and validation patterns and <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/streams-implementation/azure-queue-streams/\">Azure Queue streams</a> for a concrete adapter.</p>","zh":"<p>宿主集成与验证模式参见 <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/provider-authoring/\"> 提供程序编写 </a> ；具体适配器参见 <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/streams-implementation/azure-queue-streams/\"> Azure Queue 流 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"3294b495ffa41f0e":{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e","title":"Azure Queue stream implementation","titleZh":"Azure Queue 流实现","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/streams-implementation/azure-queue-streams/","sourceHash":"5a8338491e10335e0179547f1db49b1a576b5712e0559578eb2d769e11315b36","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Azure Queue stream implementation</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Azure Queue 流实现</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>Microsoft.Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage</code></a> package implements a persistent stream adapter over Azure Queue Storage. It uses the common <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/streams-implementation/\">persistent stream pulling architecture</a> and supplies Azure-specific queue mapping, encoding, receive, delete, and configuration behavior.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>Microsoft.Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage</code> </a> 包在 Azure Queue Storage 之上实现持久流适配器。它使用通用的 <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/streams-implementation/\"> 持久流拉取架构 </a> ，并提供 Azure 特定的队列映射、编码、接收、删除和配置行为。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-2","type":"heading","anchor":"registration-apis-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"registration-apis-\">Registration APIs <span id=\"configuration\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"registration-apis-\">注册 API <span id=\"configuration\"> </span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Silo and client builders expose <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.hosting.silobuilderextensions/methods/\">SiloBuilderExtensions.AddAzureQueueStreams</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.hosting.clientbuilderextensions/methods/\">ClientBuilderExtensions.AddAzureQueueStreams</a>, respectively. The concise overload configures named <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.configuration.azurequeueoptions/\">AzureQueueOptions</a>. Both configurator types can replace the queue data adapter; only the silo configurator exposes the cache and pulling-agent components which run on silos.</p>","zh":"<p>Silo 构建器和客户端构建器分别公开 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.hosting.silobuilderextensions/methods/\">SiloBuilderExtensions.AddAzureQueueStreams</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.hosting.clientbuilderextensions/methods/\">ClientBuilderExtensions.AddAzureQueueStreams</a> 。简洁重载用于配置命名的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.configuration.azurequeueoptions/\">AzureQueueOptions</a> 。两种配置器类型都可以替换队列数据适配器；只有 Silo 配置器公开在 Silo 上运行的缓存和拉取代理组件。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Applications can instead supply a keyed <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/azure.storage.queues.queueserviceclient\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">QueueServiceClient</a> through configuration-driven provider registration. Configuration supports a service key, connection name, connection string, or queue-service URI. The <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.configuration.azurequeueoptions/methods/\">ConfigureQueueServiceClient</a> overloads and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.configuration.azurequeueoptions/properties/\">AzureQueueOptions.ClientOptions</a> property are obsolete and should not be used in new code.</p>","zh":"<p>应用也可以通过配置驱动的提供程序注册，提供按键注册的 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/azure.storage.queues.queueserviceclient\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> QueueServiceClient </a> 。配置支持服务键、连接名称、连接字符串或队列服务 URI。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.configuration.azurequeueoptions/methods/\">ConfigureQueueServiceClient</a> 重载和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.configuration.azurequeueoptions/properties/\">AzureQueueOptions.ClientOptions</a> 属性已过时，不应在新代码中使用。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>API: <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.hosting.silobuilderextensions/methods/\">SiloBuilderExtensions.AddAzureQueueStreams</a>, <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.hosting.clientbuilderextensions/methods/\">ClientBuilderExtensions.AddAzureQueueStreams</a>, <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.hosting.azurequeuestreamproviderbuilder/\">AzureQueueStreamProviderBuilder</a>, and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.configuration.azurequeueoptions/\">AzureQueueOptions</a>. Implementation: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Azure/Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/Hosting/SiloBuilderExtensions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">silo registration</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Azure/Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/Hosting/AzureQueueStreamProviderBuilder.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">configuration-driven registration</a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Azure/Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/Providers/Streams/AzureQueue/AzureQueueStreamOptions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">queue options</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>API： <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.hosting.silobuilderextensions/methods/\">SiloBuilderExtensions.AddAzureQueueStreams</a> 、 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.hosting.clientbuilderextensions/methods/\">ClientBuilderExtensions.AddAzureQueueStreams</a> 、 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.hosting.azurequeuestreamproviderbuilder/\">AzureQueueStreamProviderBuilder</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.configuration.azurequeueoptions/\">AzureQueueOptions</a> 。实现： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Azure/Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/Hosting/SiloBuilderExtensions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Silo 注册 </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Azure/Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/Hosting/AzureQueueStreamProviderBuilder.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 配置驱动的注册 </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Azure/Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/Providers/Streams/AzureQueue/AzureQueueStreamOptions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 队列选项 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-6","type":"heading","anchor":"adapter-behavior","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"adapter-behavior\">Adapter behavior</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"adapter-behavior\">适配器行为</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><code>AzureQueueAdapter</code> is read-write and not rewindable. A producer encodes the stream identity, payload, and request context using an <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueuedataadapter-2/\">IQueueDataAdapter&lt;T, U&gt;</a>, then sends an Azure Queue message to the mapped queue. The receiver assigns the local sequence token used for delivery and acknowledgement.</p>","zh":"<p><code>AzureQueueAdapter</code> 支持读写，但不支持回退。生产者使用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueuedataadapter-2/\">IQueueDataAdapter&lt;T, U&gt;</a> 编码流身份、负载和请求上下文，然后将 Azure Queue 消息发送到映射的队列。接收器分配用于投递和确认的本地序列令牌。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Because Azure Queue Storage does not expose a durable arbitrary stream offset, a non-null rewind token is rejected. <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.providers.streams.azurequeue.azurequeuedataadapterv2/\">AzureQueueDataAdapterV2</a> is the default encoding. Version 1 remains for compatibility with existing messages, not as the preferred format for new providers.</p>","zh":"<p>由于 Azure Queue Storage 不公开具有持久性的任意流偏移量，因此会拒绝非 null 的回退令牌。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.providers.streams.azurequeue.azurequeuedataadapterv2/\">AzureQueueDataAdapterV2</a> 是默认编码。版本 1 仍被保留，以兼容已有消息，但并非新提供程序的首选格式。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Azure/Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/Providers/Streams/AzureQueue/AzureQueueAdapter.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>AzureQueueAdapter</code></a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Azure/Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/Providers/Streams/AzureQueue/IAzureQueueDataAdapter.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>IAzureQueueDataAdapter</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>源码： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Azure/Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/Providers/Streams/AzureQueue/AzureQueueAdapter.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>AzureQueueAdapter</code> </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Azure/Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/Providers/Streams/AzureQueue/IAzureQueueDataAdapter.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>IAzureQueueDataAdapter</code> </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-10","type":"heading","anchor":"receive-and-acknowledgement","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"receive-and-acknowledgement\">Receive and acknowledgement</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"receive-and-acknowledgement\">接收与确认</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><code>AzureQueueAdapterReceiver</code> asks Azure Queue Storage for up to 32 visible messages at a time. Azure Queue Storage’s <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/rest/api/storageservices/get-messages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Get Messages operation</a> makes a received message temporarily invisible; it does not delete it. The pulling agent decodes and delivers the batch through its cache and cursors. Only messages reported as delivered are removed using the <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/rest/api/storageservices/delete-message2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Delete Message operation</a>.</p>","zh":"<p><code>AzureQueueAdapterReceiver</code> 每次向 Azure Queue Storage 请求至多 32 条可见消息。Azure Queue Storage 的 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/rest/api/storageservices/get-messages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Get Messages 操作 </a> 会使接收到的消息暂时不可见，并不会删除它。拉取代理通过其缓存和游标解码并投递批次。只有报告为已投递的消息，才会通过 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/rest/api/storageservices/delete-message2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Delete Message 操作 </a> 移除。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-12","type":"diagram","en":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"ff36ed0c545cc9f2fc1dfde6e7574bd21221050a030ac639e6449086eaa9bee6\" data-diagram-language=\"en\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rendering diagram…\">Rendering diagram…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>Original Mermaid source</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Agent as Pulling agent\n    participant Receiver as AzureQueueAdapterReceiver\n    participant Queue as Azure Queue Storage\n    participant Consumer\n\n    Agent-&gt;&gt;Receiver: GetQueueMessagesAsync\n    Receiver-&gt;&gt;Queue: Receive visible messages\n    Queue--&gt;&gt;Receiver: Messages + pop receipts\n    Receiver--&gt;&gt;Agent: Batch containers\n    Agent-&gt;&gt;Consumer: Deliver\n    Consumer--&gt;&gt;Agent: Completed\n    Agent-&gt;&gt;Receiver: MessagesDeliveredAsync\n    Receiver-&gt;&gt;Queue: Delete with pop receipt</code></pre></details></figure>","zh":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"ff36ed0c545cc9f2fc1dfde6e7574bd21221050a030ac639e6449086eaa9bee6\" data-diagram-language=\"zh\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正在绘制图表…\">正在绘制图表…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看原始 Mermaid 图表代码</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Agent as Pulling agent\n    participant Receiver as AzureQueueAdapterReceiver\n    participant Queue as Azure Queue Storage\n    participant Consumer\n\n    Agent-&gt;&gt;Receiver: GetQueueMessagesAsync\n    Receiver-&gt;&gt;Queue: Receive visible messages\n    Queue--&gt;&gt;Receiver: Messages + pop receipts\n    Receiver--&gt;&gt;Agent: Batch containers\n    Agent-&gt;&gt;Consumer: Deliver\n    Consumer--&gt;&gt;Agent: Completed\n    Agent-&gt;&gt;Receiver: MessagesDeliveredAsync\n    Receiver-&gt;&gt;Queue: Delete with pop receipt</code></pre></details></figure>","diagram":"ff36ed0c545cc9f2fc1dfde6e7574bd21221050a030ac639e6449086eaa9bee6","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-13","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>During graceful queue ownership transfer, the previous receiver uses the <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/rest/api/storageservices/update-message\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Update Message operation</a> to make every prefetched, unacknowledged message visible immediately. The replacement receiver can therefore resume delivery without waiting for the visibility timeout. Credentials must authorize that operation; a queue service SAS includes the <code>u</code> permission. When an update fails, Orleans logs the release failure and Azure makes the message available when its existing visibility lease expires.</p>","zh":"<p>在有序的队列所有权转移期间，原接收器使用 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/rest/api/storageservices/update-message\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Update Message 操作 </a> ，使所有已预取但尚未确认的消息立即可见。因此，替代接收器无需等待可见性超时，即可恢复投递。凭据必须授权该操作；队列服务 SAS 应包含 <code>u</code> 权限。更新失败时，Orleans 会记录释放失败，Azure 则在消息当前的不可见租约到期后使其再次可用。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>If the receiver, agent, or silo fails before this handoff completes, the visibility timeout eventually expires and Azure can return the message again. Consumers must tolerate redelivery. If visibility expires while a message is still being processed, delete can fail because the pop receipt is no longer current.</p>","zh":"<p>如果接收器、代理或 Silo 在移交完成之前发生故障，可见性超时最终会到期，Azure 可以再次返回该消息。消费者必须容忍重新投递。如果消息仍在处理时不可见期已到期，删除可能失败，因为 pop receipt（出队回执）已不再是当前有效值。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Azure/Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/Providers/Streams/AzureQueue/AzureQueueAdapterReceiver.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>AzureQueueAdapterReceiver</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>源码： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Azure/Orleans.Streaming.AzureStorage/Providers/Streams/AzureQueue/AzureQueueAdapterReceiver.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>AzureQueueAdapterReceiver</code> </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-16","type":"heading","anchor":"queue-mapping-and-defaults","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"queue-mapping-and-defaults\">Queue mapping and defaults</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"queue-mapping-and-defaults\">队列映射与默认值</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>When <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.configuration.azurequeueoptions/properties/\">AzureQueueOptions.QueueNames</a> is not supplied, provider configuration generates names from the Orleans service ID and provider name. The hash-ring queue mapper defaults to eight queues. Each owned queue has one pulling agent and one queue cache on its current silo.</p>","zh":"<p>未提供 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.configuration.azurequeueoptions/properties/\">AzureQueueOptions.QueueNames</a> 时，提供程序配置会根据 Orleans 服务 ID 和提供程序名称生成队列名称。哈希环队列映射器默认使用 8 个队列。每个被分配的队列在其当前 Silo 上都有一个拉取代理和一个队列缓存。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Common persistent-stream defaults used by this provider are:</p>","zh":"<p>此提供程序使用的通用持久流默认值如下：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-19","type":"table","en":"<table><thead><tr><th>Setting</th><th>Default</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.hashringstreamqueuemapperoptions/properties/\">HashRingStreamQueueMapperOptions.TotalQueueCount</a></td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.streampullingagentoptions/properties/\">StreamPullingAgentOptions.GetQueueMsgsTimerPeriod</a></td><td>100 ms</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.simplequeuecacheoptions/properties/\">SimpleQueueCacheOptions.CacheSize</a></td><td>4,096 batch containers</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.streampullingagentoptions/properties/\">StreamPullingAgentOptions.MaxEventDeliveryTime</a></td><td>1 minute</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.streampullingagentoptions/properties/\">StreamPullingAgentOptions.StreamInactivityPeriod</a></td><td>30 minutes</td></tr></tbody></table>","zh":"<table><thead><tr><th>设置</th><th>默认值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.hashringstreamqueuemapperoptions/properties/\">HashRingStreamQueueMapperOptions.TotalQueueCount</a></td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.streampullingagentoptions/properties/\">StreamPullingAgentOptions.GetQueueMsgsTimerPeriod</a></td><td>100 毫秒</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.simplequeuecacheoptions/properties/\">SimpleQueueCacheOptions.CacheSize</a></td><td>4,096 个批容器</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.streampullingagentoptions/properties/\">StreamPullingAgentOptions.MaxEventDeliveryTime</a></td><td>1 分钟</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.streampullingagentoptions/properties/\">StreamPullingAgentOptions.StreamInactivityPeriod</a></td><td>30 分钟</td></tr></tbody></table>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-20","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The number of queues bounds pulling parallelism and ownership granularity. Changing queue names changes the physical partition set and must be treated as a data migration, not routine tuning.</p>","zh":"<p>队列数量限定拉取并行度和所有权粒度。更改队列名称会改变物理分区集合，必须将其视为数据迁移，而非例行调优。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-21","type":"heading","anchor":"visibility-and-cache-progress-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"visibility-and-cache-progress-\">Visibility and cache progress <span id=\"tuning\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"visibility-and-cache-progress-\">可见性与缓存进度 <span id=\"tuning\"> </span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-22","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Azure visibility and Orleans cache retention are different clocks:</p>","zh":"<p>Azure 可见性与 Orleans 缓存保留使用不同的计时机制：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-23","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>visibility controls when an undeleted Azure message can be received again;</li>\n<li>the queue cache controls how long the pulling agent retains a batch for active subscription cursors.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>可见性控制未删除的 Azure 消息何时可以再次被接收；</li>\n<li>队列缓存控制拉取代理为活动订阅游标保留批次的时长。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-24","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>A <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.configuration.azurequeueoptions/properties/\">AzureQueueOptions.MessageVisibilityTimeout</a> value which is shorter than worst-case delivery increases duplicate receive and stale pop-receipt risk. An excessively long timeout delays recovery after agent failure. Choose values from measured delivery latency and failure objectives; operational tuning belongs with the <a href=\"#/docs/streaming/stream-providers/\">stream provider guidance</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>如果 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming.azurestorage/orleans.configuration.azurequeueoptions/properties/\">AzureQueueOptions.MessageVisibilityTimeout</a> 小于最坏情况下的投递时长，就会增加重复接收和 pop receipt 过期的风险。超时时间过长则会延迟代理故障后的恢复。应依据测得的投递延迟和故障目标选择取值；运维调优参见 <a href=\"#/docs/streaming/stream-providers/\"> 流提供程序指导 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-25","type":"heading","anchor":"extension-and-compatibility-points","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"extension-and-compatibility-points\">Extension and compatibility points</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"extension-and-compatibility-points\">扩展与兼容性要点</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-26","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>A custom <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueuedataadapter-2/\">IQueueDataAdapter&lt;T, U&gt;</a> changes payload encoding while retaining the Azure transport. It preserves stream identity, the request-context values defined by the wire contract, and the sequence information used by consumers. Follow <a href=\"#/docs/streaming/data-adapters/\">Customize persistent-stream data formats</a> for a compiling implementation and versioned rollout guidance.</p>","zh":"<p>自定义 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.streams.iqueuedataadapter-2/\">IQueueDataAdapter&lt;T, U&gt;</a> 在保留 Azure 传输的同时改变负载编码。它保留流身份、通信协定定义的请求上下文值，以及消费者使用的序列信息。可编译的实现和按版本逐步部署的指导，参见 <a href=\"#/docs/streaming/data-adapters/\"> 自定义持久流数据格式 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"3294b495ffa41f0e-27","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Configuration binding behavior is tested by <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/test/Extensions/Orleans.Azure.Tests/Streaming/AzureQueueStreamProviderBuilderTests.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>AzureQueueStreamProviderBuilderTests</code></a>. Adapter acknowledgement and cursor behavior are covered by <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/test/Extensions/Orleans.Azure.Tests/Streaming/AzureQueueAdapterTests.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>AzureQueueAdapterTests</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/test/Extensions/Orleans.Azure.Tests/Streaming/AzureQueueStreamProviderBuilderTests.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>AzureQueueStreamProviderBuilderTests</code> </a> 测试配置绑定行为。 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/test/Extensions/Orleans.Azure.Tests/Streaming/AzureQueueAdapterTests.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>AzureQueueAdapterTests</code> </a> 覆盖适配器确认和游标行为。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"b028cff10c0cd8ea":{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea","title":"TestingHost architecture","titleZh":"TestingHost 架构","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/testing/","sourceHash":"e1cd3b9da0f444f2c3aaeef429333c1102b7af099695b87253fbfca03f828159","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">TestingHost architecture</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">TestingHost architecture</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.TestingHost/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>Microsoft.Orleans.TestingHost</code></a> package composes real silo and client hosts with test-oriented discovery, transport, statistics, directory, and lifecycle controls. It is an integration harness, not a mock grain runtime. Grain activation, scheduling, serialization, messaging, placement, and most provider behavior execute through the same runtime components as a hosted cluster.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.TestingHost/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>Microsoft.Orleans.TestingHost</code> </a> 包将真实的 Silo 和客户端宿主，与面向测试的发现、传输、统计信息、目录和生命周期控制组合起来。它是集成测试环境，而不是模拟的 Grain 运行时。Grain 激活、调度、序列化、消息传递、放置，以及大多数提供程序行为，都通过与实际托管集群相同的运行时组件执行。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>This page describes the harness internals. For practical setup, fixture patterns, topology changes, and guidance on choosing mocks or a cluster, see <a href=\"#/docs/grains/testing/\">Test Orleans applications</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>本页介绍测试环境的内部机制。实际设置、夹具模式、拓扑变更，以及如何选择模拟对象或集群的指导，参见 <a href=\"#/docs/grains/testing/\"> 测试 Orleans 应用 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-3","type":"heading","anchor":"cluster-object-model-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"cluster-object-model-\">Cluster object model <span id=\"use-the-inprocesstestcluster-recommended\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"cluster-object-model-\">集群对象模型 <span id=\"use-the-inprocesstestcluster-recommended\"> </span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-4","type":"diagram","en":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"2c51a58d249f5b36cd95de3089632a90a19c3c5e07408a4b0df0fee35dbce76c\" data-diagram-language=\"en\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rendering diagram…\">Rendering diagram…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>Original Mermaid source</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart TB\n    Builder[InProcessTestClusterBuilder]\n    Options[InProcessTestClusterOptions]\n    Cluster[InProcessTestCluster]\n    Client[In-process ClusterClient]\n    S1[InProcessSiloHandle 1]\n    S2[InProcessSiloHandle 2]\n    Hosts[Independent Generic Hosts]\n\n    Builder --&gt; Options\n    Builder --&gt; Cluster\n    Cluster --&gt; Client\n    Cluster --&gt; S1\n    Cluster --&gt; S2\n    S1 --&gt; Hosts\n    S2 --&gt; Hosts</code></pre></details></figure>","zh":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"2c51a58d249f5b36cd95de3089632a90a19c3c5e07408a4b0df0fee35dbce76c\" data-diagram-language=\"zh\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正在绘制图表…\">正在绘制图表…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看原始 Mermaid 图表代码</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart TB\n    Builder[InProcessTestClusterBuilder]\n    Options[InProcessTestClusterOptions]\n    Cluster[InProcessTestCluster]\n    Client[In-process ClusterClient]\n    S1[InProcessSiloHandle 1]\n    S2[InProcessSiloHandle 2]\n    Hosts[Independent Generic Hosts]\n\n    Builder --&gt; Options\n    Builder --&gt; Cluster\n    Cluster --&gt; Client\n    Cluster --&gt; S1\n    Cluster --&gt; S2\n    S1 --&gt; Hosts\n    S2 --&gt; Hosts</code></pre></details></figure>","diagram":"2c51a58d249f5b36cd95de3089632a90a19c3c5e07408a4b0df0fee35dbce76c","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/\">InProcessTestClusterBuilder</a> accumulates host, silo, and client delegates. <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/methods/\">Build</a> passes its options to an <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/\">InProcessTestCluster</a>; the cluster retains that mutable options object. <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">DeployAsync</a> starts the configured silo hosts and initializes the client when requested. With client initialization enabled, it performs a best-effort initial membership-view check but can continue after warning that views have not stabilized. Each <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesssilohandle/\">InProcessSiloHandle</a> owns one Generic Host and exposes its service provider for test inspection.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/\">InProcessTestClusterBuilder</a> 汇集宿主、Silo 和客户端委托。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/methods/\"> Build </a> 将其选项传给 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/\">InProcessTestCluster</a> ；集群保留这一可变选项对象。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">DeployAsync</a> 启动配置的 Silo 宿主，并在需要时初始化客户端。启用客户端初始化时，它会尽力执行初始成员视图检查，但在警告视图尚未稳定后仍可继续。每个 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesssilohandle/\">InProcessSiloHandle</a> 拥有一个通用宿主，并公开其服务提供者供测试检查。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The processes are shared, but the hosts and dependency-injection containers are not. Static process state can still leak between silos, which is one reason production code should not use static mutable state for silo-local behavior.</p>","zh":"<p>进程是共享的，但宿主和依赖注入容器并不共享。进程静态状态仍可能在 Silo 之间泄漏，这也是生产代码不应使用静态可变状态实现 Silo 本地行为的原因之一。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>API: <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/\">InProcessTestClusterBuilder</a>, <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/\">InProcessTestCluster</a>, and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesssilohandle/\">InProcessSiloHandle</a>. Implementation: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/InProcTestClusterBuilder.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">builder</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/InProcTestCluster.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cluster</a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/InProcessSiloHandle.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">silo handle</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>API： <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/\">InProcessTestClusterBuilder</a> 、 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/\">InProcessTestCluster</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesssilohandle/\">InProcessSiloHandle</a> 。实现： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/InProcTestClusterBuilder.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 构建器 </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/InProcTestCluster.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 集群 </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/InProcessSiloHandle.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Silo 句柄 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-8","type":"heading","anchor":"defaults","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"defaults\">Defaults</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"defaults\">默认值</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/\">InProcessTestClusterBuilder</a> defaults to:</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/\">InProcessTestClusterBuilder</a> 的默认设置如下：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-10","type":"table","en":"<table><thead><tr><th>Setting</th><th>Default</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions.InitialSilosCount</a></td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions.ClusterId</a></td><td>Newly generated</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions.ServiceId</a></td><td>Newly generated GUID</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions.InitializeClientOnDeploy</a></td><td><code>true</code></td></tr><tr><td>Test-cluster membership</td><td><code>true</code></td></tr><tr><td>Test-cluster grain directory</td><td><code>true</code></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions.UseDistributedGrainDirectory</a></td><td><code>false</code></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions.GatewayPerSilo</a></td><td><code>true</code></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions.UseRealEnvironmentStatistics</a></td><td><code>false</code></td></tr><tr><td>Connection transport</td><td>In-memory</td></tr></tbody></table>","zh":"<table><thead><tr><th>设置</th><th>默认值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions.InitialSilosCount</a></td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions.ClusterId</a></td><td>新生成</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions.ServiceId</a></td><td>新生成的 GUID</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions.InitializeClientOnDeploy</a></td><td><code>true</code></td></tr><tr><td>测试集群成员管理</td><td><code>true</code></td></tr><tr><td>测试集群 Grain 目录</td><td><code>true</code></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions.UseDistributedGrainDirectory</a></td><td><code>false</code></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions.GatewayPerSilo</a></td><td><code>true</code></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions.UseRealEnvironmentStatistics</a></td><td><code>false</code></td></tr><tr><td>连接传输</td><td>内存</td></tr></tbody></table>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Simulated environment statistics make resource-based tests deterministic, but they do not reproduce operating-system CPU or memory pressure. Opt into real statistics only when the test specifically needs those signals.</p>","zh":"<p>模拟环境统计信息使基于资源的测试具有确定性，但并不会再现操作系统的 CPU 或内存压力。只有测试明确需要这些信号时，才应启用真实统计信息。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>These defaults are defined by <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/\">InProcessTestClusterBuilder</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions</a>; see their <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/InProcTestClusterBuilder.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">builder</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/InProcTestClusterOptions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">options</a> implementations.</p>","zh":"<p>这些默认值由 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/\">InProcessTestClusterBuilder</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/\">InProcessTestClusterOptions</a> 定义；参见其 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/InProcTestClusterBuilder.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 构建器 </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/InProcTestClusterOptions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 选项 </a> 实现。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-13","type":"heading","anchor":"directory-selection","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"directory-selection\">Directory selection</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"directory-selection\">目录选择</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Setting <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">UseDistributedGrainDirectory</a> to <code>true</code> selects the distributed default after the silo configuration delegates run, replacing any default selected by those delegates. Named directory registrations remain available.</p>","zh":"<p>将 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusteroptions/properties/\">UseDistributedGrainDirectory</a> 设为 <code>true</code> ，会在 Silo 配置委托运行后选择默认的分布式目录，替换这些委托选择的任何默认目录。命名目录注册仍然可用。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>With this option set to <code>false</code>, test membership and the enabled test grain directory select the shared in-process test directory. When that substitution is inapplicable, such as with an external membership provider, the silo keeps its configured directory. An unconfigured silo uses the runtime’s distributed default.</p>","zh":"<p>此选项设为 <code>false</code> 时，测试成员管理和已启用的测试 Grain 目录会选择共享的进程内测试目录。当这种替换不适用时，例如使用外部成员管理提供程序时，Silo 会保留其配置的目录。未配置的 Silo 使用运行时默认的分布式目录。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>To select <code>LegacyGrainDirectory</code>, set the option to <code>false</code> and call <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.corehostingextensions/methods/\">UseLegacyGrainDirectory</a> in <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/methods/\">ConfigureSilo</a> while using external membership or disabling the test-directory substitution. Host configuration delegates run before the harness’s final silo setup, so declarative providers read the configuration supplied by those delegates.</p>","zh":"<p>要选择 <code>LegacyGrainDirectory</code> ，将选项设为 <code>false</code> ，在 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/methods/\">ConfigureSilo</a> 中调用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.corehostingextensions/methods/\">UseLegacyGrainDirectory</a> ，同时使用外部成员管理或禁用测试目录替换。宿主配置委托在测试环境的最终 Silo 设置之前运行，因此，声明式提供程序会读取这些委托提供的配置。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-17","type":"heading","anchor":"configuration-layers-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"configuration-layers-\">Configuration layers <span id=\"configure-the-test-cluster\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"configuration-layers-\">配置层次 <span id=\"configure-the-test-cluster\"> </span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The builder separates three scopes:</p>","zh":"<p>构建器区分三个作用域：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-19","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/methods/\">ConfigureHost</a> applies to both silo and client Generic Hosts and is useful for shared configuration or keyed SDK clients.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/methods/\">ConfigureSilo</a> receives per-silo options and an <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.isilobuilder/\">ISiloBuilder</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/methods/\">ConfigureClient</a> configures the cluster client.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/methods/\">ConfigureHost</a> 同时适用于 Silo 和客户端的通用宿主，可用于共享配置或按键注册的 SDK 客户端。</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/methods/\">ConfigureSilo</a> 接收每个 Silo 的选项和一个 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.isilobuilder/\">ISiloBuilder</a> 。</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestclusterbuilder/methods/\">ConfigureClient</a> 配置集群客户端。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-20","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Delegates run for each relevant host. A singleton registered by a silo delegate is singleton within that silo’s container, not across the cluster. A concrete instance captured by a delegate is shared because the test supplied the same object.</p>","zh":"<p>委托会为每个相关宿主运行。由 Silo 委托注册的单例，仅在该 Silo 的容器中是单例，并非整个集群共享。委托捕获的具体实例则是共享的，因为测试提供的是同一个对象。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-21","type":"heading","anchor":"dynamic-topology-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"dynamic-topology-\">Dynamic topology <span id=\"add-and-remove-silos-during-tests\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"dynamic-topology-\">动态拓扑 <span id=\"add-and-remove-silos-during-tests\"> </span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-22","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StartAdditionalSiloAsync</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StartSilosAsync</a> create new hosts using the cluster’s current options and configuration delegates. <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StopSiloAsync</a>, <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StopSilosAsync</a>, <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StopAllSilosAsync</a>, <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">WaitForLivenessToStabilizeAsync</a>, and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">WaitForClusterManifestToStabilizeAsync</a> coordinate membership and manifest transitions for failure and elasticity tests.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StartAdditionalSiloAsync</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StartSilosAsync</a> 使用集群当前的选项和配置委托创建新宿主。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StopSiloAsync</a> 、 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StopSilosAsync</a> 、 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StopAllSilosAsync</a> 、 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">WaitForLivenessToStabilizeAsync</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">WaitForClusterManifestToStabilizeAsync</a> 为故障与弹性测试协调成员及清单转换。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-23","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The overloads which take <code>startAdditionalSiloOnNewPort</code> are obsolete. Tests should use the parameterless <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StartAdditionalSilo</a> overloads or <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StartSilosAsync</a>. Lower-level <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StartSiloAsync</a> overloads remain available when a test must supply an instance number or configuration overrides.</p>","zh":"<p>接受 <code>startAdditionalSiloOnNewPort</code> 的重载已过时。测试应使用无参数的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StartAdditionalSilo</a> 重载或 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StartSilosAsync</a> 。当测试必须提供实例编号或配置覆盖项时，仍可使用较低层的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.inprocesstestcluster/methods/\">StartSiloAsync</a> 重载。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-24","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Stopping a host gracefully exercises shutdown. Disposing or terminating a handle without graceful membership update is a different failure mode and should be chosen deliberately when testing failure detection.</p>","zh":"<p>优雅停止宿主用于测试关闭过程。在不进行有序成员更新的情况下释放或终止句柄，是另一种故障模式；测试故障检测时，应有意识地选择该模式。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-25","type":"heading","anchor":"class-configurator-test-cluster-and-custom-silo-creation-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"class-configurator-test-cluster-and-custom-silo-creation-\">Class-configurator test cluster and custom silo creation <span id=\"use-the-testcluster\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"class-configurator-test-cluster-and-custom-silo-creation-\">基于配置器类的测试集群与自定义 Silo 创建 <span id=\"use-the-testcluster\"> </span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-26","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testclusterbuilder/\">TestClusterBuilder</a> is the class-configurator-based harness. It defaults to two silos, in-memory transport, generated cluster identity, test membership, client initialization, file logging, and homogeneous-silo assumptions. It also installs <code>ConfigureDistributedGrainDirectory</code>, configuring its silos with the distributed grain directory.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testclusterbuilder/\">TestClusterBuilder</a> 是基于配置器类的测试环境。默认使用两个 Silo、内存内传输、生成的集群身份、测试成员管理、客户端初始化、文件日志，以及同构 Silo 假设。它还安装 <code>ConfigureDistributedGrainDirectory</code> ，为其 Silo 配置分布式 Grain 目录。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-27","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.isiloconfigurator/\">ISiloConfigurator</a>, <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.ihostconfigurator/\">IHostConfigurator</a>, and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.iclientbuilderconfigurator/\">IClientBuilderConfigurator</a> are serializable configuration identities which can be applied to every host. Assigning <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testclusterbuilder/properties/\">TestClusterBuilder.CreateSiloAsync</a> sets <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testclusteroptions/properties/\">TestClusterOptions.ConnectionTransport</a> to <code>TcpSocket</code>, so the built-in client uses its TCP transport instead of the harness’s in-memory transport. The delegate bypasses <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testcluster/methods/\">DefaultCreateSiloAsync</a> and cannot access the harness’s private in-memory transport hub, so it must configure the custom silo host with a compatible transport.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.isiloconfigurator/\">ISiloConfigurator</a> 、 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.ihostconfigurator/\">IHostConfigurator</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.iclientbuilderconfigurator/\">IClientBuilderConfigurator</a> 是可序列化的配置标识，可以应用于每个宿主。为 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testclusterbuilder/properties/\">TestClusterBuilder.CreateSiloAsync</a> 赋值会将 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testclusteroptions/properties/\">TestClusterOptions.ConnectionTransport</a> 设为 <code>TcpSocket</code> ，使内置客户端使用 TCP 传输，而非测试环境的内存内传输。该委托绕过 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testcluster/methods/\">DefaultCreateSiloAsync</a> ，无法访问测试环境私有的内存内传输中心，因此，必须为自定义 Silo 宿主配置兼容的传输。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-28","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testcluster/\">TestCluster</a> supports suites built around <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.silohandle/\">SiloHandle</a> and configurator types. It does not use separate application domains; its hosts run in-process unless a custom silo creation path provides different isolation.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testcluster/\">TestCluster</a> 支持围绕 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.silohandle/\">SiloHandle</a> 和配置器类型构建的测试套件。它不使用独立的应用程序域；除非自定义 Silo 创建路径提供不同的隔离方式，否则其宿主都在进程内运行。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-29","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>API: <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testclusterbuilder/\">TestClusterBuilder</a>, <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testcluster/\">TestCluster</a>, and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testclusteroptions/\">TestClusterOptions</a>. Implementation: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/TestClusterBuilder.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">builder</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/TestCluster.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cluster</a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/TestClusterOptions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">options</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>API： <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testclusterbuilder/\">TestClusterBuilder</a> 、 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testcluster/\">TestCluster</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.testinghost/orleans.testinghost.testclusteroptions/\">TestClusterOptions</a> 。实现： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/TestClusterBuilder.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 构建器 </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/TestCluster.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 集群 </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.TestingHost/TestClusterOptions.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 选项 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-30","type":"heading","anchor":"fidelity-boundaries-","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"fidelity-boundaries-\">Fidelity boundaries <span id=\"use-mocks\"></span></h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"fidelity-boundaries-\">真实性边界 <span id=\"use-mocks\"> </span></h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-31","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>TestingHost deliberately substitutes infrastructure. Tests must account for those boundaries:</p>","zh":"<p>TestingHost 有意替换基础设施。测试必须考虑这些边界：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-32","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>in-memory transport does not reproduce sockets, TLS, packet loss, or network buffers;</li>\n<li>test membership does not prove a production membership provider’s transaction behavior;</li>\n<li>the test grain directory can bypass production directory edge cases;</li>\n<li>simulated statistics do not reproduce load shedding;</li>\n<li>one process shares thread-pool and static state; and</li>\n<li>graceful stop does not model abrupt process or machine loss.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>内存内传输不会再现套接字、TLS、丢包或网络缓冲区；</li>\n<li>测试成员管理无法证明生产成员管理提供程序的事务行为；</li>\n<li>测试 Grain 目录可能绕过生产目录的边界情况；</li>\n<li>模拟统计信息不会再现负载削减；</li>\n<li>同一进程共享线程池和静态状态；以及</li>\n<li>优雅停止无法模拟进程或机器突然丢失。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-33","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Use the smallest substitution which keeps the invariant under test real. Directory, membership, transport, and provider contract tests often need their production component explicitly enabled.</p>","zh":"<p>采用能够保持所测不变量真实有效的最小替换。目录、成员管理、传输和提供程序协定测试，通常需要显式启用对应的生产组件。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-34","type":"heading","anchor":"test-architecture-in-the-repository","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"test-architecture-in-the-repository\">Test architecture in the repository</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"test-architecture-in-the-repository\">代码仓库中的测试架构</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"b028cff10c0cd8ea-35","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Repository fixtures such as <code>BaseInProcessTestClusterFixture</code> wrap cluster setup and disposal, while specialized suites configure the component being exercised. For example, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/test/Extensions/Orleans.Azure.Tests/Streaming/AQStreamingTests.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>AQStreamingTests</code></a> uses <code>ConfigureHost</code>, <code>ConfigureSilo</code>, and <code>ConfigureClient</code> to combine real Azure Queue adapters with an in-process Orleans cluster.</p>","zh":"<p><code>BaseInProcessTestClusterFixture</code> 等仓库夹具封装集群设置和释放，而专门的测试套件配置待测组件。例如， <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/test/Extensions/Orleans.Azure.Tests/Streaming/AQStreamingTests.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>AQStreamingTests</code> </a> 使用 <code>ConfigureHost</code> 、 <code>ConfigureSilo</code> 和 <code>ConfigureClient</code> ，将真实 Azure Queue 适配器与进程内 Orleans 集群组合起来。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"6771be00cdd23a28":{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28","title":"Transaction implementation","titleZh":"事务实现","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/implementation/transactions/","sourceHash":"bd4c143c85b29d52338de63624a8f6ed86ba0c2cf11b2b8fc1adaf288acd4627","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Transaction implementation</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">事务实现</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans transactions coordinate transactional state across grains. The runtime uses a transaction agent to collect participants and choose a commit path, a transaction manager to make the durable decision, and a <code>TransactionQueue</code> at each participant to serialize versions and apply or restore state.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 事务协调跨 Grain 的事务状态。运行时使用事务代理收集参与者并选择提交路径，使用事务管理器作出持久化决定，并在每个参与者处使用 <code>TransactionQueue</code> 串行处理版本以及应用或恢复状态。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-2","type":"heading","anchor":"coordination-model","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"coordination-model\">Coordination model</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"coordination-model\">协调模型</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><code>TransactionAgent.StartTransaction</code> creates a transaction ID and causal timestamp. The overload detector admits a new transaction when the silo has safe transactional capacity and returns a start failure under overload. As grain calls access transactional resources, the transaction context records read and write counters and identifies a manager. Read-only transactions can contact resources directly. Read-write transactions send prepare messages to other resources and ask the manager to prepare and commit.</p>","zh":"<p><code>TransactionAgent.StartTransaction</code> 创建事务 ID 和因果时间戳。当 Silo 具有安全的事务处理容量时，过载检测器会接纳新事务；过载时则返回启动失败。当 Grain 调用访问事务资源时，事务上下文记录读写计数器，并确定管理器。只读事务可以直接联系资源。读写事务向其他资源发送准备消息，并请求管理器执行准备和提交。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The manager is selected from the participants, with an explicit priority manager taking precedence. The agent sends one-way prepare notifications to non-manager resources, then waits for the manager’s result. This reduces coordination round trips while keeping one authoritative decision for write transactions.</p>","zh":"<p>管理器从参与者中选出，显式指定的优先管理器具有优先权。代理向非管理器资源发送单向准备通知，然后等待管理器的结果。这在为写事务保留唯一权威决定的同时，减少了协调往返。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-5","type":"diagram","en":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"6de0a437633905f9bb0c972a96d2f9711708e4de072c2dba8967e4ae1fb11c5c\" data-diagram-language=\"en\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rendering diagram…\">Rendering diagram…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>Original Mermaid source</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Agent as TransactionAgent\n    participant Resource as Participant queues\n    participant Manager as Transaction manager\n    participant Store as Transactional storage\n    Agent-&gt;&gt;Resource: prepare reads and writes\n    Agent-&gt;&gt;Manager: prepare and commit\n    Manager-&gt;&gt;Store: persist decision/record\n    Manager--&gt;&gt;Resource: commit or abort\n    Resource-&gt;&gt;Store: apply or restore state</code></pre></details></figure>","zh":"<figure class=\"doc-diagram\" data-diagram-key=\"6de0a437633905f9bb0c972a96d2f9711708e4de072c2dba8967e4ae1fb11c5c\" data-diagram-language=\"zh\"><div class=\"diagram-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正在绘制图表…\">正在绘制图表…</div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看原始 Mermaid 图表代码</summary><pre data-language=\"mermaid\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Agent as TransactionAgent\n    participant Resource as Participant queues\n    participant Manager as Transaction manager\n    participant Store as Transactional storage\n    Agent-&gt;&gt;Resource: prepare reads and writes\n    Agent-&gt;&gt;Manager: prepare and commit\n    Manager-&gt;&gt;Store: persist decision/record\n    Manager--&gt;&gt;Resource: commit or abort\n    Resource-&gt;&gt;Store: apply or restore state</code></pre></details></figure>","diagram":"6de0a437633905f9bb0c972a96d2f9711708e4de072c2dba8967e4ae1fb11c5c","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-6","type":"heading","anchor":"participant-queues-and-isolation","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"participant-queues-and-isolation\">Participant queues and isolation</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"participant-queues-and-isolation\">参与者队列与隔离</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><code>TransactionQueue</code> keeps pending transaction records, commit records, and a stable sequence for a transactional state. It uses access counters to determine whether a transaction read or wrote a resource, holds the required locks while a transaction is unresolved, and applies the committed state in order. A participant can therefore reject a conflicting access before the manager has committed.</p>","zh":"<p><code>TransactionQueue</code> 为事务状态保存待处理事务记录、提交记录和稳定的序列。它通过访问计数器判断事务是否读取或写入了某个资源，在事务结果尚未确定时持有所需的锁，并按顺序应用已提交状态。因此，参与者可以在管理器提交之前拒绝冲突的访问。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Transactional storage extends grain persistence with queue load, commit, restore, and recovery operations. A storage failure can leave a transaction in a prepared or uncertain state, so the queue persists enough information to recover after activation or process restart.</p>","zh":"<p>事务存储通过队列加载、提交、还原和恢复操作扩展 Grain 持久化。存储故障可能使事务停留在已准备或结果不确定的状态，因此队列会持久化足够的信息，以便在激活实例或进程重启后恢复。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-9","type":"heading","anchor":"decisions-and-failure-behavior","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"decisions-and-failure-behavior\">Decisions and failure behavior</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"decisions-and-failure-behavior\">决定与失败行为</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The agent distinguishes a successful decision, a participant response timeout, a transaction-manager response timeout, and a presumed abort. A timeout leaves participant outcome uncertain because the manager might have committed durably before losing its response. For definite aborts where the agent retains notification ownership, it sends cancellation messages to release participant locks.</p>","zh":"<p>代理会区分成功决定、参与者响应超时、事务管理器响应超时和推定中止。超时会使参与者的结果处于不确定状态，因为管理器可能在响应丢失之前已经持久提交。对于明确中止且代理仍负责通知的情况，它会发送取消消息以释放参与者的锁。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The manager’s durable local commit completes the caller’s transaction promise. It then schedules the confirmation worker to notify and collect the remaining participants. Recovery replays pending commit confirmations and aborts from manager or participant queue records, so participant notification can continue after the caller receives a successful result.</p>","zh":"<p>管理器完成持久化的本地提交后，会完成调用方等待的事务结果。随后，它调度确认工作器，通知并收集其余参与者。恢复会从管理器或参与者的队列记录中回放待处理的提交确认和中止，因此即使调用方已收到成功结果，参与者通知仍可能继续进行。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The disabled agent explicitly rejects transactional operations. Overload throttling returns transaction-start failures while bounding queued work.</p>","zh":"<p>禁用状态的事务代理会显式拒绝事务操作。过载节流会返回事务启动失败，同时限制排队工作的规模。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-13","type":"heading","anchor":"activation-shutdown","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"activation-shutdown\">Activation shutdown</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"activation-shutdown\">激活实例关闭</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Normal grain deactivation waits for active requests to finish. Transaction queues also run background storage cycles which can continue after a protocol request returns. During lifecycle shutdown, each queue signals cancellation to stop new lock, storage, confirmation, and collection cycles, then waits for its storage worker to finish.</p>","zh":"<p>正常的 Grain 停用会等待活跃请求完成。事务队列还运行后台存储处理周期，这些周期可能在协议请求返回后继续执行。在生命周期关闭期间，每个队列都会发出取消信号，以停止新的锁、存储、确认和收集周期，然后等待其存储工作器完成。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The storage wait covers the active cycle’s persistence outcome, state updates, recovery, and batch follow-up callbacks. Its budget comes from the lifecycle cancellation token, which reflects host cancellation and the configured grain deactivation timeout. Cancellation ends the wait while an already-started storage operation retains its outcome-processing path.</p>","zh":"<p>对存储的等待涵盖当前活跃周期的持久化结果、状态更新、恢复以及批次后续回调。等待时限来自生命周期取消令牌，它反映宿主取消和配置的 Grain 停用超时。取消会结束等待，而已经启动的存储操作仍保留处理其结果的路径。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Confirmation and collection stop through the queue’s shutdown signal. Durable commit and prepare records let subsequent activations resume unresolved protocol work. The queue participates in both state setup cleanup and the final lifecycle stage so normal shutdown and partially completed activation both stop background processing.</p>","zh":"<p>确认和收集通过队列的关闭信号停止。持久化的提交记录和准备记录，让后续激活实例能够继续处理尚未解决的协议工作。队列同时参与状态设置清理和最终生命周期阶段，因此正常关闭和未完全完成的激活都会停止后台处理。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-17","type":"heading","anchor":"trade-offs-and-boundaries","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"trade-offs-and-boundaries\">Trade-offs and boundaries</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"trade-offs-and-boundaries\">取舍与边界</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The protocol favors serializable state transitions and recovery over low latency. Read-only work uses a direct resource path, while write transactions pay for coordination and durable records. Transaction atomicity covers registered transactional resources; applications coordinate or compensate external side effects separately.</p>","zh":"<p>该协议优先保证可串行化的状态转换和恢复，而不是低延迟。只读工作使用直接资源路径，写事务则承担协调和持久化记录的成本。事务原子性覆盖已注册的事务资源；应用需要单独协调或补偿外部副作用。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-19","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Application guidance belongs in <a href=\"#/docs/grains/transactions/\">transactions</a>. Provider implementations and fault-injection tests are useful source authorities when evaluating a storage provider’s recovery behavior.</p>","zh":"<p>应用使用指南见 <a href=\"#/docs/grains/transactions/\"> 事务 </a> 。评估存储提供程序的恢复行为时，提供程序实现和故障注入测试是有用的源码依据。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"6771be00cdd23a28-20","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Transactions/DistributedTM/TransactionAgent.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>TransactionAgent</code></a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Transactions/State/TransactionManager.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>TransactionManager</code></a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Transactions/State/TransactionQueue.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>TransactionQueue</code></a>.</p>","zh":"<p>源码： <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Transactions/DistributedTM/TransactionAgent.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>TransactionAgent</code> </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Transactions/State/TransactionManager.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>TransactionManager</code> </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/blob/main/src/Orleans.Transactions/State/TransactionQueue.cs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <code>TransactionQueue</code> </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"1b8b7aa68e91d618":{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618","title":"Orleans migration guides","titleZh":"Orleans 迁移指南","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/migration-guide/","sourceHash":"162b53119f191cdc5b87129a0b0bbc4a4cf9898f1e66cfed9169c45c5d61120e","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Orleans migration guides</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Orleans 迁移指南</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Use the guide that matches the Orleans major version currently deployed in production.</p>","zh":"<p>使用与生产环境当前部署的 Orleans 主版本相匹配的指南。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-2","type":"table","en":"<table><thead><tr><th>Starting version</th><th>Recommended path</th><th>Guide</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Orleans 9.x</td><td>Update to the latest 9.x patch, then upgrade to Orleans 10.x</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/migration/9-to-10/\">Upgrade Orleans 9.x to 10.x</a></td></tr><tr><td>Orleans 8.x</td><td>Update to Orleans 8.2, validate Orleans 9.2, then upgrade to Orleans 10.x</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/migration/8-to-10/\">Upgrade Orleans 8.x to 10.x</a></td></tr><tr><td>Orleans 7.x</td><td>Update to the latest 7.2 patch, then validate each supported major-version checkpoint</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/migration/7-to-10/\">Upgrade Orleans 7.x to 10.x</a></td></tr><tr><td>Orleans 3.x or earlier</td><td>Migrate to Orleans 7 in a separate cluster before continuing sequentially</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/migration/3-to-7-archive/\">Archived Orleans 3.x to 7.x notes</a></td></tr></tbody></table>","zh":"<table><thead><tr><th>起始版本</th><th>推荐路径</th><th>指南</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Orleans 9.x</td><td>更新到最新的 9.x 补丁版本，再升级到 Orleans 10.x</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/migration/9-to-10/\"> 将 Orleans 9.x 升级到 10.x </a></td></tr><tr><td>Orleans 8.x</td><td>更新到 Orleans 8.2，验证 Orleans 9.2，再升级到 Orleans 10.x</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/migration/8-to-10/\"> 将 Orleans 8.x 升级到 10.x </a></td></tr><tr><td>Orleans 7.x</td><td>更新到最新的 7.2 补丁版本，再验证每个受支持的主版本检查点</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/migration/7-to-10/\"> 将 Orleans 7.x 升级到 10.x </a></td></tr><tr><td>Orleans 3.x 或更早版本</td><td>先在独立集群中迁移到 Orleans 7，再按顺序继续升级</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/migration/3-to-7-archive/\"> 已归档的 Orleans 3.x 到 7.x 迁移说明 </a></td></tr></tbody></table>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-3","type":"quote","en":"<aside class=\"starlight-aside starlight-aside--note\"><p class=\"starlight-aside__title\"><svg class=\"starlight-aside__icon\"><path></path></svg>Important</p><p>Orleans documents mixed-version deployment safety only within one major-version family. Don’t put Orleans 9 and Orleans 10 silos in the same production cluster without completing your own compatibility qualification. The guides use a parallel-cluster deployment as the safe default for crossing major versions.</p></aside>","zh":"<aside class=\"starlight-aside starlight-aside--note\"><p class=\"starlight-aside__title\"><svg class=\"starlight-aside__icon\"><path></path></svg> 重要</p><p>Orleans 文档只说明同一主版本系列内的混合版本部署安全性。在完成自己的兼容性验证之前，不要将 Orleans 9 和 Orleans 10 的 Silo 放在同一个生产集群中。这些指南将并行集群部署作为跨主版本升级的安全默认方案。</p></aside>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-4","type":"heading","anchor":"what-every-upgrade-must-preserve","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"what-every-upgrade-must-preserve\">What every upgrade must preserve</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"what-every-upgrade-must-preserve\">每次升级必须保留的内容</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Before changing packages, record the following compatibility contract:</p>","zh":"<p>更改包之前，记录以下兼容性协定：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-6","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>The Orleans, .NET, provider, and database versions currently deployed.</li>\n<li>The grain interface and serialized type assemblies used by every silo and client.</li>\n<li>Stable serializer member IDs and type aliases for data in grain storage, streams, reminders, and queued messages.</li>\n<li>The clustering, persistence, reminder, stream, and grain-directory providers and their schema versions.</li>\n<li>Explicit values for behavior-sensitive options, including request cancellation, placement, grain directory caching, and timer interleaving.</li>\n<li>A backup or recovery point for durable state and provider metadata.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>当前部署的 Orleans、.NET、提供程序和数据库版本。</li>\n<li>每个 Silo 和客户端使用的 Grain 接口程序集和序列化类型程序集。</li>\n<li>Grain 存储、流、提醒器和排队消息中数据所使用的稳定序列化器成员 ID 和类型别名。</li>\n<li>集群、持久化、提醒器、流和 Grain 目录提供程序，以及它们的数据架构版本。</li>\n<li>对行为敏感的选项的显式值，包括请求取消、放置、Grain 目录缓存和计时器交错执行。</li>\n<li>持久化状态和提供程序元数据的备份或恢复点。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>See <a href=\"#/docs/migration/deployment-and-rollback/\">Upgrade deployment and rollback</a> before choosing a deployment strategy.</p>","zh":"<p>选择部署策略之前，参见 <a href=\"#/docs/migration/deployment-and-rollback/\"> 升级部署与回滚 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-8","type":"heading","anchor":"activation-metric-schema-update","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"activation-metric-schema-update\">Activation metric schema update</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"activation-metric-schema-update\">激活指标架构更新</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><strong>Release note for the next release:</strong> Activation lifecycle counters, latency histograms, and population gauges now include <code>grain_type</code>, using the canonical <code>GrainId.Type.ToString()</code> identity. <code>orleans-grains</code> migrates from the <code>type</code> key containing a CLR implementation name to <code>grain_type</code> containing that canonical identity. Explicitly named grains and constructed generic grains can therefore have different values as well as a different key.</p>","zh":"<p><strong> 下一版本的发行说明： </strong> 激活生命周期计数器、延迟直方图和数量仪表现在包含 <code>grain_type</code> ，使用规范的 <code>GrainId.Type.ToString()</code> 身份。 <code>orleans-grains</code> 从包含 CLR 实现名称的 <code>type</code> 键迁移到包含该规范身份的 <code>grain_type</code> 键。因此，显式命名的 Grain 和构造泛型 Grain 不仅键会不同，值也可能不同。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Update dashboard groupings, filters, recording rules, and OpenTelemetry views to retain <code>grain_type</code>. For a mixed-version rollout, use the emitting service version to select the old or new schema. Map old CLR names to canonical names using the deployment’s grain-type registrations before combining series. Count each emitter’s series once in combined views.</p>","zh":"<p>更新仪表板分组、筛选器、记录规则和 OpenTelemetry 视图，以保留 <code>grain_type</code> 。对于混合版本逐步部署，根据发出指标的服务版本选择旧架构或新架构。在合并序列之前，使用部署中的 Grain 类型注册，将旧 CLR 名称映射到规范名称。在组合视图中，每个发出方的序列只计数一次。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Activation gauges now emit a snapshot for each cached type, including zero after the last activation leaves. Obtain cluster totals by summing the latest fresh observation from each silo and type. Preserve emitter identity through export and configure stale-series expiry in the backend. Lifecycle counters retain additive event semantics: summing their per-type increases over the same interval recovers total event volume.</p>","zh":"<p>激活数量仪表现在会为每个已缓存类型发出快照，包括最后一个激活实例离开后的零值。对每个 Silo 和类型的最新有效观测值求和，即可得到集群总数。导出时保留发出方身份，并在后端配置陈旧序列过期。生命周期计数器保留可相加的事件语义：对同一时间区间内各类型的增量求和，即可还原事件总量。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The shutdown counter retains its historical additional event for each nonempty collection batch with only <code>via=collection</code>; individual shutdown events carry their activation’s canonical type. Include both typed and untyped contributions when aggregating total shutdown events. The collection-scan counter retains scan-level measurements. <code>orleans-system-targets</code> retains its <code>type</code> key, and management grain statistics retain CLR display names with per-silo accounting.</p>","zh":"<p>关闭计数器保留其历史行为：对每个非空回收批次额外记录一次仅带 <code>via=collection</code> 的事件；单个关闭事件则携带其激活实例的规范类型。聚合关闭事件总数时，应同时纳入带类型和不带类型的部分。回收扫描计数器保留扫描层级的测量。 <code>orleans-system-targets</code> 保留其 <code>type</code> 键，管理 Grain 的统计信息则保留 CLR 显示名称，并按 Silo 计量。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-13","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>See the <a href=\"#/docs/host/monitoring/metrics-catalog/::grain-type-identity-and-aggregation\">metrics catalog</a> for units, lifecycle outcomes, population scopes, and aggregation.</p>","zh":"<p>单位、生命周期结果、数量范围和聚合方式，参见 <a href=\"#/docs/host/monitoring/metrics-catalog/::grain-type-identity-and-aggregation\"> 指标目录 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-14","type":"heading","anchor":"package-version-policy","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"package-version-policy\">Package version policy</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"package-version-policy\">包版本策略</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Keep all <code>Microsoft.Orleans.*</code> packages on the same 10.x patch. For solutions that use NuGet Central Package Management, declare the versions in <code>Directory.Packages.props</code> and omit versions from project-level <code>PackageReference</code> items. Don’t copy old provider dependency versions from migration examples; select a current version that is supported by your target runtime and provider.</p>","zh":"<p>所有 <code>Microsoft.Orleans.*</code> 包应保持为相同的 10.x 补丁版本。对于使用 NuGet 集中包管理的解决方案，在 <code>Directory.Packages.props</code> 中声明版本，并省略项目级 <code>PackageReference</code> 项中的版本。不要从迁移示例中复制旧提供程序依赖版本；应选择目标运行时和提供程序支持的当前版本。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For related guidance, see:</p>","zh":"<p>相关指导参见：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"1b8b7aa68e91d618-17","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/host/configuration-guide/serialization/\">Orleans serialization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-versioning/deploying-new-versions-of-grains/\">Deploy new versions of grains</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/host/configuration-guide/configuring-ado-dot-net-providers/\">ADO.NET provider configuration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-deployments/\">Deployment troubleshooting</a></li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/host/configuration-guide/serialization/\"> Orleans 序列化 </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-versioning/deploying-new-versions-of-grains/\"> 部署新的 Grain 版本 </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/host/configuration-guide/configuring-ado-dot-net-providers/\"> ADO.NET 提供程序配置 </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-deployments/\"> 部署故障排查 </a></li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"}]},"9aab4d500bc9a55d":{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d","title":"Archived Orleans 3.x to 7.x migration notes","titleZh":"Orleans 3.x 至 7.x 迁移说明（归档）","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/migration/3-to-7-archive/","sourceHash":"4dc98e1e8de6e9aea7ea4d7277c6e15a96db4af8c72679b7c292a700701e67d1","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Archived Orleans 3.x to 7.x migration notes</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Orleans 3.x 至 7.x 迁移说明（归档）</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-1","type":"quote","en":"<aside class=\"starlight-aside starlight-aside--caution\"><p class=\"starlight-aside__title\"><svg class=\"starlight-aside__icon\"><path></path></svg>Warning</p><p>Orleans 3.x and Orleans 7.x are out of support. Use these notes only to reach a supported intermediate codebase, then continue through <a href=\"#/docs/migration/7-to-10/\">Orleans 7.x to 10.x</a>.</p></aside>","zh":"<aside class=\"starlight-aside starlight-aside--caution\"><p class=\"starlight-aside__title\"><svg class=\"starlight-aside__icon\"><path></path></svg> 警告</p><p>Orleans 3.x 和 Orleans 7.x 均已停止支持。仅使用这些说明迁移到受支持的中间代码基线，然后继续按照 <a href=\"#/docs/migration/7-to-10/\"> Orleans 7.x 到 10.x </a> 的路径升级。</p></aside>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-2","type":"heading","anchor":"starting-and-target-assumptions","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"starting-and-target-assumptions\">Starting and target assumptions</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"starting-and-target-assumptions\">起始与目标假设</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>These notes apply to an Orleans 3.x application that must first become an Orleans 7 application. This transition isn’t wire compatible. Orleans 3 and Orleans 7 silos can’t form a mixed cluster, so deploy Orleans 7 in a separate cluster and plan an application-specific state transition.</p>","zh":"<p>这些说明适用于必须先迁移为 Orleans 7 应用的 Orleans 3.x 应用。这一转换不具备通信兼容性。Orleans 3 和 Orleans 7 的 Silo 不能组成混合集群，因此，应将 Orleans 7 部署到独立集群，并规划应用特定的状态转换。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-4","type":"heading","anchor":"required-architectural-changes","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"required-architectural-changes\">Required architectural changes</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"required-architectural-changes\">必需的架构更改</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-5","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>Reference <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.Server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Microsoft.Orleans.Server</a> from silo projects, <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.Client\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Microsoft.Orleans.Client</a> from client projects, and <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.Sdk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Microsoft.Orleans.Sdk</a> from shared contract projects.</li>\n<li>Remove the legacy MSBuild code-generator and <code>Microsoft.Orleans.OrleansRuntime</code> packages.</li>\n<li>Replace <code>Microsoft.Orleans.OrleansServiceBus</code> with <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.Streaming.EventHubs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Microsoft.Orleans.Streaming.EventHubs</a>. Add explicit <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.Reminders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Microsoft.Orleans.Reminders</a> and <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.Streaming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Microsoft.Orleans.Streaming</a> references when the application uses those features.</li>\n<li>Remove Application Parts configuration. The Orleans source generator discovers application types.</li>\n<li>Use the <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/extensions/generic-host\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">.NET generic host</a> with <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleanssilogenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleans</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleansclientgenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleansClient</a>.</li>\n<li>Update <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">OnActivateAsync</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">OnDeactivateAsync</a> overrides to the Orleans 7 cancellation-token and deactivation-reason signatures.</li>\n<li>Add <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generateserializerattribute/\">GenerateSerializerAttribute</a> and stable <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a> values to application types.</li>\n<li>Replace legacy grain, interface, and stream identity assumptions with the Orleans 7 string-based identity model.</li>\n<li>Replace Simple Message Streams with broadcast channels or a persistent stream provider.</li>\n<li>Replace legacy telemetry consumers with .NET metrics and <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.diagnostics.activitysource\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ActivitySource</a>-based tracing.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>在 Silo 项目中引用 <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.Server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Microsoft.Orleans.Server </a> ，在客户端项目中引用 <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.Client\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Microsoft.Orleans.Client </a> ，在共享协定项目中引用 <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.Sdk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Microsoft.Orleans.Sdk </a> 。</li>\n<li>移除旧版 MSBuild 代码生成器包和 <code>Microsoft.Orleans.OrleansRuntime</code> 包。</li>\n<li>将 <code>Microsoft.Orleans.OrleansServiceBus</code> 替换为 <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.Streaming.EventHubs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Microsoft.Orleans.Streaming.EventHubs </a> 。应用使用相应功能时，显式添加 <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.Reminders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Microsoft.Orleans.Reminders </a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Orleans.Streaming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Microsoft.Orleans.Streaming </a> 引用。</li>\n<li>移除 Application Parts 配置。Orleans 源代码生成器负责发现应用类型。</li>\n<li>使用 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/extensions/generic-host\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> .NET 通用宿主 </a> ，并调用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleanssilogenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleans</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleansclientgenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleansClient</a> 。</li>\n<li>将 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">OnActivateAsync</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">OnDeactivateAsync</a> 重写更新为 Orleans 7 中包含取消令牌和停用原因的签名。</li>\n<li>为应用类型添加 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generateserializerattribute/\">GenerateSerializerAttribute</a> 和稳定的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a> 值。</li>\n<li>将旧版 Grain、接口和流身份假设替换为 Orleans 7 基于字符串的身份模型。</li>\n<li>将 Simple Message Streams 替换为广播通道或持久流提供程序。</li>\n<li>将旧版遥测使用方替换为 .NET 指标和基于 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.diagnostics.activitysource\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> ActivitySource </a> 的跟踪。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The old <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.hosting.graincallfilterservicecollectionextensions/methods/\">AddGrainCallFilter</a> API was removed before Orleans 7. Register incoming and outgoing filters on <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.isilobuilder/\">ISiloBuilder</a> or <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.hosting.iclientbuilder/\">IClientBuilder</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>旧 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.hosting.graincallfilterservicecollectionextensions/methods/\">AddGrainCallFilter</a> API 在 Orleans 7 之前已被移除。在 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.isilobuilder/\">ISiloBuilder</a> 或 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.hosting.iclientbuilder/\">IClientBuilder</a> 上注册入站和出站筛选器。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For an itemized record of the Orleans samples migrated to Orleans 7, see <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/issues/8035\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">dotnet/orleans issue #8035</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 示例迁移到 Orleans 7 的逐项记录，参见 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/issues/8035\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> dotnet/orleans 议题 #8035 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-8","type":"heading","anchor":"why-this-boundary-requires-conversion","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"why-this-boundary-requires-conversion\">Why this boundary requires conversion</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"why-this-boundary-requires-conversion\">为什么跨越这一边界需要转换</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans 7 changed two durable contracts which Orleans 10 retains:</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 7 更改了两项持久化协定，而 Orleans 10 沿用了这些协定：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-10","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>Grain, grain-interface, and stream identities moved to the string-based type, namespace, and key representations used by <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.grainid/\">GrainId</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.runtime.streamid/\">StreamId</a>.</li>\n<li>The Orleans wire serializer was replaced by the version-tolerant serializer based on <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generateserializerattribute/\">GenerateSerializerAttribute</a>, <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a>, and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.aliasattribute/\">AliasAttribute</a>.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>Grain、Grain 接口和流身份，迁移到 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.grainid/\">GrainId</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.runtime.streamid/\">StreamId</a> 使用的、基于字符串的类型、命名空间和键表示。</li>\n<li>Orleans 通信序列化器被替换为基于 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generateserializerattribute/\">GenerateSerializerAttribute</a> 、 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.aliasattribute/\">AliasAttribute</a> 的版本容错序列化器。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>These changes make applications easier to evolve after the Orleans 7 checkpoint, but they don’t make Orleans 3 identities or payloads automatically compatible. Define and test the conversion before the Orleans 7 cluster reads production data.</p>","zh":"<p>这些更改使应用在经过 Orleans 7 检查点后更易演进，但并不会使 Orleans 3 的身份或负载自动兼容。在 Orleans 7 集群读取生产数据之前，应定义并测试转换。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-12","type":"heading","anchor":"map-identities-and-serialized-state","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"map-identities-and-serialized-state\">Map identities and serialized state</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"map-identities-and-serialized-state\">映射身份与序列化状态</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-13","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Create an explicit mapping for every durable identity:</p>","zh":"<p>为每个持久化身份创建显式映射：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-14","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>Preserve the domain value of each GUID, integer, string, or compound grain key while mapping the old grain type to its Orleans 7-and-later type name. Use <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.graintypeattribute/\">GrainTypeAttribute</a> when that name must remain independent of the CLR class name.</li>\n<li>Map stream namespaces and GUID keys to stable <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.runtime.streamid/\">StreamId</a> namespace and key strings. Keep provider names stable unless the migration deliberately moves subscriptions to another provider.</li>\n<li>Add stable serializer member IDs, and add aliases before renaming serialized types. Don’t reuse IDs or aliases after the Orleans 7 checkpoint.</li>\n<li>Treat serialized grain references, queued messages, reminders, stream subscriptions, and provider metadata as part of the conversion, not only grain-state rows.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>将旧 Grain 类型映射到 Orleans 7 及更高版本的类型名称时，保留每个 GUID、整数、字符串或复合 Grain 键的领域值。如果该名称必须独立于 CLR 类名，使用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.graintypeattribute/\">GrainTypeAttribute</a> 。</li>\n<li>将流命名空间和 GUID 键映射为稳定的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.runtime.streamid/\">StreamId</a> 命名空间字符串和键字符串。除非迁移有意将订阅转移到另一个提供程序，否则应保持提供程序名称稳定。</li>\n<li>添加稳定的序列化器成员 ID，并在重命名序列化类型之前添加别名。经过 Orleans 7 检查点后，不要复用 ID 或别名。</li>\n<li>将序列化的 Grain 引用、排队消息、提醒器、流订阅和提供程序元数据都视为转换的一部分，而不只是 Grain 状态行。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The version-tolerant serializer governs compatible changes after conversion. Don’t assume that it can decode payloads written by the Orleans 3 wire serializer or by a storage serializer with different settings. Verify each stored type using representative production data. See <a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-identity/\">Grain identity</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/host/configuration-guide/serialization/\">Orleans serialization</a> for the Orleans 10 contracts.</p>","zh":"<p>版本容错序列化器管理转换后的兼容变更。不要假定它能够解码 Orleans 3 通信序列化器，或采用不同设置的存储序列化器写入的负载。使用具有代表性的生产数据验证每个存储类型。Orleans 10 的协定参见 <a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-identity/\"> Grain 身份 </a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/host/configuration-guide/serialization/\"> Orleans 序列化 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-16","type":"heading","anchor":"replace-simple-message-streams","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"replace-simple-message-streams\">Replace Simple Message Streams</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"replace-simple-message-streams\">替换 Simple Message Streams</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Simple Message Streams were removed in Orleans 7. Choose the replacement based on the behavior the application relied on:</p>","zh":"<p>Simple Message Streams 在 Orleans 7 中已被移除。根据应用依赖的行为选择替代方案：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-18","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>Use <a href=\"#/docs/streaming/broadcast-channel/\">broadcast channels</a> for nonpersistent, best-effort delivery to implicit subscribers. Broadcast channels don’t retain events, replay messages, or support explicit subscriptions.</li>\n<li>Use an <a href=\"#/docs/streaming/\">Orleans stream provider</a> when the application requires explicit subscriptions, durable subscription metadata, an external broker, replay, or provider-backed delivery.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>对于向隐式订阅者进行非持久化、尽力而为的投递，使用 <a href=\"#/docs/streaming/broadcast-channel/\"> 广播通道 </a> 。广播通道不会保留事件、回放消息，也不支持显式订阅。</li>\n<li>当应用需要显式订阅、持久化订阅元数据、外部消息代理、回放，或由提供程序支持的投递时，使用 <a href=\"#/docs/streaming/\"> Orleans 流提供程序 </a> 。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-19","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Don’t select a replacement only because both APIs deliver notifications. Record how each old provider name, namespace, key, and subscription maps to the new abstraction, then test duplicate, delayed, and lost-message behavior. See <a href=\"#/docs/streaming/streams-why/\">Choose an Orleans messaging abstraction</a> for the current behavior matrix.</p>","zh":"<p>不要仅因两种 API 都能投递通知就选择替代方案。记录每个旧提供程序名称、命名空间、键和订阅如何映射到新抽象，然后测试重复、延迟和消息丢失行为。当前行为对照表参见 <a href=\"#/docs/streaming/streams-why/\"> 选择 Orleans 消息抽象 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-20","type":"heading","anchor":"replace-legacy-telemetry-consumers","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"replace-legacy-telemetry-consumers\">Replace legacy telemetry consumers</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"replace-legacy-telemetry-consumers\">替换旧版遥测使用方</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-21","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The <code>Microsoft.Orleans.TelemetryConsumers.*</code> packages and legacy telemetry-consumer model were removed. Orleans 10 emits structured logs, a <code>Microsoft.Orleans</code> <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.diagnostics.metrics.meter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Meter</a>, and <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.diagnostics.activitysource\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ActivitySource</a> traces. Replace old consumers with the application’s logging and OpenTelemetry pipeline, and register activity propagation on every participating silo and client. See <a href=\"#/docs/host/monitoring/\">Orleans observability</a>.</p>","zh":"<p><code>Microsoft.Orleans.TelemetryConsumers.*</code> 包和旧版遥测使用方模型已被移除。Orleans 10 发出结构化日志、一个 <code>Microsoft.Orleans</code> <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.diagnostics.metrics.meter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Meter </a> ，以及 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.diagnostics.activitysource\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> ActivitySource </a> 跟踪。使用应用的日志记录与 OpenTelemetry 管道替换旧使用方，并在每个参与的 Silo 和客户端上注册活动传播。参见 <a href=\"#/docs/host/monitoring/\"> Orleans 可观测性 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-22","type":"heading","anchor":"account-for-separated-feature-packages","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"account-for-separated-feature-packages\">Account for separated feature packages</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"account-for-separated-feature-packages\">处理拆分后的功能包</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-23","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Streaming, reminders, and transactions moved out of the core package. Add <code>Microsoft.Orleans.Streaming</code>, <code>Microsoft.Orleans.Reminders</code>, and <code>Microsoft.Orleans.Transactions</code> only where those features are used. APIs which previously appeared as <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/\">Grain</a> instance methods are extension methods in these packages, so unqualified calls might need <code>this.</code>, such as <code>this.GetReminders()</code> or <code>this.GetStreamProvider(\"provider\")</code>.</p>","zh":"<p>流式处理、提醒器和事务已移出核心包。仅在使用相应功能的位置添加 <code>Microsoft.Orleans.Streaming</code> 、 <code>Microsoft.Orleans.Reminders</code> 和 <code>Microsoft.Orleans.Transactions</code> 。以前作为 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/\"> Grain </a> 实例方法出现的 API，现在是这些包中的扩展方法，因此，不带限定的调用可能需要加上 <code>this.</code> ，例如 <code>this.GetReminders()</code> 或 <code>this.GetStreamProvider(\"provider\")</code> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-24","type":"heading","anchor":"state-and-deployment-boundary","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"state-and-deployment-boundary\">State and deployment boundary</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"state-and-deployment-boundary\">状态与部署边界</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-25","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Grain and stream identities and the wire serializer changed incompatibly in Orleans 7. Don’t point a new cluster at production state until you have verified:</p>","zh":"<p>Grain 和流身份，以及通信序列化器，在 Orleans 7 中发生了不兼容变更。在验证以下内容之前，不要让新集群访问生产状态：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-26","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>How old grain identities map to new string identities.</li>\n<li>How each persisted payload is converted or read.</li>\n<li>How reminders and stream subscriptions are recreated or migrated.</li>\n<li>How traffic is cut over without two clusters processing the same logical entities.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>旧 Grain 身份如何映射到新的字符串身份。</li>\n<li>每个持久化负载如何转换或读取。</li>\n<li>提醒器和流订阅如何重建或迁移。</li>\n<li>如何切换流量，避免两个集群处理相同的逻辑实体。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-27","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Prefer an offline export/transform/import process or an application-level bridge with idempotent writes. Keep the Orleans 3 data recovery point until the Orleans 7 cluster has completed validation.</p>","zh":"<p>优先使用离线导出／转换／导入流程，或具有幂等写入的应用层桥接。保留 Orleans 3 数据恢复点，直到 Orleans 7 集群完成验证。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-28","type":"heading","anchor":"continue-to-orleans-10","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"continue-to-orleans-10\">Continue to Orleans 10</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"continue-to-orleans-10\">继续升级到 Orleans 10</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-29","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>After the Orleans 7 application is stable:</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 7 应用稳定后：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-30","type":"list","en":"<ol>\n<li>Update it to the latest Orleans 7.2 patch.</li>\n<li>Follow <a href=\"#/docs/migration/7-to-10/\">Upgrade Orleans 7.x to 10.x</a>.</li>\n<li>Use a separate deployment checkpoint for Orleans 8.2, Orleans 9.2, and Orleans 10.x.</li>\n</ol>","zh":"<ol>\n<li>将其更新到最新的 Orleans 7.2 补丁版本。</li>\n<li>遵循 <a href=\"#/docs/migration/7-to-10/\"> 将 Orleans 7.x 升级到 10.x </a> 。</li>\n<li>为 Orleans 8.2、Orleans 9.2 和 Orleans 10.x 分别使用独立的部署检查点。</li>\n</ol>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-31","type":"heading","anchor":"checklist","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"checklist\">Checklist</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"checklist\">检查清单</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"9aab4d500bc9a55d-32","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Build an Orleans 7 codebase using current package and hosting patterns.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Define grain, stream, reminder, and state identity mappings.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Convert and validate representative persisted payloads.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Deploy Orleans 7 in a separate cluster.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Verify rollback to the Orleans 3 recovery point.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Stabilize on Orleans 7.2 before continuing sequentially to Orleans 10.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  使用当前的包和宿主模式构建 Orleans 7 代码基线。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  定义 Grain、流、提醒器和状态的身份映射。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  转换并验证具有代表性的持久化负载。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  将 Orleans 7 部署到独立集群。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  验证能够回滚到 Orleans 3 恢复点。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  在 Orleans 7.2 上稳定后，再按顺序继续升级到 Orleans 10。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"}]},"595899687a7c4b5f":{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f","title":"Upgrade Orleans 7.x to 10.x","titleZh":"将 Orleans 7.x 升级到 10.x","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/migration/7-to-10/","sourceHash":"7275e1a237992c1b0563a219a88d3a5a4f91807617f12245912f53006ff54323","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Upgrade Orleans 7.x to 10.x</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">将 Orleans 7.x 升级到 10.x</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-1","type":"heading","anchor":"starting-and-target-assumptions","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"starting-and-target-assumptions\">Starting and target assumptions</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"starting-and-target-assumptions\">起始与目标假设</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>This guide assumes:</p>","zh":"<p>本指南假设：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-3","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>The application first updates to the latest Orleans 7.2 patch.</li>\n<li>The application can retarget from .NET 7 to .NET 8 before adopting Orleans 8.</li>\n<li>Each major-version checkpoint can be deployed and validated independently.</li>\n<li>The application already uses the Orleans 7 package, hosting, identity, and serialization model.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>应用首先更新到最新的 Orleans 7.2 补丁版本。</li>\n<li>应用能够在采用 Orleans 8 之前，将目标框架从 .NET 7 改为 .NET 8。</li>\n<li>每个主版本检查点都可以独立部署和验证。</li>\n<li>应用已经使用 Orleans 7 的包、宿主、身份和序列化模型。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The supported checkpoint sequence is:</p>","zh":"<p>受支持的检查点顺序如下：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-5","type":"list","en":"<ol>\n<li>Latest Orleans 7.2 on the application’s current runtime.</li>\n<li>Latest Orleans 8.2 on .NET 8.</li>\n<li>Latest Orleans 9.2 on .NET 8.</li>\n<li>Current Orleans 10.x on a .NET version targeted by the selected packages. Orleans 10.4 and earlier packages target .NET 8 and .NET 10; later packages target .NET 10 and .NET 11.</li>\n</ol>","zh":"<ol>\n<li>在应用当前运行时上使用最新的 Orleans 7.2。</li>\n<li>在 .NET 8 上使用最新的 Orleans 8.2。</li>\n<li>在 .NET 8 上使用最新的 Orleans 9.2。</li>\n<li>在所选包支持的目标 .NET 版本上使用当前的 Orleans 10.x。Orleans 10.4 及更早版本的包面向 .NET 8 和 .NET 10；之后的包面向 .NET 10 和 .NET 11。</li>\n</ol>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Don’t combine the .NET retarget, Orleans package update, provider migration, and application contract changes in one production deployment.</p>","zh":"<p>不要在一次生产部署中同时进行 .NET 目标框架变更、Orleans 包更新、提供程序迁移和应用协定更改。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-7","type":"heading","anchor":"prepare-the-orleans-7-application","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"prepare-the-orleans-7-application\">Prepare the Orleans 7 application</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"prepare-the-orleans-7-application\">准备 Orleans 7 应用</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Before moving to Orleans 8:</p>","zh":"<p>迁移到 Orleans 8 之前：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-9","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>Align all <code>Microsoft.Orleans.*</code> packages on the same latest 7.2 patch.</li>\n<li>Remove obsolete APIs and resolve analyzer warnings.</li>\n<li>Confirm silos use <code>Microsoft.Orleans.Server</code>, clients use <code>Microsoft.Orleans.Client</code>, and shared contract projects use <code>Microsoft.Orleans.Sdk</code>.</li>\n<li>Confirm hosting uses the .NET generic host with <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleanssilogenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleans</a> or <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleansclientgenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleansClient</a>.</li>\n<li>Inventory serializer member IDs, aliases, provider names, stream partition counts, and database schemas.</li>\n<li>Capture representative persisted state and a tested recovery point.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>将所有 <code>Microsoft.Orleans.*</code> 包统一到相同的最新 7.2 补丁版本。</li>\n<li>移除过时 API，并解决分析器警告。</li>\n<li>确认 Silo 使用 <code>Microsoft.Orleans.Server</code> ，客户端使用 <code>Microsoft.Orleans.Client</code> ，共享协定项目使用 <code>Microsoft.Orleans.Sdk</code> 。</li>\n<li>确认宿主使用 .NET 通用宿主，并调用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleanssilogenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleans</a> 或 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleansclientgenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleansClient</a> 。</li>\n<li>清点序列化器成员 ID、别名、提供程序名称、流分区数量和数据库架构。</li>\n<li>保存具有代表性的持久化状态，以及经过测试的恢复点。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Call filters should already be registered using <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.graincallfiltersilobuilderextensions/methods/\">AddIncomingGrainCallFilter</a> or <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.graincallfiltersilobuilderextensions/methods/\">AddOutgoingGrainCallFilter</a> on the Orleans builders. The old <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.hosting.graincallfilterservicecollectionextensions/methods/\">AddGrainCallFilter</a> API has been unsupported since before Orleans 7 and isn’t an Orleans 10 change.</p>","zh":"<p>调用筛选器应已通过 Orleans 构建器上的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.graincallfiltersilobuilderextensions/methods/\">AddIncomingGrainCallFilter</a> 或 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.graincallfiltersilobuilderextensions/methods/\">AddOutgoingGrainCallFilter</a> 注册。旧 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.hosting.graincallfilterservicecollectionextensions/methods/\">AddGrainCallFilter</a> API 在 Orleans 7 之前就已不受支持，并非 Orleans 10 的变更。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-11","type":"heading","anchor":"move-to-orleans-82","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"move-to-orleans-82\">Move to Orleans 8.2</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"move-to-orleans-82\">迁移到 Orleans 8.2</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Retarget the application to .NET 8 and move all Orleans packages to the latest 8.2 patch.</p>","zh":"<p>将应用的目标框架改为 .NET 8，并将所有 Orleans 包更新到最新的 8.2 补丁版本。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-13","type":"heading","anchor":"configuration-renames","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"configuration-renames\">Configuration renames</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"configuration-renames\">配置重命名</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Update these compile-time breaks:</p>","zh":"<p>修复以下编译期破坏性变更：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/\">LoadSheddingOptions</a>:</p>","zh":"<p>对于 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/\">LoadSheddingOptions</a> ：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-16","type":"code","en":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CpuThreshold</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">95</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span></code></pre>","zh":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CpuThreshold</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">95</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span></code></pre>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.leasebasedqueuebalanceroptions/\">LeaseBasedQueueBalancerOptions</a>:</p>","zh":"<p>对于 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.leasebasedqueuebalanceroptions/\">LeaseBasedQueueBalancerOptions</a> ：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-18","type":"code","en":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">LeaseAcquisitionPeriod</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">TimeSpan</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">FromSeconds</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">30</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">);</span></code></pre>","zh":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">LeaseAcquisitionPeriod</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">TimeSpan</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">FromSeconds</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">30</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">);</span></code></pre>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-19","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">LoadSheddingLimit</a> became <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">CpuThreshold</a> in Orleans 8.1. Orleans 8.2 corrected the spelling of <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.leasebasedqueuebalanceroptions/properties/\">LeaseAquisitionPeriod</a>.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">LoadSheddingLimit</a> 在 Orleans 8.1 中变为 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">CpuThreshold</a> 。Orleans 8.2 修正了 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.leasebasedqueuebalanceroptions/properties/\">LeaseAquisitionPeriod</a> 的拼写。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-20","type":"heading","anchor":"timer-behavior","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"timer-behavior\">Timer behavior</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"timer-behavior\">计时器行为</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-21","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Replace the obsolete <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">RegisterTimer</a> API with <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grainbaseextensions/methods/\">RegisterGrainTimer</a>. The old API interleaved callbacks, while the new API defaults <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.graintimercreationoptions/properties/\">Interleave</a> to <code>false</code>. Preserve old behavior explicitly when required:</p>","zh":"<p>使用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grainbaseextensions/methods/\">RegisterGrainTimer</a> 替换已过时的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">RegisterTimer</a> API。旧 API 的回调会交错执行，而新 API 的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.graintimercreationoptions/properties/\"> Interleave </a> 默认为 <code>false</code> 。需要时，应显式保留旧行为：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-22","type":"code","en":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">override</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">OnActivateAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">CancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">cancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">_timer</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">this</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">RegisterGrainTimer</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">callback</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">DoWorkAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">,</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">new</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">GrainTimerCreationOptions</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">DueTime</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">TimeSpan</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">FromSeconds</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">),</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Period</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">TimeSpan</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">FromSeconds</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">10</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">),</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Interleave</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">true</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">});</span>\n\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#C586C0;--1:#AC00D8\">return</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CompletedTask</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span>\n\n<span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">private</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">DoWorkAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">CancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">cancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">) =&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CompletedTask</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span></code></pre>","zh":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">override</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">OnActivateAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">CancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">cancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">_timer</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">this</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">RegisterGrainTimer</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">callback</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">DoWorkAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">,</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">new</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">GrainTimerCreationOptions</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">DueTime</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">TimeSpan</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">FromSeconds</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">),</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Period</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">TimeSpan</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">FromSeconds</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">10</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">),</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Interleave</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">true</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">});</span>\n\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#C586C0;--1:#AC00D8\">return</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CompletedTask</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span>\n\n<span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">private</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">DoWorkAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">CancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">cancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">) =&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CompletedTask</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span></code></pre>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-23","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Test activation collection and set <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.graintimercreationoptions/properties/\">KeepAlive</a> only when timer ticks must prevent collection.</p>","zh":"<p>测试激活实例回收，并且只有计时器 tick 必须阻止回收时，才设置 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.graintimercreationoptions/properties/\">KeepAlive</a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-24","type":"heading","anchor":"move-to-orleans-92","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"move-to-orleans-92\">Move to Orleans 9.2</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"move-to-orleans-92\">迁移到 Orleans 9.2</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-25","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Complete the Orleans 9.2 checkpoint described in <a href=\"#/docs/migration/8-to-10/\">Upgrade Orleans 8.x to 10.x</a>:</p>","zh":"<p>完成 <a href=\"#/docs/migration/8-to-10/\"> 将 Orleans 8.x 升级到 10.x </a> 中介绍的 Orleans 9.2 检查点：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-26","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>Decide whether to accept <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.resourceoptimizedplacement/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacement</a>, the new default, or register <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.randomplacement/\">RandomPlacement</a>.</li>\n<li>Remove adaptive grain-directory cache configuration.</li>\n<li>Test the aligned <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.igrainstate-1/\">IGrainState&lt;T&gt;</a> read and clear semantics.</li>\n<li>Adopt native <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.cancellationtoken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CancellationToken</a> grain method parameters only after the runtime checkpoint is stable.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>决定是接受新的默认值 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.resourceoptimizedplacement/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacement</a> ，还是注册 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.randomplacement/\">RandomPlacement</a> 。</li>\n<li>移除自适应 Grain 目录缓存配置。</li>\n<li>测试统一后的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.igrainstate-1/\">IGrainState&lt;T&gt;</a> 读取和清除语义。</li>\n<li>只有运行时检查点稳定后，才采用原生 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.cancellationtoken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> CancellationToken </a> Grain 方法参数。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-27","type":"heading","anchor":"move-to-orleans-10","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"move-to-orleans-10\">Move to Orleans 10</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"move-to-orleans-10\">迁移到 Orleans 10</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-28","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Complete <a href=\"#/docs/migration/9-to-10/\">Upgrade Orleans 9.x to 10.x</a>. The Orleans 10-specific changes are concentrated in:</p>","zh":"<p>完成 <a href=\"#/docs/migration/9-to-10/\"> 将 Orleans 9.x 升级到 10.x </a> 。Orleans 10 特有的变更主要集中在：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-29","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>Obsolete <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.unorderedattribute/\">UnorderedAttribute</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.orleansconstructorattribute/\">OrleansConstructorAttribute</a> annotations.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/properties/\">CancelRequestOnTimeout</a> default changing to <code>false</code>.</li>\n<li>SQL Server ADO.NET providers moving to <code>Microsoft.Data.SqlClient</code>.</li>\n<li>Cancellation support expanding to observers and system targets.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.unorderedattribute/\">UnorderedAttribute</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.orleansconstructorattribute/\">OrleansConstructorAttribute</a> 的过时注解。</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/properties/\">CancelRequestOnTimeout</a> 的默认值改为 <code>false</code> 。</li>\n<li>SQL Server ADO.NET 提供程序迁移到 <code>Microsoft.Data.SqlClient</code> 。</li>\n<li>取消支持扩展到观察者和系统目标。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-30","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The generic-host model, builder-based call-filter registration, and version-tolerant serialization model remain in place.</p>","zh":"<p>通用宿主模型、基于构建器的调用筛选器注册，以及版本容错序列化模型均保持不变。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-31","type":"heading","anchor":"serialization-state-and-providers","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"serialization-state-and-providers\">Serialization, state, and providers</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"serialization-state-and-providers\">序列化、状态和提供程序</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-32","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans 7 introduced the identity and serializer model used by later releases, so a 7-to-10 upgrade doesn’t require the identity conversion required by Orleans 3.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 7 引入了后续版本使用的身份和序列化器模型，因此，7 到 10 的升级不需要执行 Orleans 3 所需的身份转换。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-33","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Still, preserve the application contract:</p>","zh":"<p>但仍须保留应用协定：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-34","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>Never renumber or reuse <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a> values.</li>\n<li>Keep <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.aliasattribute/\">AliasAttribute</a> values stable across type or assembly moves.</li>\n<li>Don’t reorder record primary-constructor parameters.</li>\n<li>Keep storage serializers and provider names stable during each runtime upgrade.</li>\n<li>Test reminders, stream subscriptions, queued payloads, and representative grain state at every checkpoint.</li>\n<li>Apply ADO.NET migration scripts in order and validate each provider before advancing.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>绝不重新编号或复用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a> 值。</li>\n<li>类型或程序集迁移时，保持 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.aliasattribute/\">AliasAttribute</a> 值稳定。</li>\n<li>不要对记录类型的主构造函数参数重新排序。</li>\n<li>每次运行时升级期间，都保持存储序列化器和提供程序名称稳定。</li>\n<li>在每个检查点测试提醒器、流订阅、排队负载，以及具有代表性的 Grain 状态。</li>\n<li>按顺序应用 ADO.NET 迁移脚本，并在继续推进之前验证每个提供程序。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-35","type":"heading","anchor":"deployment-and-rollback","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"deployment-and-rollback\">Deployment and rollback</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"deployment-and-rollback\">部署与回滚</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-36","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The documented mixed-version guarantee covers patch and minor differences inside one major family, not Orleans 7, 8, 9, and 10 in one cluster. Use a parallel cluster for every major transition unless the exact pair has passed your own mixed-version test suite.</p>","zh":"<p>文档中的混合版本保证覆盖同一主版本系列内的补丁版本和次版本差异，并不覆盖将 Orleans 7、8、9 和 10 放在同一个集群中。每次跨主版本迁移都应使用并行集群，除非确切的版本组合已经通过你自己的混合版本测试套件。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-37","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Keep the previous cluster, deployment artifacts, provider recovery point, and compatible client build until the new checkpoint has completed its soak period. For details, see <a href=\"#/docs/migration/deployment-and-rollback/\">Upgrade deployment and rollback</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>保留原集群、部署产物、提供程序恢复点和兼容的客户端构建版本，直到新检查点完成持续运行观察期。详情参见 <a href=\"#/docs/migration/deployment-and-rollback/\"> 升级部署与回滚 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-38","type":"heading","anchor":"checklist","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"checklist\">Checklist</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"checklist\">检查清单</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"595899687a7c4b5f-39","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Update to the latest Orleans 7.2 patch and resolve warnings.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Back up durable state and inventory provider schemas and serializer contracts.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Retarget to .NET 8 independently.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Upgrade to Orleans 8.2 and fix option and timer migrations.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Upgrade to Orleans 9.2 and validate placement, cancellation, directory caching, and state semantics.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Complete the Orleans 9-to-10 checklist.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Keep package versions aligned at every checkpoint.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Test old-state reads, new-state writes, reminders, and streams at every checkpoint.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Rehearse a parallel-cluster deployment and rollback for every major transition.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  更新到最新的 Orleans 7.2 补丁版本，并解决警告。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  备份持久化状态，并清点提供程序架构和序列化器协定。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  单独将目标框架改为 .NET 8。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  升级到 Orleans 8.2，并完成选项和计时器迁移修正。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  升级到 Orleans 9.2，并验证放置、取消、目录缓存和状态语义。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  完成 Orleans 9 到 10 的检查清单。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  在每个检查点保持包版本一致。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  在每个检查点测试旧状态读取、新状态写入、提醒器和流。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  为每次跨主版本迁移演练并行集群部署和回滚。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"}]},"352e576d316f89f3":{"id":"352e576d316f89f3","title":"Upgrade Orleans 8.x to 10.x","titleZh":"将 Orleans 8.x 升级到 10.x","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/migration/8-to-10/","sourceHash":"02b5fcd4a2cc9ba8f2f257f63186fea2d79c02e563911fbb16e9fe2dc00967f5","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Upgrade Orleans 8.x to 10.x</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">将 Orleans 8.x 升级到 10.x</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-1","type":"heading","anchor":"starting-and-target-assumptions","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"starting-and-target-assumptions\">Starting and target assumptions</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"starting-and-target-assumptions\">起始与目标假设</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>This guide assumes:</p>","zh":"<p>本指南假设：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-3","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>The application can first move to Orleans 8.2 on .NET 8.</li>\n<li>The upgrade can be validated at Orleans 9.2 before packages move to Orleans 10.x.</li>\n<li>Provider schemas and durable state can be backed up and tested at each checkpoint.</li>\n<li>All Orleans packages move together at each checkpoint.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>应用可以先迁移到 .NET 8 上的 Orleans 8.2。</li>\n<li>将包更新到 Orleans 10.x 之前，可以在 Orleans 9.2 检查点验证升级。</li>\n<li>可以在每个检查点备份并测试提供程序架构和持久化状态。</li>\n<li>在每个检查点，所有 Orleans 包一起更新。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Don’t skip directly from an early Orleans 8 release to Orleans 10 in production. Build and test the application on the latest 8.2 patch, then Orleans 9.2, then the selected Orleans 10.x patch.</p>","zh":"<p>不要在生产环境中直接从早期 Orleans 8 版本跳到 Orleans 10。先在最新的 8.2 补丁版本上构建并测试应用，再迁移到 Orleans 9.2，最后迁移到所选的 Orleans 10.x 补丁版本。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-5","type":"heading","anchor":"orleans-8x-changes-to-complete-first","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"orleans-8x-changes-to-complete-first\">Orleans 8.x changes to complete first</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"orleans-8x-changes-to-complete-first\">首先完成 Orleans 8.x 的变更</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Applications starting before Orleans 8.2 must account for these changes:</p>","zh":"<p>从 Orleans 8.2 之前的版本开始升级的应用，必须处理以下变更：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-7","type":"table","en":"<table><thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>Change</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Load shedding</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">LoadSheddingLimit</a> was replaced by <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">CpuThreshold</a> in Orleans 8.1</td><td>Rename the option and review the added <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">MemoryThreshold</a>.</td></tr><tr><td>Streaming</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.leasebasedqueuebalanceroptions/properties/\">LeaseAquisitionPeriod</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.leasebasedqueuebalanceroptions/fields/\">DefaultMinLeaseAquisitionPeriod</a> were corrected in Orleans 8.2</td><td>Use <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.leasebasedqueuebalanceroptions/properties/\">LeaseAcquisitionPeriod</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.leasebasedqueuebalanceroptions/fields/\">DefaultMinLeaseAcquisitionPeriod</a>.</td></tr><tr><td>Timers</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grainbaseextensions/methods/\">RegisterGrainTimer</a> replaced the obsolete <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">RegisterTimer</a> API in Orleans 8.2</td><td>Migrate callbacks and choose <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.graintimercreationoptions/properties/\">Interleave</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.graintimercreationoptions/properties/\">KeepAlive</a> deliberately.</td></tr><tr><td>Serialization</td><td>MessagePack integration became available in Orleans 8.2</td><td>Don’t change the active serializer during the runtime upgrade unless separately qualified.</td></tr></tbody></table>","zh":"<table><thead><tr><th>领域</th><th>变更</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>负载削减</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">LoadSheddingLimit</a> 在 Orleans 8.1 中被 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">CpuThreshold</a> 替代</td><td>重命名该选项，并审查新增的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.loadsheddingoptions/properties/\">MemoryThreshold</a> 。</td></tr><tr><td>流处理</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.leasebasedqueuebalanceroptions/properties/\">LeaseAquisitionPeriod</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.leasebasedqueuebalanceroptions/fields/\">DefaultMinLeaseAquisitionPeriod</a> 在 Orleans 8.2 中得到修正</td><td>使用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.leasebasedqueuebalanceroptions/properties/\">LeaseAcquisitionPeriod</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.streaming/orleans.configuration.leasebasedqueuebalanceroptions/fields/\">DefaultMinLeaseAcquisitionPeriod</a> 。</td></tr><tr><td>计时器</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grainbaseextensions/methods/\">RegisterGrainTimer</a> 在 Orleans 8.2 中替代了已过时的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">RegisterTimer</a> API</td><td>迁移回调，并有意识地选择 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.graintimercreationoptions/properties/\"> Interleave </a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.graintimercreationoptions/properties/\">KeepAlive</a> 。</td></tr><tr><td>序列化</td><td>Orleans 8.2 开始提供 MessagePack 集成</td><td>除非已单独验证，否则不要在运行时升级期间更改当前使用的序列化器。</td></tr></tbody></table>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>When translating an old timer and preserving its interleaving behavior:</p>","zh":"<p>转换旧计时器并保留其交错执行行为时：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-9","type":"code","en":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">override</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">OnActivateAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">CancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">cancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">_timer</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">this</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">RegisterGrainTimer</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">callback</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">DoWorkAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">,</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">new</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">GrainTimerCreationOptions</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">DueTime</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">TimeSpan</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">FromSeconds</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">),</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Period</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">TimeSpan</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">FromSeconds</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">10</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">),</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Interleave</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">true</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">});</span>\n\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#C586C0;--1:#AC00D8\">return</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CompletedTask</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span>\n\n<span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">private</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">DoWorkAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">CancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">cancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">) =&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CompletedTask</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span></code></pre>","zh":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">override</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">OnActivateAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">CancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">cancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">_timer</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">this</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">RegisterGrainTimer</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">callback</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">DoWorkAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">,</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">new</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">GrainTimerCreationOptions</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">DueTime</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">TimeSpan</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">FromSeconds</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">),</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Period</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">TimeSpan</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">FromSeconds</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">10</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">),</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Interleave</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">true</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">});</span>\n\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#C586C0;--1:#AC00D8\">return</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CompletedTask</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span>\n\n<span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">private</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">DoWorkAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">CancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">cancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">) =&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CompletedTask</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span></code></pre>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For the full timer behavior matrix, see <a href=\"#/docs/grains/timers/::timer-behavior\">Grain timers</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>完整的计时器行为对照表参见 <a href=\"#/docs/grains/timers/::timer-behavior\"> Grain 计时器 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-11","type":"heading","anchor":"validate-the-orleans-92-checkpoint","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"validate-the-orleans-92-checkpoint\">Validate the Orleans 9.2 checkpoint</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"validate-the-orleans-92-checkpoint\">验证 Orleans 9.2 检查点</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans 9.2 introduces behavior that must be understood before moving to Orleans 10.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 9.2 引入了一些行为，在迁移到 Orleans 10 之前必须理解。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-13","type":"heading","anchor":"native-cancellationtoken-parameters","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"native-cancellationtoken-parameters\">Native <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.cancellationtoken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CancellationToken</a> parameters</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"native-cancellationtoken-parameters\">原生 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.cancellationtoken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> CancellationToken </a> 参数</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Grain interface methods can use <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.cancellationtoken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CancellationToken</a> directly. Existing <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.graincancellationtoken/\">GrainCancellationToken</a> code can be migrated independently; don’t combine that API conversion with business-logic changes.</p>","zh":"<p>Grain 接口方法可以直接使用 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.cancellationtoken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> CancellationToken </a> 。现有 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.graincancellationtoken/\">GrainCancellationToken</a> 代码可以独立迁移；不要将这一 API 转换与业务逻辑变更合并进行。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-15","type":"code","en":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">RunAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">CancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">cancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">);</span></code></pre>","zh":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">RunAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">CancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">cancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">);</span></code></pre>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Only one cancellation token is allowed in a grain method. Test cancellation that occurs before dispatch, during execution, after completion, and while the target is unavailable.</p>","zh":"<p>一个 Grain 方法只允许一个取消令牌。应测试派发前、执行期间、完成之后，以及目标不可用期间发生的取消。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-17","type":"heading","anchor":"resource-optimized-placement-is-the-default","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"resource-optimized-placement-is-the-default\">Resource-optimized placement is the default</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"resource-optimized-placement-is-the-default\">资源优化放置成为默认策略</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans 9.2 changed the default placement strategy from <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.randomplacement/\">RandomPlacement</a> to <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.resourceoptimizedplacement/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacement</a>. This can change activation distribution and locality. Either accept and load-test the new default or register <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.randomplacement/\">RandomPlacement</a> explicitly:</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 9.2 将默认放置策略从 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.randomplacement/\">RandomPlacement</a> 改为 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.resourceoptimizedplacement/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacement</a> 。这可能改变激活实例分布和局部性。可以接受新默认值并进行负载测试，也可以显式注册 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.randomplacement/\">RandomPlacement</a> ：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-19","type":"code","en":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">KeepRandomPlacement</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">ISiloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Services</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">AddSingleton</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">PlacementStrategy</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">RandomPlacement</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&gt;();</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span></code></pre>","zh":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">KeepRandomPlacement</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">ISiloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Services</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">AddSingleton</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">PlacementStrategy</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">RandomPlacement</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&gt;();</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span></code></pre>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-20","type":"heading","anchor":"grain-directory-caching","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"grain-directory-caching\">Grain directory caching</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"grain-directory-caching\">Grain 目录缓存</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-21","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The adaptive grain-directory cache implementation was removed in Orleans 9.2. The <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions.cachingstrategytype/\">CachingStrategyType</a> value <code>Adaptive</code> remains as an obsolete alias for LRU. Remove explicit adaptive-cache configuration and tune LRU cache size and expiration based on production measurements.</p>","zh":"<p>自适应 Grain 目录缓存实现在 Orleans 9.2 中已被移除。 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions.cachingstrategytype/\">CachingStrategyType</a> 值 <code>Adaptive</code> 仍作为 LRU 的过时别名保留。移除显式的自适应缓存配置，并根据生产测量结果调整 LRU 缓存大小和过期时间。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-22","type":"heading","anchor":"grain-storage-behavior","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"grain-storage-behavior\">Grain storage behavior</h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"grain-storage-behavior\">Grain 存储行为</h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-23","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans 9.2 aligned storage providers so that <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.igrainstate-1/properties/\">State</a>, <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.igrainstate-1/properties/\">RecordExists</a>, and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.igrainstate-1/properties/\">ETag</a> follow consistent rules after reads and clears. Test activation initialization and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.core.istorage/methods/\">ClearStateAsync</a> behavior for every provider, especially code that inferred record existence from a null state object.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 9.2 统一了各存储提供程序，使 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.igrainstate-1/properties/\"> State </a> 、 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.igrainstate-1/properties/\">RecordExists</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.igrainstate-1/properties/\"> ETag </a> 在读取和清除后遵循一致规则。应测试每个提供程序的激活初始化和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.core.istorage/methods/\">ClearStateAsync</a> 行为，尤其是根据状态对象为 null 推断记录是否存在的代码。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-24","type":"heading","anchor":"apply-the-orleans-10-changes","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"apply-the-orleans-10-changes\">Apply the Orleans 10 changes</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"apply-the-orleans-10-changes\">应用 Orleans 10 的变更</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-25","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>After the Orleans 9.2 checkpoint is stable, complete every step in <a href=\"#/docs/migration/9-to-10/\">Upgrade Orleans 9.x to 10.x</a>, including:</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 9.2 检查点稳定后，完成 <a href=\"#/docs/migration/9-to-10/\"> 将 Orleans 9.x 升级到 10.x </a> 中的每一步，包括：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-26","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>Removing obsolete <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.unorderedattribute/\">UnorderedAttribute</a> and valid <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.orleansconstructorattribute/\">OrleansConstructorAttribute</a> uses.</li>\n<li>Setting timeout-cancellation behavior explicitly.</li>\n<li>Moving SQL Server ADO.NET providers to <code>Microsoft.Data.SqlClient</code>.</li>\n<li>Keeping hosting, call filters, serializer contracts, and provider schemas stable.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>移除已过时的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.unorderedattribute/\">UnorderedAttribute</a> 和有效的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.orleansconstructorattribute/\">OrleansConstructorAttribute</a> 用法。</li>\n<li>显式设置超时取消行为。</li>\n<li>将 SQL Server ADO.NET 提供程序迁移到 <code>Microsoft.Data.SqlClient</code> 。</li>\n<li>保持宿主、调用筛选器、序列化器协定和提供程序架构稳定。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-27","type":"heading","anchor":"serialization-and-state-compatibility","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"serialization-and-state-compatibility\">Serialization and state compatibility</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"serialization-and-state-compatibility\">序列化与状态兼容性</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-28","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans 8, 9, and 10 use the version-tolerant serializer introduced in Orleans 7, but application changes can still make stored data incompatible.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 8、9 和 10 使用 Orleans 7 引入的版本容错序列化器，但应用变更仍可能使存储数据不兼容。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-29","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>Keep all <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.aliasattribute/\">AliasAttribute</a> values stable.</li>\n<li>Don’t reorder record primary-constructor parameters.</li>\n<li>Don’t change storage serializers while changing runtime majors.</li>\n<li>Test old-state reads and rollback reads after every checkpoint.</li>\n<li>Preserve stream partition counts and provider names.</li>\n<li>Apply provider schema migrations in order and keep a pre-migration recovery point.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>保持所有 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.aliasattribute/\">AliasAttribute</a> 值稳定。</li>\n<li>不要对记录类型的主构造函数参数重新排序。</li>\n<li>更改运行时主版本时，不要更改存储序列化器。</li>\n<li>每个检查点之后，都测试旧状态读取和回滚读取。</li>\n<li>保留流分区数量和提供程序名称。</li>\n<li>按顺序应用提供程序架构迁移，并保留迁移前的恢复点。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-30","type":"heading","anchor":"deployment-and-rollback","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"deployment-and-rollback\">Deployment and rollback</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"deployment-and-rollback\">部署与回滚</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-31","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Use separate clusters for the 8-to-9 and 9-to-10 production transitions unless each mixed-major pair has been explicitly qualified. Grain interface versioning helps application versions coexist, but it doesn’t extend the documented runtime guarantee beyond one Orleans major family.</p>","zh":"<p>8 到 9 和 9 到 10 的生产迁移应使用独立集群，除非每个混合主版本组合都已得到显式验证。Grain 接口版本控制有助于应用版本共存，但不会将文档中的运行时保证扩展到同一 Orleans 主版本系列之外。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-32","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Follow <a href=\"#/docs/migration/deployment-and-rollback/\">Upgrade deployment and rollback</a> at each checkpoint. Don’t allow writes in the new cluster until the rollback build has been tested against the resulting state and provider schema.</p>","zh":"<p>在每个检查点遵循 <a href=\"#/docs/migration/deployment-and-rollback/\"> 升级部署与回滚 </a> 。在回滚构建版本针对迁移后状态和提供程序架构完成测试之前，不要允许新集群写入。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-33","type":"heading","anchor":"checklist","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"checklist\">Checklist</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"checklist\">检查清单</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"352e576d316f89f3-34","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Update the application to the latest Orleans 8.2 patch on .NET 8.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Replace renamed load-shedding and lease-balancer options.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Migrate <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">RegisterTimer</a> to <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grainbaseextensions/methods/\">RegisterGrainTimer</a> and select timer options.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Build and test on the latest Orleans 9.2 patch.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Decide whether to keep resource-optimized placement or register random placement.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Remove adaptive grain-directory cache configuration.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Test native cancellation and provider state semantics.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Complete the Orleans 9-to-10 checklist.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Validate serialization, streams, reminders, and provider schemas at every checkpoint.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Rehearse deployment and rollback for each major-version transition.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  将应用更新到 .NET 8 上最新的 Orleans 8.2 补丁版本。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  替换已重命名的负载削减和租约均衡器选项。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  将 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">RegisterTimer</a> 迁移到 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grainbaseextensions/methods/\">RegisterGrainTimer</a> ，并选择计时器选项。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  在最新的 Orleans 9.2 补丁版本上构建并测试。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  决定保留资源优化放置，还是注册随机放置。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  移除自适应 Grain 目录缓存配置。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  测试原生取消和提供程序状态语义。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  完成 Orleans 9 到 10 的检查清单。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  在每个检查点验证序列化、流、提醒器和提供程序架构。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  为每次跨主版本迁移演练部署与回滚。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"}]},"5842e03bea4fc952":{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952","title":"Upgrade Orleans 9.x to 10.x","titleZh":"将 Orleans 9.x 升级到 10.x","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/migration/9-to-10/","sourceHash":"490c65d9ccb33a2e224cabec8417ce325416ebbd190c166e1e0b3e316fa55c9f","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Upgrade Orleans 9.x to 10.x</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">将 Orleans 9.x 升级到 10.x</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-1","type":"heading","anchor":"starting-and-target-assumptions","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"starting-and-target-assumptions\">Starting and target assumptions</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"starting-and-target-assumptions\">起始与目标假设</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>This guide assumes:</p>","zh":"<p>本指南假设：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-3","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>The application runs on the latest Orleans 9.x patch, preferably Orleans 9.2.1.</li>\n<li>The application and its dependencies support a .NET version targeted by the selected Orleans packages.</li>\n<li>All Orleans packages in the solution will move to the same current Orleans 10.x patch.</li>\n<li>Provider schemas are current for the deployed Orleans 9.x version.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>应用运行于最新的 Orleans 9.x 补丁版本，最好是 Orleans 9.2.1。</li>\n<li>应用及其依赖项支持所选 Orleans 包面向的某个 .NET 版本。</li>\n<li>解决方案中的所有 Orleans 包都将更新到同一个当前 Orleans 10.x 补丁版本。</li>\n<li>提供程序架构与已部署的 Orleans 9.x 版本保持同步。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans 10.4 and earlier packages target .NET 8 and .NET 10. Later Orleans packages target .NET 10 and .NET 11. Retarget the application in a separate, validated change: either after the Orleans upgrade when the selected packages support its current framework, or on Orleans 9.2 before the Orleans upgrade when they don’t. Keeping the framework unchanged during the Orleans upgrade reduces the number of variables.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 10.4 及更早版本的包面向 .NET 8 和 .NET 10。之后的 Orleans 包面向 .NET 10 和 .NET 11。应通过单独且经过验证的变更调整应用目标框架：如果所选包支持当前框架，可在 Orleans 升级后进行；如果不支持，则在 Orleans 升级之前，先基于 Orleans 9.2 调整。Orleans 升级期间保持框架不变，可以减少变量数量。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-5","type":"heading","anchor":"change-summary","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"change-summary\">Change summary</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"change-summary\">变更概览</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-6","type":"table","en":"<table><thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>Orleans 10 impact</th><th>Required action</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Source and analyzers</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.unorderedattribute/\">UnorderedAttribute</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.orleansconstructorattribute/\">OrleansConstructorAttribute</a> are obsolete</td><td>Remove <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.unorderedattribute/\">UnorderedAttribute</a>. Replace <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.orleansconstructorattribute/\">OrleansConstructorAttribute</a> only when DI constructor selection is required.</td></tr><tr><td>Behavior</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/properties/\">CancelRequestOnTimeout</a> now defaults to <code>false</code></td><td>Set it explicitly if the application depends on cancellation being sent after a timeout.</td></tr><tr><td>ADO.NET providers</td><td>SQL Server now uses <code>Microsoft.Data.SqlClient</code> and its invariant name by default</td><td>Replace <code>System.Data.SqlClient</code>, update the invariant, and test every ADO.NET provider.</td></tr><tr><td>Serialization and state</td><td>Orleans 10 doesn’t require a wire-format or grain-state rewrite from Orleans 9</td><td>Preserve serializer IDs, aliases, provider serializer settings, and stored type compatibility.</td></tr><tr><td>Hosting</td><td>The generic-host <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleanssilogenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleans</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleansclientgenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleansClient</a> model remains current</td><td>No hosting rewrite is required for an Orleans 9 application already using these APIs.</td></tr><tr><td>Placement</td><td>Orleans 9.2 already changed the default to <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.resourceoptimizedplacement/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacement</a></td><td>Keep it, or register <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.randomplacement/\">RandomPlacement</a> explicitly before the upgrade if deterministic continuity is required.</td></tr><tr><td>Cancellation</td><td>Orleans 10 adds cancellation support for observers and system targets</td><td>Keep at most one <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.cancellationtoken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CancellationToken</a> parameter per grain method and test timeout/cancellation races.</td></tr><tr><td>Timers</td><td>No new Orleans 10 timer break</td><td>Continue using <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grainbaseextensions/methods/\">RegisterGrainTimer</a>; <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">RegisterTimer</a> was already obsolete in Orleans 8.2.</td></tr><tr><td>Call filters</td><td>No new Orleans 10 filter registration model</td><td>Continue registering incoming and outgoing filters on <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.isilobuilder/\">ISiloBuilder</a> or <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.hosting.iclientbuilder/\">IClientBuilder</a>.</td></tr><tr><td>Deployment</td><td>Cross-major mixed clusters aren’t covered by the documented compatibility guarantee</td><td>Use a parallel Orleans 10 cluster unless your exact mixed-version topology has been qualified.</td></tr></tbody></table>","zh":"<table><thead><tr><th>领域</th><th>Orleans 10 的影响</th><th>必需操作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>源码与分析器</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.unorderedattribute/\">UnorderedAttribute</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.orleansconstructorattribute/\">OrleansConstructorAttribute</a> 已过时</td><td>移除 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.unorderedattribute/\">UnorderedAttribute</a> 。只有需要为依赖注入选择构造函数时，才替换 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.orleansconstructorattribute/\">OrleansConstructorAttribute</a> 。</td></tr><tr><td>行为</td><td><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/properties/\">CancelRequestOnTimeout</a> 现在默认为 <code>false</code></td><td>如果应用依赖超时后发送取消，应显式设置该选项。</td></tr><tr><td>ADO.NET providers</td><td>SQL Server 现在默认使用 <code>Microsoft.Data.SqlClient</code> 及其不变名称</td><td>替换 <code>System.Data.SqlClient</code> ，更新提供程序不变名称，并测试每个 ADO.NET 提供程序。</td></tr><tr><td>序列化与状态</td><td>从 Orleans 9 升级到 Orleans 10 不要求重写通信格式或 Grain 状态</td><td>保留序列化器 ID、别名、提供程序序列化器设置，以及存储类型兼容性。</td></tr><tr><td>托管</td><td>通用宿主的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleanssilogenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleans</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleansclientgenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleansClient</a> 模型仍是当前模型</td><td>已经使用这些 API 的 Orleans 9 应用无需重写宿主。</td></tr><tr><td>放置</td><td>Orleans 9.2 已将默认值改为 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.resourceoptimizedplacement/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacement</a></td><td>保留它；如果需要明确保持原有策略的连续性，则在升级之前显式注册 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.randomplacement/\">RandomPlacement</a> 。</td></tr><tr><td>取消</td><td>Orleans 10 为观察者和系统目标增加取消支持</td><td>每个 Grain 方法至多保留一个 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.cancellationtoken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> CancellationToken </a> 参数，并测试超时与取消之间的竞态。</td></tr><tr><td>计时器</td><td>Orleans 10 没有新增计时器破坏性变更</td><td>继续使用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grainbaseextensions/methods/\">RegisterGrainTimer</a> ； <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">RegisterTimer</a> 在 Orleans 8.2 中就已过时。</td></tr><tr><td>调用筛选器</td><td>Orleans 10 没有新的筛选器注册模型</td><td>继续在 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.isilobuilder/\">ISiloBuilder</a> 或 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.hosting.iclientbuilder/\">IClientBuilder</a> 上注册入站和出站筛选器。</td></tr><tr><td>部署</td><td>文档中的兼容性保证不涵盖跨主版本的混合集群</td><td>使用并行的 Orleans 10 集群，除非确切的混合版本拓扑已经得到验证。</td></tr></tbody></table>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-7","type":"heading","anchor":"update-packages-centrally","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"update-packages-centrally\">Update packages centrally</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"update-packages-centrally\">集中更新包</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Keep package versions aligned. For example, with NuGet Central Package Management:</p>","zh":"<p>保持包版本一致。例如，使用 NuGet 集中包管理时：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-9","type":"code","en":"<pre data-language=\"xml\"><code class=\"language-xml\"><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">Project</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"indent\">  </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">PropertyGroup</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">ManagePackageVersionsCentrally</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">true</span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">ManagePackageVersionsCentrally</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">OrleansVersion</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">10.2.2</span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">OrleansVersion</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"indent\">  </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">PropertyGroup</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"indent\">  </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">ItemGroup</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">PackageVersion</span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#D30000\">Include</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#CE9178;--1:#0000FF\">\"Microsoft.Orleans.Client\"</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#D30000\">Version</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#CE9178;--1:#0000FF\">\"$(OrleansVersion)\"</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#949494;--1:#800000\">/&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">PackageVersion</span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#D30000\">Include</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#CE9178;--1:#0000FF\">\"Microsoft.Orleans.Sdk\"</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#D30000\">Version</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#CE9178;--1:#0000FF\">\"$(OrleansVersion)\"</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#949494;--1:#800000\">/&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">PackageVersion</span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#D30000\">Include</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#CE9178;--1:#0000FF\">\"Microsoft.Orleans.Server\"</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#D30000\">Version</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#CE9178;--1:#0000FF\">\"$(OrleansVersion)\"</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#949494;--1:#800000\">/&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">  </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">ItemGroup</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">Project</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span></code></pre>","zh":"<pre data-language=\"xml\"><code class=\"language-xml\"><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">Project</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"indent\">  </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">PropertyGroup</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">ManagePackageVersionsCentrally</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">true</span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">ManagePackageVersionsCentrally</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">OrleansVersion</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">10.2.2</span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">OrleansVersion</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"indent\">  </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">PropertyGroup</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"indent\">  </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">ItemGroup</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">PackageVersion</span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#D30000\">Include</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#CE9178;--1:#0000FF\">\"Microsoft.Orleans.Client\"</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#D30000\">Version</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#CE9178;--1:#0000FF\">\"$(OrleansVersion)\"</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#949494;--1:#800000\">/&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">PackageVersion</span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#D30000\">Include</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#CE9178;--1:#0000FF\">\"Microsoft.Orleans.Sdk\"</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#D30000\">Version</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#CE9178;--1:#0000FF\">\"$(OrleansVersion)\"</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#949494;--1:#800000\">/&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">PackageVersion</span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#D30000\">Include</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#CE9178;--1:#0000FF\">\"Microsoft.Orleans.Server\"</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#D30000\">Version</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#CE9178;--1:#0000FF\">\"$(OrleansVersion)\"</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#949494;--1:#800000\">/&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">  </span><span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">ItemGroup</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span style=\"--1:#800000\"><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6\">Project</span><span style=\"--0:#949494\">&gt;</span></span></code></pre>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Use the current stable Orleans 10.x patch when you perform the migration. Add every provider package used by the solution to the same central file, using the same Orleans version.</p>","zh":"<p>执行迁移时，使用当前稳定的 Orleans 10.x 补丁版本。将解决方案使用的每个提供程序包都加入同一个中央文件，并使用相同的 Orleans 版本。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-11","type":"heading","anchor":"review-source-warnings","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"review-source-warnings\">Review source warnings</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"review-source-warnings\">审查源码警告</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-12","type":"heading","anchor":"remove-unorderedattribute-","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"remove-unorderedattribute-\">Remove <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.unorderedattribute/\">UnorderedAttribute</a> <span id=\"remove-unordered\"></span></h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"remove-unorderedattribute-\">移除 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.unorderedattribute/\">UnorderedAttribute</a> <span id=\"remove-unordered\"> </span></h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-13","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.unorderedattribute/\">UnorderedAttribute</a> has no effect because Orleans doesn’t guarantee message ordering based on this attribute. Remove it from grain interfaces.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.unorderedattribute/\">UnorderedAttribute</a> 不起作用，因为 Orleans 不会根据此特性保证消息顺序。将其从 Grain 接口中移除。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-14","type":"heading","anchor":"replace-orleansconstructorattribute-only-for-dependency-injection-","level":3,"en":"<h3 id=\"replace-orleansconstructorattribute-only-for-dependency-injection-\">Replace <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.orleansconstructorattribute/\">OrleansConstructorAttribute</a> only for dependency injection <span id=\"replace-orleansconstructor-only-for-dependency-injection\"></span></h3>","zh":"<h3 id=\"replace-orleansconstructorattribute-only-for-dependency-injection-\">仅为依赖注入替换 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.orleansconstructorattribute/\">OrleansConstructorAttribute</a> <span id=\"replace-orleansconstructor-only-for-dependency-injection\"> </span></h3>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.orleansconstructorattribute/\">OrleansConstructorAttribute</a> is no longer recognized by Orleans. If a serializable type needs a constructor selected for dependency injection, use <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generatedactivatorconstructorattribute/\">GeneratedActivatorConstructorAttribute</a> or <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/microsoft.extensions.dependencyinjection.activatorutilitiesconstructorattribute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ActivatorUtilitiesConstructorAttribute</a>. These attributes don’t select a constructor for deserializing data members.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 已不再识别 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.orleansconstructorattribute/\">OrleansConstructorAttribute</a> 。如果可序列化类型需要为依赖注入选择构造函数，使用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.generatedactivatorconstructorattribute/\">GeneratedActivatorConstructorAttribute</a> 或 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/microsoft.extensions.dependencyinjection.activatorutilitiesconstructorattribute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> ActivatorUtilitiesConstructorAttribute </a> 。这些特性不会为数据成员反序列化选择构造函数。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Don’t change member IDs or constructor-visible state as part of this cleanup.</p>","zh":"<p>不要在这次清理中更改成员 ID 或构造函数可见的状态。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-17","type":"heading","anchor":"make-timeout-cancellation-explicit","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"make-timeout-cancellation-explicit\">Make timeout cancellation explicit</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"make-timeout-cancellation-explicit\">显式指定超时取消</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans 10 defaults <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/properties/\">CancelRequestOnTimeout</a> to <code>false</code>. A timed-out caller therefore stops waiting, but Orleans doesn’t automatically send cancellation to the target.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 10 将 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/properties/\">CancelRequestOnTimeout</a> 的默认值设为 <code>false</code> 。因此，超时的调用方会停止等待，但 Orleans 不会自动向目标发送取消。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-19","type":"code","en":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">ConfigureTimeoutCancellation</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">ISiloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">Configure</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">SiloMessagingOptions</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&gt;(</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> =&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CancelRequestOnTimeout</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">true</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">});</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span>\n\n<span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">ConfigureTimeoutCancellation</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">IClientBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">clientBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">clientBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">Configure</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">ClientMessagingOptions</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&gt;(</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> =&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CancelRequestOnTimeout</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">true</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">});</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span></code></pre>","zh":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">ConfigureTimeoutCancellation</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">ISiloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">Configure</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">SiloMessagingOptions</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&gt;(</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> =&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CancelRequestOnTimeout</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">true</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">});</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span>\n\n<span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">ConfigureTimeoutCancellation</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">IClientBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">clientBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">clientBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">Configure</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">ClientMessagingOptions</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&gt;(</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> =&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CancelRequestOnTimeout</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">true</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">});</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span></code></pre>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-20","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Set this option on clients and silos that originate calls. A timeout isn’t proof that the target stopped executing, regardless of this option, so grain methods must remain safe to retry.</p>","zh":"<p>在发起调用的客户端和 Silo 上设置此选项。无论此选项如何设置，超时都不能证明目标已停止执行，因此 Grain 方法必须保持可安全重试。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-21","type":"heading","anchor":"update-sql-server-adonet-configuration","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"update-sql-server-adonet-configuration\">Update SQL Server ADO.NET configuration</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"update-sql-server-adonet-configuration\">更新 SQL Server ADO.NET 配置</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-22","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans 10 ADO.NET clustering, persistence, reminders, and streaming use <code>Microsoft.Data.SqlClient</code> for SQL Server.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 10 的 ADO.NET 集群、持久化、提醒器和流式处理，针对 SQL Server 使用 <code>Microsoft.Data.SqlClient</code> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-23","type":"list","en":"<ol>\n<li>Remove direct <code>System.Data.SqlClient</code> package references.</li>\n<li>Add <code>Microsoft.Data.SqlClient</code> through your central package policy. Use a current version supported by your application; don’t copy an old pinned version from an earlier migration guide.</li>\n<li>Change the provider invariant from <code>System.Data.SqlClient</code> to <code>Microsoft.Data.SqlClient</code>.</li>\n<li>Apply any provider migration scripts required between the schema version currently deployed and the target Orleans version.</li>\n<li>Test clustering, grain storage, reminders, and streams independently.</li>\n</ol>","zh":"<ol>\n<li>移除对 <code>System.Data.SqlClient</code> 包的直接引用。</li>\n<li>通过集中包策略添加 <code>Microsoft.Data.SqlClient</code> 。使用应用支持的当前版本；不要从较早的迁移指南复制旧的固定版本。</li>\n<li>将提供程序不变名称从 <code>System.Data.SqlClient</code> 改为 <code>Microsoft.Data.SqlClient</code> 。</li>\n<li>应用当前已部署架构版本与目标 Orleans 版本之间所需的提供程序迁移脚本。</li>\n<li>分别独立测试集群、Grain 存储、提醒器和流。</li>\n</ol>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-24","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Use the repository migration directories for <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/tree/main/src/AdoNet/Orleans.Clustering.AdoNet/Migrations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clustering</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/tree/main/src/AdoNet/Orleans.Persistence.AdoNet/Migrations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">persistence</a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/tree/main/src/AdoNet/Orleans.Reminders.AdoNet/Migrations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">reminders</a>. Select the scripts for your database and apply them in version order.</p>","zh":"<p>使用仓库中的 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/tree/main/src/AdoNet/Orleans.Clustering.AdoNet/Migrations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 集群 </a> 、 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/tree/main/src/AdoNet/Orleans.Persistence.AdoNet/Migrations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 持久化 </a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/orleans/tree/main/src/AdoNet/Orleans.Reminders.AdoNet/Migrations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 提醒器 </a> 迁移目录。选择适合数据库的脚本，并按版本顺序应用。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-25","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The client-library switch doesn’t itself change your grain-state payload format. It can change connection defaults and authentication behavior, so validate connection encryption, certificates, authentication, retry policy, and transaction behavior in staging.</p>","zh":"<p>客户端库切换本身不会改变 Grain 状态负载格式。但它可能改变连接默认值和身份验证行为，因此，应在预生产环境验证连接加密、证书、身份验证、重试策略和事务行为。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-26","type":"heading","anchor":"preserve-serialization-and-state-compatibility","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"preserve-serialization-and-state-compatibility\">Preserve serialization and state compatibility</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"preserve-serialization-and-state-compatibility\">保留序列化与状态兼容性</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-27","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>No Orleans 9-to-10 migration step requires renumbering <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a> values or rewriting state. Preserve the existing contract:</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 9 到 10 的任何迁移步骤都不要求重新编号 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a> 值或重写状态。保留现有协定：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-28","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>Don’t reuse or renumber <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a> values.</li>\n<li>Keep <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.aliasattribute/\">AliasAttribute</a> values stable when types or assemblies move.</li>\n<li>Don’t reorder record primary-constructor parameters used as implicit serializer IDs.</li>\n<li>Keep the configured grain-storage serializer unchanged during the runtime upgrade.</li>\n<li>Read representative old state, write it with Orleans 10, and verify that the rollback build can still read it before allowing production writes.</li>\n<li>Apply ADO.NET schema scripts in order and verify rollback compatibility before applying any irreversible script.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>不要复用或重新编号 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.idattribute/\">IdAttribute</a> 值。</li>\n<li>类型或程序集迁移时，保持 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.aliasattribute/\">AliasAttribute</a> 值稳定。</li>\n<li>不要对用作隐式序列化器 ID 的记录类型主构造函数参数重新排序。</li>\n<li>运行时升级期间，保持配置的 Grain 存储序列化器不变。</li>\n<li>读取具有代表性的旧状态，用 Orleans 10 写入，并在允许生产写入之前，验证回滚构建版本仍能读取它。</li>\n<li>按顺序应用 ADO.NET 架构脚本，并在应用任何不可逆脚本之前验证回滚兼容性。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-29","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For the version-tolerance rules, see <a href=\"#/docs/host/configuration-guide/serialization/\">Orleans serialization</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>版本容错规则参见 <a href=\"#/docs/host/configuration-guide/serialization/\"> Orleans 序列化 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-30","type":"heading","anchor":"confirm-hosting-placement-timers-and-filters","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"confirm-hosting-placement-timers-and-filters\">Confirm hosting, placement, timers, and filters</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"confirm-hosting-placement-timers-and-filters\">确认宿主、放置、计时器和筛选器</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-31","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>An Orleans 9 application already using <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/microsoft.extensions.hosting.host.createapplicationbuilder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CreateApplicationBuilder</a>, <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleanssilogenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleans</a>, or <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleansclientgenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleansClient</a> doesn’t need a hosting rewrite.</p>","zh":"<p>已经使用 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/microsoft.extensions.hosting.host.createapplicationbuilder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> CreateApplicationBuilder </a> 、 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleanssilogenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleans</a> 或 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/microsoft.extensions.hosting.orleansclientgenerichostextensions/methods/\">UseOrleansClient</a> 的 Orleans 9 应用，不需要重写宿主。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-32","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans 9.2 made <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.resourceoptimizedplacement/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacement</a> the default. If the production cluster still relies on <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.randomplacement/\">RandomPlacement</a>, make that policy explicit:</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 9.2 将 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.resourceoptimizedplacement/\">ResourceOptimizedPlacement</a> 设为默认值。如果生产集群仍依赖 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.randomplacement/\">RandomPlacement</a> ，应显式指定该策略：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-33","type":"code","en":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">KeepRandomPlacement</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">ISiloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Services</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">AddSingleton</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">PlacementStrategy</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">RandomPlacement</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&gt;();</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span></code></pre>","zh":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">KeepRandomPlacement</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">ISiloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Services</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">AddSingleton</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">PlacementStrategy</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">RandomPlacement</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&gt;();</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span></code></pre>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-34","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Continue using <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grainbaseextensions/methods/\">RegisterGrainTimer</a>. When preserving behavior from the old <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">RegisterTimer</a> API, set <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.graintimercreationoptions/properties/\">Interleave</a> to <code>true</code>; the new API defaults to non-interleaving callbacks.</p>","zh":"<p>继续使用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grainbaseextensions/methods/\">RegisterGrainTimer</a> 。需要保留旧 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">RegisterTimer</a> API 的行为时，将 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.graintimercreationoptions/properties/\"> Interleave </a> 设为 <code>true</code> ；新 API 默认使用不交错执行的回调。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-35","type":"code","en":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">override</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">OnActivateAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">CancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">cancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">_timer</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">this</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">RegisterGrainTimer</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">callback</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">DoWorkAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">,</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">new</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">GrainTimerCreationOptions</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">DueTime</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">TimeSpan</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">FromSeconds</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">),</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Period</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">TimeSpan</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">FromSeconds</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">10</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">),</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Interleave</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">true</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">});</span>\n\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#C586C0;--1:#AC00D8\">return</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CompletedTask</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span>\n\n<span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">private</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">DoWorkAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">CancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">cancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">) =&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CompletedTask</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span></code></pre>","zh":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">override</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">OnActivateAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">CancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">cancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">_timer</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">this</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">RegisterGrainTimer</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">callback</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">DoWorkAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">,</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">new</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">GrainTimerCreationOptions</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">DueTime</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">TimeSpan</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">FromSeconds</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">),</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Period</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">TimeSpan</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">FromSeconds</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">10</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">),</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">            </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Interleave</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">true</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">});</span>\n\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#C586C0;--1:#AC00D8\">return</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CompletedTask</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span>\n\n<span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">private</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">DoWorkAsync</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">CancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">cancellationToken</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">) =&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">Task</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">CompletedTask</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span></code></pre>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-36","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Register call filters on the Orleans builders, not directly on <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/microsoft.extensions.dependencyinjection.iservicecollection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">IServiceCollection</a>:</p>","zh":"<p>在 Orleans 构建器上注册调用筛选器，而不是直接在 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/microsoft.extensions.dependencyinjection.iservicecollection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> IServiceCollection </a> 上注册：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-37","type":"code","en":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">ConfigureCallFilters</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">ISiloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">AddIncomingGrainCallFilter</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">async</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">context</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> =&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">await</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">context</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">Invoke</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">();</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">});</span>\n\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">AddOutgoingGrainCallFilter</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">MyOutgoingCallFilter</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&gt;();</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span></code></pre>","zh":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">public</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">ConfigureCallFilters</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">ISiloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">)</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">AddIncomingGrainCallFilter</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">async</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">context</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> =&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">await</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">context</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">Invoke</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">();</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">});</span>\n\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">AddOutgoingGrainCallFilter</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">MyOutgoingCallFilter</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&gt;();</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">}</span></code></pre>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-38","type":"heading","anchor":"deploy-and-retain-rollback","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"deploy-and-retain-rollback\">Deploy and retain rollback</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"deploy-and-retain-rollback\">部署并保留回滚能力</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-39","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Follow <a href=\"#/docs/migration/deployment-and-rollback/\">Upgrade deployment and rollback</a>. Use a separate Orleans 10 cluster by default. Keep the Orleans 9 cluster and its last compatible state recovery point until:</p>","zh":"<p>遵循 <a href=\"#/docs/migration/deployment-and-rollback/\"> 升级部署与回滚 </a> 。默认使用独立的 Orleans 10 集群。保留 Orleans 9 集群及其最后一个兼容的状态恢复点，直到：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-40","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>Orleans 10 clients and silos have passed smoke and load tests.</li>\n<li>Provider data written by Orleans 10 is proven readable by the rollback build.</li>\n<li>No queued or streamed payload contains a type shape unavailable to Orleans 9.</li>\n<li>Metrics show stable activation placement, call latency, cancellation, reminder, and storage behavior.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>Orleans 10 客户端和 Silo 通过冒烟测试和负载测试。</li>\n<li>已证实回滚构建版本能够读取 Orleans 10 写入的提供程序数据。</li>\n<li>任何排队负载或流负载都不包含 Orleans 9 中不可用的类型结构。</li>\n<li>指标表明激活实例放置、调用延迟、取消、提醒器和存储行为稳定。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-41","type":"heading","anchor":"checklist","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"checklist\">Checklist</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"checklist\">检查清单</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5842e03bea4fc952-42","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Update to the latest Orleans 9.x patch and remove build warnings.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Align every <code>Microsoft.Orleans.*</code> package on one current 10.x patch.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Keep the application’s .NET version for the first deployment, or qualify the .NET 10 retarget separately on Orleans 9.2.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Remove <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.unorderedattribute/\">UnorderedAttribute</a> and replace valid <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.orleansconstructorattribute/\">OrleansConstructorAttribute</a> uses.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Set <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/properties/\">CancelRequestOnTimeout</a> explicitly.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Replace <code>System.Data.SqlClient</code> and its invariant if SQL Server is used.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Preserve serializer IDs, aliases, and grain-storage serializer settings.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Confirm the intended placement strategy, timer interleaving, and call-filter registration.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Validate provider schemas and representative persisted state.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Prepare and rehearse a parallel-cluster deployment and rollback.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  更新到最新的 Orleans 9.x 补丁版本，并消除构建警告。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  将每个 <code>Microsoft.Orleans.*</code> 包统一到同一个当前 10.x 补丁版本。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  首次部署保留应用的 .NET 版本，或先在 Orleans 9.2 上单独验证迁移至 .NET 10 目标框架。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  移除 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.concurrency.unorderedattribute/\">UnorderedAttribute</a> ，并替换有效的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.orleansconstructorattribute/\">OrleansConstructorAttribute</a> 用法。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  显式设置 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.configuration.messagingoptions/properties/\">CancelRequestOnTimeout</a> 。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  如果使用 SQL Server，替换 <code>System.Data.SqlClient</code> 及其不变名称。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  保留序列化器 ID、别名和 Grain 存储序列化器设置。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  确认预期的放置策略、计时器交错执行和调用筛选器注册。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  验证提供程序架构和具有代表性的持久化状态。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  准备并演练并行集群部署与回滚。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"}]},"5c86716f5ab2cdc4":{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4","title":"Migrate Orleans contract identities","titleZh":"迁移 Orleans 协定标识","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/migration/contract-identities/","sourceHash":"dcb5654f270ef3cc4086fb5f68aa5950ff586c641381d85b5103e4e3322a4718","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Migrate Orleans contract identities</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">迁移 Orleans 协定标识</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>The <a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-versioning/contract-compatibility-analyzer/\">contract compatibility analyzer</a> records the identity used by Orleans: an explicit <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.graininterfacetypeattribute/\">GrainInterfaceTypeAttribute</a>, otherwise the interface’s <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.aliasattribute/\">AliasAttribute</a>, otherwise its CLR name with aliases substituted for containing types.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-versioning/contract-compatibility-analyzer/\"> 协定兼容性分析器 </a> 记录 Orleans 使用的身份：优先采用显式 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.graininterfacetypeattribute/\">GrainInterfaceTypeAttribute</a> ，否则采用接口的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.aliasattribute/\">AliasAttribute</a> ，再否则采用 CLR 名称，并以别名替换其中的包含类型名称。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans 10.4.0 generated CLR-based interface identities even for aliased interfaces. Upgrading to alias-aware analysis requires a one-time review of those checked-in <code>OrleansContracts.txt</code> entries. Identity validation also introduces a separate runtime compatibility requirement for applications with aliases containing newly rejected characters.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 10.4.0 即使对带别名的接口，也会生成基于 CLR 的接口身份。升级到能够识别别名的分析时，需要对已纳入版本控制的这些 <code>OrleansContracts.txt</code> 条目进行一次性审查。对于别名包含新规则拒绝字符的应用，身份验证还引入了一项独立的运行时兼容性要求。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-3","type":"heading","anchor":"migrate-a-1040-contract-manifest","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"migrate-a-1040-contract-manifest\">Migrate a 10.4.0 contract manifest</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"migrate-a-1040-contract-manifest\">迁移 10.4.0 协定清单</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Perform the baseline migration against the last deployed source and configuration, before changing application contracts:</p>","zh":"<p>在更改应用协定之前，针对最后部署的源码和配置执行基线迁移：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-5","type":"list","en":"<ol>\n<li>Keep a copy of the deployed source, its contract manifests, and its identity configuration.</li>\n<li>Resolve each affected interface’s deployed identity using <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.metadata.graininterfacetyperesolver/methods/\">GetGrainInterfaceType</a>. Check explicit interface identities first, then interface and containing-type aliases. Review custom identity providers and configured type aliases against the application’s runtime configuration.</li>\n<li>For an entry which incorrectly records a CLR name, replace its recorded <code>GrainInterfaceType</code> value with the verified deployed identity. Preserve its CLR name, version, method identities, signatures, comments, and retirement status.</li>\n<li>Build with the updated analyzer and review every remaining diagnostic. After the baseline matches the deployed identities, regenerate it using the <a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-versioning/contract-compatibility-analyzer/::regenerate-the-manifest\">project-level regeneration command</a> and review the diff.</li>\n<li>Commit the baseline correction separately from application contract changes. Confirm that a subsequent alias change produces a contract diagnostic.</li>\n</ol>","zh":"<ol>\n<li>保留已部署源码、其协定清单和身份配置的副本。</li>\n<li>使用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core/orleans.metadata.graininterfacetyperesolver/methods/\">GetGrainInterfaceType</a> 解析每个受影响接口已部署的身份。先检查显式接口身份，再检查接口和包含类型的别名。结合应用运行时配置，审查自定义身份提供程序和配置的类型别名。</li>\n<li>对于错误记录了 CLR 名称的条目，将其记录的 <code>GrainInterfaceType</code> 值替换为已验证的部署身份。保留其 CLR 名称、版本、方法身份、签名、注释和退役状态。</li>\n<li>使用更新的分析器构建，并审查每个剩余诊断。基线与已部署身份一致后，使用 <a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-versioning/contract-compatibility-analyzer/::regenerate-the-manifest\"> 项目级重新生成命令 </a> 重新生成，并审查差异。</li>\n<li>将基线修正与应用协定更改分开提交。确认后续别名变更会产生协定诊断。</li>\n</ol>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For example, if the deployed interface <code>Contoso.ICounterGrain</code> has the alias <code>counter</code>, correct this entry:</p>","zh":"<p>例如，如果已部署接口 <code>Contoso.ICounterGrain</code> 的别名为 <code>counter</code> ，将以下条目：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-7","type":"code","en":"<pre data-language=\"text\"><code class=\"language-text\"><span style=\"--0:#d4d4d4;--1:#000000\">interface [GrainInterfaceType(\"Contoso.ICounterGrain\")] Contoso.ICounterGrain [Version(2)]</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#d4d4d4;--1:#000000\">  </span></span><span style=\"--0:#d4d4d4;--1:#000000\">ping: Ping() -&gt; Task</span></code></pre>","zh":"<pre data-language=\"text\"><code class=\"language-text\"><span style=\"--0:#d4d4d4;--1:#000000\">interface [GrainInterfaceType(\"Contoso.ICounterGrain\")] Contoso.ICounterGrain [Version(2)]</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#d4d4d4;--1:#000000\">  </span></span><span style=\"--0:#d4d4d4;--1:#000000\">ping: Ping() -&gt; Task</span></code></pre>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>to:</p>","zh":"<p>修正为：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-9","type":"code","en":"<pre data-language=\"text\"><code class=\"language-text\"><span style=\"--0:#d4d4d4;--1:#000000\">interface [GrainInterfaceType(\"counter\")] Contoso.ICounterGrain [Version(2)]</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#d4d4d4;--1:#000000\">  </span></span><span style=\"--0:#d4d4d4;--1:#000000\">ping: Ping() -&gt; Task</span></code></pre>","zh":"<pre data-language=\"text\"><code class=\"language-text\"><span style=\"--0:#d4d4d4;--1:#000000\">interface [GrainInterfaceType(\"counter\")] Contoso.ICounterGrain [Version(2)]</span>\n<span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#d4d4d4;--1:#000000\">  </span></span><span style=\"--0:#d4d4d4;--1:#000000\">ping: Ping() -&gt; Task</span></code></pre>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>This changes the recorded baseline to match the deployed wire identity. The runtime attributes and persisted data stay unchanged.</p>","zh":"<p>这会改变记录的基线，使其与已部署的通信身份匹配。运行时特性和持久化数据保持不变。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Regenerating an uncorrected 10.4.0 baseline emits an active alias-based entry and retains the old CLR-based entry as <code>*RETIRED*</code>. This preserves the recorded history conservatively. Review those pairs against the deployed source to distinguish baseline corrections from actual identity replacements. A current alias alone cannot establish which alias an earlier deployment used.</p>","zh":"<p>对未经修正的 10.4.0 基线重新生成，会产生基于别名的活动条目，并将旧的基于 CLR 的条目保留为 <code>*RETIRED*</code> 。这以保守方式保留已记录历史。应结合已部署源码审查这些成对条目，区分基线修正与真正的身份替换。仅凭当前别名，无法确定较早部署使用过哪个别名。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For legacy declarations which contain only a CLR name, regenerate while the original source types are available. The analyzer can then resolve nested types and record their identities in retired declarations. Recover the deployed source when a retired declaration’s original nesting or alias history needs to be established.</p>","zh":"<p>对于仅包含 CLR 名称的旧版声明，应在原始源码类型仍可用时重新生成。这样，分析器便可解析嵌套类型，并在退役声明中记录其身份。如果需要确定退役声明的原始嵌套结构或别名历史，应恢复已部署源码。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-13","type":"heading","anchor":"migrate-aliases-rejected-by-identity-validation","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"migrate-aliases-rejected-by-identity-validation\">Migrate aliases rejected by identity validation</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"migrate-aliases-rejected-by-identity-validation\">迁移被身份验证拒绝的别名</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/diagnostics/orleans0028/\"><code>ORLEANS0028</code></a> validates <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.aliasattribute/\">AliasAttribute</a>, <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.graintypeattribute/\">GrainTypeAttribute</a>, and <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.graininterfacetypeattribute/\">GrainInterfaceTypeAttribute</a> declarations. The same rules apply when constructing these attributes and registering configured type aliases:</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/diagnostics/orleans0028/\"> <code>ORLEANS0028</code> </a> 验证 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.serialization.abstractions/orleans.aliasattribute/\">AliasAttribute</a> 、 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.graintypeattribute/\">GrainTypeAttribute</a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.graininterfacetypeattribute/\">GrainInterfaceTypeAttribute</a> 声明。构造这些特性和注册配置的类型别名时，也应用相同规则：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-15","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>Use a non-empty value containing no quotes, whitespace, control characters, or reserved type-name delimiters (<code>[](),*&amp;</code>).</li>\n<li>Write generic arity as a backtick followed by ASCII decimal digits at the end of each nested type name, with a combined arity of at most 64. For example, <code>Contoso.Outer`1+Inner`2</code> has a combined arity of three.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>使用非空值，不得包含引号、空白、控制字符或保留的类型名称分隔符（ <code>[](),*&amp;</code> ）。</li>\n<li>在每个嵌套类型名称末尾，以反引号后接 ASCII 十进制数字的形式书写泛型参数个数，总泛型参数个数至多为 64。例如， <code>Contoso.Outer`1+Inner`2</code> 的总泛型参数个数为 3。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For an application with an affected persisted alias, complete its data migration using a compatible Orleans version before adopting the validation change:</p>","zh":"<p>对于存在受影响持久化别名的应用，应在采用此验证变更之前，使用兼容的 Orleans 版本完成数据迁移：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-17","type":"list","en":"<ol>\n<li>Inventory source identities and configured aliases, including names used by stored grain state, stream payloads, and persisted grain references. Back up the affected data.</li>\n<li>Choose valid replacement identities. Use an application-specific migration running on the earlier Orleans version to read the old payloads and rewrite them with the replacement identities. Preserve field IDs and application state, and account for grain keys, references, and storage addressing when changing a grain type.</li>\n<li>Verify that the upgraded application reads every migrated payload and can construct its serializer and runtime services. Establish a rollback build which can read the rewritten data.</li>\n<li>Coordinate the deployment and traffic cutover for changed RPC or grain identities using the <a href=\"#/docs/migration/deployment-and-rollback/\">deployment and rollback guidance</a>.</li>\n</ol>","zh":"<ol>\n<li>清点源码身份和配置的别名，包括存储的 Grain 状态、流负载和持久化 Grain 引用使用的名称。备份受影响的数据。</li>\n<li>选择有效的替代身份。在较早 Orleans 版本上运行应用特定的迁移，读取旧负载，并使用替代身份重写它们。保留字段 ID 和应用状态；更改 Grain 类型时，还应考虑 Grain 键、引用和存储寻址。</li>\n<li>验证升级后的应用能够读取每个已迁移负载，并能够构造其序列化器和运行时服务。建立能够读取重写后数据的回滚构建版本。</li>\n<li>对于改变的 RPC 身份或 Grain 身份，按照 <a href=\"#/docs/migration/deployment-and-rollback/\"> 部署与回滚指导 </a> 协调部署和流量切换。</li>\n</ol>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5c86716f5ab2cdc4-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Renaming a source attribute changes future identities; rewriting existing payloads establishes their compatibility with the new identity. Registering a rejected name in <code>WellKnownTypeAliases</code> also triggers runtime validation, so finish the old-format reads with the earlier runtime.</p>","zh":"<p>重命名源码特性会改变未来的身份；重写现有负载，才会使其与新身份兼容。在 <code>WellKnownTypeAliases</code> 中注册被拒绝的名称，也会触发运行时验证，因此，应使用较早的运行时完成旧格式读取。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"5cb8af6ded48e91e":{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e","title":"Upgrade deployment and rollback","titleZh":"升级部署与回滚","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/migration/deployment-and-rollback/","sourceHash":"72be921a06ab5b48918e14dd7691953530d3166f98aac65c9bb555516e43cd68","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Upgrade deployment and rollback</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">升级部署与回滚</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-1","type":"heading","anchor":"compatibility-boundary","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"compatibility-boundary\">Compatibility boundary</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"compatibility-boundary\">兼容性边界</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans 7 and later use a version-tolerant serializer, and Orleans grain versioning supports compatible application contract versions. However, the documented runtime guarantee for mixed Orleans versions is limited to one major-version family, such as Orleans 9.x patch and minor versions.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 7 及更高版本使用版本容错序列化器，Orleans Grain 版本控制支持兼容的应用协定版本。不过，文档中关于混合 Orleans 版本的运行时保证，仅限于同一主版本系列，例如 Orleans 9.x 的补丁版本和次版本。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For a major-version upgrade, use a parallel or blue-green cluster by default. Treat a mixed-major rolling upgrade as unsupported until the exact runtime versions, providers, application contracts, and traffic patterns have passed your own qualification suite.</p>","zh":"<p>跨主版本升级时，默认使用并行集群或蓝绿集群。在确切的运行时版本、提供程序、应用协定和流量模式通过你自己的验证套件之前，应将混合主版本的滚动升级视为不受支持。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-4","type":"heading","anchor":"rolling-upgrade-prerequisites","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"rolling-upgrade-prerequisites\">Rolling-upgrade prerequisites</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"rolling-upgrade-prerequisites\">滚动升级前提条件</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Before any rolling deployment, including an internally qualified cross-major deployment:</p>","zh":"<p>任何滚动部署之前，包括内部已验证的跨主版本部署，都应满足以下要求：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-6","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>All silos must use the same clustering provider, cluster identity, provider configuration, and network protocol configuration.</li>\n<li>Old and new binaries must share compatible grain interface method signatures. Add methods instead of changing or removing existing methods during the rollout.</li>\n<li>Serialized types must retain member IDs, aliases, and shapes that both versions can read.</li>\n<li>Provider schemas and stored payloads must be readable by both versions for the entire rollback window.</li>\n<li>Stream providers, queue partition counts, reminder providers, grain directories, and placement policies must support the mixed topology.</li>\n<li>Stateless workers and streaming agents must be considered separately because grain version selection doesn’t isolate them.</li>\n<li>The deployment must have automated health gates, traffic draining, state backups, and a tested abort procedure.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>所有 Silo 必须使用相同的集群提供程序、集群身份、提供程序配置和网络协议配置。</li>\n<li>新旧二进制文件必须共享兼容的 Grain 接口方法签名。逐步部署期间应添加方法，而不是更改或移除现有方法。</li>\n<li>序列化类型必须保留两个版本都能读取的成员 ID、别名和类型结构。</li>\n<li>整个回滚窗口内，两个版本都必须能够读取提供程序架构和存储负载。</li>\n<li>流提供程序、队列分区数量、提醒器提供程序、Grain 目录和放置策略必须支持混合拓扑。</li>\n<li>必须单独考虑无状态工作实例和流代理，因为 Grain 版本选择不会隔离它们。</li>\n<li>部署必须具备自动健康门禁、流量排空、状态备份，以及经过测试的中止流程。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Use the compatibility and selector strategies described in <a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-versioning/deploying-new-versions-of-grains/\">Deploy new versions of grains</a> for application contract changes. Those strategies don’t establish runtime-major compatibility.</p>","zh":"<p>应用协定变更应使用 <a href=\"#/docs/grains/grain-versioning/deploying-new-versions-of-grains/\"> 部署新的 Grain 版本 </a> 中介绍的兼容性策略和选择器策略。这些策略不会建立运行时主版本之间的兼容性。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-8","type":"heading","anchor":"recommended-parallel-cluster-sequence","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"recommended-parallel-cluster-sequence\">Recommended parallel-cluster sequence</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"recommended-parallel-cluster-sequence\">推荐的并行集群顺序</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-9","type":"list","en":"<ol>\n<li>Build the target version from the same application contract revision used to validate old-state reads.</li>\n<li>Create a new cluster with separate membership and gateway discovery from the production cluster.</li>\n<li>Point it at cloned provider data or a staging data set and validate clustering, storage, reminders, streams, timers, filters, cancellation, and placement.</li>\n<li>Start production with no write traffic and complete smoke tests.</li>\n<li>Shift a small, observable portion of traffic.</li>\n<li>Increase traffic only after latency, failure, activation, storage, reminder, stream, and cancellation metrics are stable.</li>\n<li>Stop writes to the old cluster before any shared-state cutover that could allow concurrent activation or conflicting writes.</li>\n<li>Keep the old deployment and recovery point until the rollback window expires.</li>\n</ol>","zh":"<ol>\n<li>使用与验证旧状态读取时相同的应用协定修订，构建目标版本。</li>\n<li>创建新集群，使其成员管理和网关发现独立于生产集群。</li>\n<li>将其连接到克隆的提供程序数据或预生产数据集，验证集群、存储、提醒器、流、计时器、筛选器、取消和放置。</li>\n<li>在没有写入流量的情况下启动生产部署，并完成冒烟测试。</li>\n<li>转移一小部分可观察的流量。</li>\n<li>只有延迟、失败、激活、存储、提醒器、流和取消指标稳定后，才增加流量。</li>\n<li>在进行任何可能允许并发激活或冲突写入的共享状态切换之前，停止对旧集群的写入。</li>\n<li>保留旧部署和恢复点，直到回滚窗口结束。</li>\n</ol>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Don’t run two independent clusters against the same grain storage or reminder tables unless the provider and application have been designed for that topology.</p>","zh":"<p>除非提供程序和应用专门为该拓扑设计，否则不要让两个独立集群访问相同的 Grain 存储或提醒器表。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-11","type":"heading","anchor":"rollback-prerequisites","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"rollback-prerequisites\">Rollback prerequisites</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"rollback-prerequisites\">回滚前提条件</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>A rollback is safe only when all of the following are true:</p>","zh":"<p>只有以下条件全部成立时，回滚才是安全的：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-13","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>The previous runtime can read every payload and provider row written by the target runtime.</li>\n<li>Database changes are backward compatible or a tested database restore is available.</li>\n<li>No new grain interface method, serialized type, stream payload, or reminder state is required by queued work.</li>\n<li>The previous package set, configuration, secrets, and deployment image remain available.</li>\n<li>Traffic can be drained without allowing both clusters to own the same logical activations.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>原运行时能够读取目标运行时写入的每个负载和提供程序行。</li>\n<li>数据库变更向后兼容，或存在经过测试的数据库还原方案。</li>\n<li>排队工作不需要任何新的 Grain 接口方法、序列化类型、流负载或提醒器状态。</li>\n<li>原有包集合、配置、机密和部署镜像仍然可用。</li>\n<li>可以排空流量，而不会让两个集群同时拥有相同的逻辑激活实例。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>If any condition isn’t met, rollback means restoring the full pre-upgrade recovery point, not only redeploying old binaries.</p>","zh":"<p>如果任一条件不满足，回滚就意味着还原完整的升级前恢复点，而不只是重新部署旧二进制文件。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-15","type":"heading","anchor":"rollback-sequence","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"rollback-sequence\">Rollback sequence</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"rollback-sequence\">回滚顺序</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-16","type":"list","en":"<ol>\n<li>Stop new traffic and writes to the target cluster.</li>\n<li>Drain or account for in-flight calls and queued messages.</li>\n<li>Restore provider data if the previous version can’t read target-version writes.</li>\n<li>Start the previous cluster in isolation.</li>\n<li>Validate membership, reminders, streams, representative state, and client calls.</li>\n<li>Restore traffic gradually and retain target-cluster diagnostics for investigation.</li>\n</ol>","zh":"<ol>\n<li>停止目标集群的新流量和写入。</li>\n<li>排空正在进行的调用和排队消息，或逐一确认其处理情况。</li>\n<li>如果原版本无法读取目标版本写入的数据，还原提供程序数据。</li>\n<li>在隔离状态下启动原集群。</li>\n<li>验证成员管理、提醒器、流、具有代表性的状态，以及客户端调用。</li>\n<li>逐步恢复流量，并保留目标集群诊断信息供调查。</li>\n</ol>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-17","type":"heading","anchor":"deployment-checklist","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"deployment-checklist\">Deployment checklist</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"deployment-checklist\">部署检查清单</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"5cb8af6ded48e91e-18","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Identify whether the change stays within one Orleans major family.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Verify grain interface and serializer compatibility in both directions.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Verify provider schema and payload compatibility in both directions.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Back up clustering, reminders, streams, and grain state where applicable.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Test old-state reads and rollback reads.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Rehearse traffic draining, cutover, and rollback.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Prevent two independent clusters from concurrently owning the same logical work.</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Define objective health gates and a rollback deadline.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  确定变更是否仍处于同一 Orleans 主版本系列内。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  验证 Grain 接口和序列化器的双向兼容性。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  验证提供程序架构和负载的双向兼容性。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  在适用情况下，备份集群、提醒器、流和 Grain 状态。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  测试旧状态读取和回滚读取。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  演练流量排空、切换和回滚。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  防止两个独立集群并发拥有相同的逻辑工作。</li>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\">  定义客观的健康门禁和回滚截止时间。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"}]},"cf1d73de2674df54":{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54","title":"Grain directory migration","titleZh":"Grain 目录迁移","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/migration/grain-directory/","sourceHash":"6d6c1f53a96d7ce4f6e6f437a3ee655d9e5d88fbacc1cca30e24de29479f99c4","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Grain directory migration</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Grain 目录迁移</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans 11.0.0-preview.1 uses the distributed grain directory by default. For an Orleans 10 cluster using <code>LegacyGrainDirectory</code>, separate the runtime upgrade from the directory migration: first upgrade every runtime while retaining the legacy directory, then migrate the directory in a second rollout.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 11.0.0-preview.1 默认使用分布式 Grain 目录。对于使用 <code>LegacyGrainDirectory</code> 的 Orleans 10 集群，应将运行时升级与目录迁移分开：先在保留旧版目录的情况下升级所有运行时，再通过第二轮逐步部署迁移目录。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For clusters already using the distributed directory, follow <a href=\"#/docs/migration/grain-directory/::upgrade-existing-distributed-directory-clusters\">Upgrade existing distributed-directory clusters</a> to retain their partition configuration.</p>","zh":"<p>对于已经使用分布式目录的集群，应遵循 <a href=\"#/docs/migration/grain-directory/::upgrade-existing-distributed-directory-clusters\"> 升级现有分布式目录集群 </a> ，保留其分区配置。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Qualify the exact runtime and application versions using the <a href=\"#/docs/migration/deployment-and-rollback/::compatibility-boundary\">deployment compatibility guidance</a> before choosing a rolling runtime upgrade.</p>","zh":"<p>选择滚动运行时升级之前，应根据 <a href=\"#/docs/migration/deployment-and-rollback/::compatibility-boundary\"> 部署兼容性指导 </a> 验证确切的运行时版本和应用版本。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-4","type":"heading","anchor":"prepare-and-defer-migration","level":2,"en":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"local-to-distributed-directory-upgrade\"></span><span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"legacy-to-distributed-directory-upgrade\"></span><h2 id=\"prepare-and-defer-migration\">Prepare and defer migration</h2>","zh":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"local-to-distributed-directory-upgrade\"></span><span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"legacy-to-distributed-directory-upgrade\"></span><h2 id=\"prepare-and-defer-migration\">准备并推迟迁移</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-5","type":"list","en":"<ol>\n<li>Inventory the default and named directories selected by every grain type. Keep named-provider selections and cluster identity unchanged during this procedure.</li>\n<li>Qualify serialized contracts, persistence providers, and deployment configuration under representative traffic. Verify successful calls during rollout, graceful silo departure, and duplicate resolution and directory integrity after completion.</li>\n<li>Persist state needed after reactivation and budget capacity for activation recovery. During the mixed-directory phase, temporary duplicate activations can run concurrently. Use persistence concurrency controls and idempotent external operations to tolerate concurrent activations and retries.</li>\n<li>Roll out the new runtime with <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.corehostingextensions/methods/\">UseLegacyGrainDirectory</a> configured on <strong>every replacement silo</strong>. This retains the legacy directory while the runtime versions coexist. Keep that configuration on scale-out instances too.</li>\n<li>Wait until every silo runs the new runtime, membership is stable, and grain-call and activation behavior match the baseline. Applications can remain in this all-legacy configuration until ready for the directory migration.</li>\n</ol>","zh":"<ol>\n<li>清点每个 Grain 类型选择的默认目录和命名目录。在此过程中，保持命名提供程序选择和集群身份不变。</li>\n<li>在具有代表性的流量下验证序列化协定、持久化提供程序和部署配置。确认逐步部署期间调用成功、Silo 能够优雅离开，以及完成后重复实例能够消解、目录保持完整。</li>\n<li>持久化重新激活后需要的状态，并为激活恢复预留容量。混合目录阶段可能出现临时的重复激活实例并发运行。使用持久化并发控制和幂等的外部操作，容忍并发激活实例和重试。</li>\n<li>逐步部署新运行时，并在 <strong> 每个替代 Silo </strong> 上配置 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.corehostingextensions/methods/\">UseLegacyGrainDirectory</a> 。这样，在不同运行时版本共存期间仍保留旧版目录。横向扩容的实例也应保留此配置。</li>\n<li>等待所有 Silo 都运行新运行时、成员状态稳定，并且 Grain 调用和激活行为与基线一致。应用可以保持这种全部使用旧版目录的配置，直到准备好迁移目录。</li>\n</ol>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><code>UseLegacyGrainDirectory</code> defers migration. Choose it before the directory migration starts. Use its API reference for the configuration surface; the released package used by the hosting snippets predates this API.</p>","zh":"<p><code>UseLegacyGrainDirectory</code> 用于推迟迁移。应在目录迁移开始之前选择它。配置接口参见其 API 参考；宿主代码片段使用的已发行包早于此 API。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-7","type":"heading","anchor":"migrate-the-directory","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"migrate-the-directory\">Migrate the directory</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"migrate-the-directory\">迁移目录</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-8","type":"list","en":"<ol>\n<li>For this legacy-to-distributed rollout, keep <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions/properties/\">PartitionsPerSilo</a> at <code>1</code> and retain the default <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions/properties/\">GetPartitionBoundaries</a> function.</li>\n<li>Remove <code>UseLegacyGrainDirectory</code> from the deployment configuration. The runtime default selects the distributed directory; an explicit call to <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.corehostingextensions/methods/\">AddDistributedGrainDirectory</a> also selects it.</li>\n<li>Replace a bounded number of silos at a time, preserving the tested ready-silo and surge-capacity floor. Gracefully stop each departing silo, and allow membership and directory ownership transfers to complete before the next replacement.</li>\n<li>During each mixed-directory stage, exercise existing grains and newly activated grains and monitor call failures and activation churn. Temporary duplicate activations are accepted during this phase.</li>\n<li>Continue until every silo uses the distributed directory, then allow membership, range recovery, and duplicate resolution to converge. Verify one registered activation per single-activation grain and matching registrations for active grains. Keep the distributed selection and partition configuration on later deployments and scale-out instances.</li>\n</ol>","zh":"<ol>\n<li>在本次从旧版目录迁移到分布式目录的逐步部署中，将 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions/properties/\">PartitionsPerSilo</a> 保持为 <code>1</code> ，并保留默认的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions/properties/\">GetPartitionBoundaries</a> 函数。</li>\n<li>从部署配置中移除 <code>UseLegacyGrainDirectory</code> 。运行时默认选择分布式目录；显式调用 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.hosting.corehostingextensions/methods/\">AddDistributedGrainDirectory</a> 也会选择它。</li>\n<li>每次替换有限数量的 Silo，保持经过测试的就绪 Silo 数量下限和额外容量下限。优雅停止每个离开的 Silo，并在下一次替换之前，让成员和目录所有权转移完成。</li>\n<li>在每个混合目录阶段，测试现有 Grain 和新激活的 Grain，并监测调用失败和激活实例频繁变动。此阶段允许临时的重复激活实例。</li>\n<li>继续执行，直到每个 Silo 都使用分布式目录，然后等待成员信息、范围恢复和重复实例消解收敛。验证每个单激活实例 Grain 只有一个已注册激活实例，且活动 Grain 的注册信息匹配。后续部署和横向扩容实例中，继续保留分布式目录选择和分区配置。</li>\n</ol>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Compatibility system targets bridge the two directory protocols during this transition. A distributed-default silo serves remote requests from legacy-directory silos through its distributed directory. Legacy-directory silos expose endpoints for distributed partition requests and activation recovery. Keep named-provider selections consistent throughout both rollouts.</p>","zh":"<p>转换期间，兼容性系统目标在两种目录协议之间进行桥接。默认使用分布式目录的 Silo，通过其分布式目录处理来自旧版目录 Silo 的远程请求。旧版目录 Silo 则公开用于分布式分区请求和激活恢复的终结点。两轮逐步部署全过程中，都应保持命名提供程序选择一致。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For workloads which require exclusive activation ownership throughout the cutover, use a coordinated full-cluster restart instead of a rolling directory migration: gracefully stop every silo, then start the distributed-default deployment.</p>","zh":"<p>对于要求整个切换期间激活所有权始终排他的工作负载，应采用协调的全群重启，而不是滚动目录迁移：优雅停止每个 Silo，再启动默认使用分布式目录的部署。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-11","type":"heading","anchor":"watch-the-migration","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"watch-the-migration\">Watch the migration</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"watch-the-migration\">观察迁移</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Compare grain-call error rate and latency, activation churn and failures, duplicate-activation reports, membership churn, and directory registration errors with the pre-upgrade baseline. Observe directory snapshot transfers, range recovery, and range-lock duration alongside silo departures.</p>","zh":"<p>将 Grain 调用错误率和延迟、激活实例变动和失败、重复激活报告、成员变动，以及目录注册错误与升级前基线进行比较。结合 Silo 离开过程，观察目录快照转移、范围恢复和范围锁持续时间。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-13","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Temporary mixed-phase duplicates should resolve once the upgrade completes. The final healthy checkpoint has an all-distributed cluster, a stable membership view, completed recovery, successful calls to existing and new grains, and one registered activation per single-activation grain.</p>","zh":"<p>混合阶段的临时重复实例应在升级完成后消解。最终健康检查点应具有以下状态：整个集群都使用分布式目录、成员视图稳定、恢复完成、对现有和新 Grain 的调用成功，并且每个单激活实例 Grain 只有一个已注册激活实例。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Pause replacements when an application safety or availability threshold is exceeded. Preserve directory and membership logs and retain sufficient distributed-directory capacity. Investigate duplicate activations or registration mismatches which persist after the all-distributed cluster has converged.</p>","zh":"<p>超出应用安全性或可用性阈值时，暂停替换。保留目录和成员管理日志，并维持足够的分布式目录容量。对于全分布式目录集群收敛后仍然存在的重复激活实例或注册不匹配，应进行调查。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-15","type":"heading","anchor":"recovery-and-one-way-migration","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"recovery-and-one-way-migration\">Recovery and one-way migration</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"recovery-and-one-way-migration\">恢复与单向迁移</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Once the cluster begins using the distributed default, continue toward an all-distributed cluster. Returning that cluster to the legacy directory is unsupported. Decide the recovery procedure and qualify the deployment before introducing the first distributed-default silo.</p>","zh":"<p>集群一旦开始使用默认分布式目录，就应继续推进到全部使用分布式目录。不支持将该集群退回旧版目录。在引入第一个默认使用分布式目录的 Silo 之前，确定恢复流程并验证部署。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Recover application state using the qualified recovery procedure while retaining the distributed directory and its partition configuration. Include compatible application images, storage changes, and recovery points in that plan.</p>","zh":"<p>在保留分布式目录及其分区配置的同时，使用经过验证的恢复流程恢复应用状态。将兼容的应用镜像、存储变更和恢复点纳入该计划。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-18","type":"heading","anchor":"upgrade-existing-distributed-directory-clusters","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"upgrade-existing-distributed-directory-clusters\">Upgrade existing distributed-directory clusters</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"upgrade-existing-distributed-directory-clusters\">升级现有分布式目录集群</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-19","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Rolling runtime upgrades of an existing distributed-directory cluster preserve both the partition count and the mapping from hash boundaries to partition numbers. Directory requests and ownership-transfer snapshots address those numbered partitions, so all silos must agree on their ranges.</p>","zh":"<p>对现有分布式目录集群进行滚动运行时升级时，必须同时保留分区数量，以及从哈希边界到分区编号的映射。目录请求和所有权转移快照按这些编号寻址分区，因此所有 Silo 必须对其范围达成一致。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-20","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans 10.1 used 30 partitions per silo and assigned partition numbers after sorting each silo’s uniform hashes by unsigned value. Orleans 10.2 changed the default count to one and assigned multiple partitions in hash-generation order.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 10.1 每个 Silo 使用 30 个分区，并在按无符号值对各 Silo 的均匀哈希排序后分配分区编号。Orleans 10.2 将默认数量改为 1，并按哈希生成顺序分配多个分区。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-21","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>When upgrading a distributed-directory cluster running Orleans 10.1, configure newer silos with <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions/properties/\">PartitionsPerSilo</a> set to <code>30</code> and an application-defined <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions/properties/\">GetPartitionBoundaries</a> delegate which returns each silo’s uniform hashes in sorted order:</p>","zh":"<p>升级运行 Orleans 10.1 的分布式目录集群时，为较新的 Silo 将 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions/properties/\">PartitionsPerSilo</a> 设为 <code>30</code> ，并配置应用定义的 <a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graindirectoryoptions/properties/\">GetPartitionBoundaries</a> 委托，按排序后的顺序返回每个 Silo 的均匀哈希：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-22","type":"code","en":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">Configure</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">GrainDirectoryOptions</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&gt;(</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> =&gt;</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">PartitionsPerSilo</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">30</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">GetPartitionBoundaries</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> (</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">silo</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">partitionCount</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">) =&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">silo</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">GetUniformHashCodes</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">partitionCount</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">).</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">Sort</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">();</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">});</span></code></pre>","zh":"<pre data-language=\"csharp\"><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">siloBuilder</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">Configure</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--0:#4EC9B0;--1:#227188\">GrainDirectoryOptions</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">&gt;(</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> =&gt;</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">{</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">PartitionsPerSilo</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#B5CEA8;--1:#08774E\">30</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">options</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">GetPartitionBoundaries</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> = </span><span style=\"--0:#569CD6;--1:#0000FF\">static</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\"> (</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">silo</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">partitionCount</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">) =&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">silo</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">GetUniformHashCodes</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#9CDCFE;--1:#001080\">partitionCount</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">).</span><span style=\"--0:#DCDCAA;--1:#795E26\">Sort</span><span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">();</span>\n<span style=\"--0:#D4D4D4;--1:#000000\">});</span></code></pre>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-23","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Sorting the immutable hash array preserves the silo’s cached hash order and produces the existing partition identities. Retain this configuration after the upgrade and in every compatible distributed-directory recovery deployment.</p>","zh":"<p>对不可变哈希数组进行排序，会保留 Silo 缓存中的哈希顺序，并生成已有的分区身份。升级后，以及每次兼容的分布式目录恢复部署中，都应保留此配置。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-24","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Clusters already using the Orleans 10.2-and-later generated-order mapping retain the default boundary function and their existing partition count. Qualify runtime upgrades and compatible application recovery under sustained traffic, checking directory registration preservation and activation uniqueness. Changing an established cluster’s partition count or boundary mapping requires a coordinated full-cluster restart or a blue-green cutover with controlled grain-state ownership.</p>","zh":"<p>已经使用 Orleans 10.2 及更高版本按生成顺序映射的集群，应保留默认边界函数和已有分区数量。在持续流量下验证运行时升级和兼容的应用恢复，检查目录注册是否保留，以及激活实例是否唯一。更改既有集群的分区数量或边界映射，需要协调的全群重启，或在 Grain 状态所有权受控的情况下进行蓝绿切换。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-25","type":"heading","anchor":"rebuild-uniform-hash-callers","level":2,"en":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"uniform-silo-hash-api-compatibility\"></span><h2 id=\"rebuild-uniform-hash-callers\">Rebuild uniform-hash callers</h2>","zh":"<span class=\"source-anchor-alias\" id=\"uniform-silo-hash-api-compatibility\"></span><h2 id=\"rebuild-uniform-hash-callers\">重新构建均匀哈希调用方</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-26","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.siloaddress/methods/\">GetUniformHashCodes</a> returns an <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.collections.immutable.immutablearray-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ImmutableArray&lt;T&gt;</a> which shares the silo’s cached hash storage. Rebuild callers compiled against the <code>uint[]</code> return type. Use <code>ToArray()</code> when a mutable buffer is needed, or <code>Sort()</code> to obtain a sorted immutable result while preserving the cached values.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.runtime.siloaddress/methods/\">GetUniformHashCodes</a> 返回一个 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.collections.immutable.immutablearray-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> ImmutableArray&lt;T&gt; </a> ，与 Silo 缓存的哈希共享存储。重新构建基于 <code>uint[]</code> 返回类型编译的调用方。需要可变缓冲区时，使用 <code>ToArray()</code> ；需要在保留缓存值的同时获得排序后的不可变结果时，使用 <code>Sort()</code> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"cf1d73de2674df54-27","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For the directory’s current configuration and architecture, see <a href=\"#/docs/host/grain-directory/\">Grain directories</a> and <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/grain-directory/\">Grain directory architecture</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>目录当前的配置和架构参见 <a href=\"#/docs/host/grain-directory/\"> Grain 目录 </a> 和 <a href=\"#/docs/implementation/grain-directory/\"> Grain 目录架构 </a> 。</p>","status":"reviewed"}]},"382b25bad3cd2b5e":{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e","title":"Microsoft Orleans","titleZh":"Microsoft Orleans","sourceUrl":"https://dotnet.github.io/orleans/docs/overview/","sourceHash":"5add98cb8ac77f9c417b78b308b54b0f23c3876fe5e7fb8b8e76ac10658c63af","status":"reviewed","blocks":[{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-0","type":"heading","anchor":"_top","level":1,"en":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Microsoft Orleans</h1>","zh":"<h1 id=\"_top\">Microsoft Orleans</h1>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans is a cross-platform framework for building distributed applications with .NET. It extends familiar C# concepts across a cluster so that application code can address stateful entities by identity without tracking which server currently hosts them.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 是使用 .NET 构建分布式应用的跨平台框架。它将熟悉的 C# 概念扩展到整个集群，使应用代码能够通过标识来寻址有状态实体，而无需跟踪当前由哪台服务器承载它们。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans libraries target <code>net10.0</code> and <code>net11.0</code>.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 库的目标框架为 <code>net10.0</code> 和 <code>net11.0</code>。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-3","type":"quote","en":"<aside class=\"starlight-aside starlight-aside--note\"><p class=\"starlight-aside__title\"><svg class=\"starlight-aside__icon\"><path></path></svg>Note</p><p>To upgrade an existing application, see the <a href=\"#/docs/migration-guide/\">Orleans migration guide</a>. Version-specific upgrade history is kept in that guide rather than repeated in ordinary documentation.</p></aside>","zh":"<aside class=\"starlight-aside starlight-aside--note\"><p class=\"starlight-aside__title\"><svg class=\"starlight-aside__icon\"><path></path></svg> 注意</p><p>如需升级现有应用，请参阅 <a href=\"#/docs/migration-guide/\"> Orleans 迁移指南 </a>。特定版本的升级历史保留在该指南中，不会在普通文档中重复列出。</p></aside>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-4","type":"heading","anchor":"the-virtual-actor-model","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"the-virtual-actor-model\">The virtual actor model</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"the-virtual-actor-model\">虚拟 Actor 模型</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans implements the virtual actor model. A virtual actor in Orleans is called a <em>grain</em>. Each grain has:</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 实现了虚拟 Actor 模型。在 Orleans 中，虚拟 Actor 称为 <em> Grain </em>。每个 Grain 都具备：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-6","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li>A stable, application-defined identity.</li>\n<li>Behavior implemented by a .NET class.</li>\n<li>Isolated, mutable in-memory state, with optional durable state stored by a configured provider.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li>由应用定义的稳定标识。</li>\n<li>由 .NET 类实现的行为。</li>\n<li>相互隔离的可变内存状态，以及可选的、通过已配置的提供程序存储的持久状态。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Grain references are logical addresses. Callers don’t create grain objects directly or locate them on a server. Instead, they request a reference by interface and key, then invoke asynchronous methods on that reference. Orleans routes each call to an existing activation or activates the grain on demand.</p>","zh":"<p>Grain 引用是逻辑地址。调用方不会直接创建 Grain 对象，也不会到服务器上定位它们。调用方会根据接口和键请求一个引用，然后调用该引用上的异步方法。Orleans 会将每次调用路由到已有的激活实例，或按需激活 Grain。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>This virtual lifecycle separates a grain’s identity from its in-memory activation. Idle activations can be removed from memory, and a later call can activate the grain again. If durable state is configured and written by the grain, a new activation can restore that state.</p>","zh":"<p>这种虚拟生命周期将 Grain 的标识与其内存中的激活实例分离。空闲的激活实例可以从内存中移除，之后的调用又可以重新激活该 Grain。如果配置了持久状态，并且 Grain 已经写入了这些状态，新的激活实例就可以恢复它们。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For the model’s design and history, see the <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/research/project/orleans-virtual-actors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Orleans virtual actors research project</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>有关该模型的设计与历史，请参阅 <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/research/project/orleans-virtual-actors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Orleans 虚拟 Actor 研究项目 </a>。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-10","type":"heading","anchor":"grains","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"grains\">Grains</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"grains\">Grain</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Grains are units of identity, isolation, placement, and execution. A grain class implements one or more grain interfaces, usually identified using one of these marker interfaces:</p>","zh":"<p>Grain 是标识、隔离、放置和执行的基本单元。一个 Grain 类实现一个或多个 Grain 接口，通常使用以下某个标记接口来确定其标识方式：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-12","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.igrainwithguidkey/\">IGrainWithGuidKey</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.igrainwithintegerkey/\">IGrainWithIntegerKey</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.igrainwithstringkey/\">IGrainWithStringKey</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.igrainwithguidcompoundkey/\">IGrainWithGuidCompoundKey</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.igrainwithintegercompoundkey/\">IGrainWithIntegerCompoundKey</a></li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.igrainwithguidkey/\">IGrainWithGuidKey</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.igrainwithintegerkey/\">IGrainWithIntegerKey</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.igrainwithstringkey/\">IGrainWithStringKey</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.igrainwithguidcompoundkey/\">IGrainWithGuidCompoundKey</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.igrainwithintegercompoundkey/\">IGrainWithIntegerCompoundKey</a></li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-13","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>By default, Orleans processes requests to a grain activation one at a time. This turn-based execution model reduces the need for locks inside grain code. Reentrancy and other interleaving options are available when an application needs them, but they require the same care as other concurrent code.</p>","zh":"<p>默认情况下，Orleans 一次只处理发往某个 Grain 激活实例的一个请求。这种基于轮次的执行模型减少了在 Grain 代码内部使用锁的需要。应用有需要时，可以使用重入及其他交错执行选项，但使用这些选项时，必须像编写其他并发代码一样谨慎。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><img src=\"assets/original/_astro/grain-formulation.CtOzAqNu_Z1FvyYE.svg\" alt=\"A grain is composed of a stable identity, behavior, and state.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>","zh":"<p><img src=\"assets/original/_astro/grain-formulation.CtOzAqNu_Z1FvyYE.svg\" alt=\"A grain is composed of a stable identity, behavior, and state.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-15","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans applications commonly model users, devices, accounts, game sessions, orders, or other independently addressable entities as grains. Good grain boundaries come from the application’s domain and workload: avoid both chatty networks of tiny grains and single grains that become throughput bottlenecks.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 应用通常将用户、设备、账户、游戏会话、订单或其他可独立寻址的实体建模为 Grain。合理的 Grain 边界取决于应用的领域和工作负载：既要避免将系统划分成大量频繁相互通信的微小 Grain，也要避免让单个 Grain 成为吞吐量瓶颈。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-16","type":"heading","anchor":"silos-and-clusters","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"silos-and-clusters\">Silos and clusters</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"silos-and-clusters\">Silo 与集群</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>A <em>silo</em> is a process that hosts the Orleans runtime and grain activations. One or more silos form a cluster. Cluster members coordinate membership, route messages, and place activations.</p>","zh":"<p><em> Silo </em> 是承载 Orleans 运行时和 Grain 激活实例的进程。一个或多个 Silo 构成集群。集群成员协同管理成员身份、路由消息并放置激活实例。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<p><img src=\"assets/original/_astro/cluster-silo-grain-relationship.BADVHeJX_OrNGc.svg\" alt=\"A cluster has one or more silos, and each silo hosts grain activations.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>","zh":"<p><img src=\"assets/original/_astro/cluster-silo-grain-relationship.BADVHeJX_OrNGc.svg\" alt=\"A cluster has one or more silos, and each silo hosts grain activations.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-19","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>When a silo fails, calls in progress can fail and callers must handle that outcome. After the cluster detects the failure, subsequent calls can activate affected grains on healthy silos. Durable recovery depends on the application’s storage configuration and on state having been written successfully.</p>","zh":"<p>Silo 发生故障时，正在执行的调用可能失败，调用方必须处理这种结果。集群检测到故障后，后续调用可以在健康的 Silo 上激活受影响的 Grain。持久状态恢复取决于应用的存储配置，以及状态是否已成功写入。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-20","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>External processes can connect using the Orleans client library. ASP.NET Core applications can also host a silo and call grains in the same process, which is the approach used in the beginner quickstart.</p>","zh":"<p>外部进程可以使用 Orleans 客户端库进行连接。ASP.NET Core 应用也可以托管一个 Silo，并在同一个进程中调用 Grain，初学者快速入门采用的就是这种方式。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-21","type":"heading","anchor":"runtime-capabilities","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"runtime-capabilities\">Runtime capabilities</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"runtime-capabilities\">运行时能力</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-22","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans includes APIs and providers for common distributed application needs:</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 提供了满足常见分布式应用需求的 API 和提供程序：</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-23","type":"list","en":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Clustering and placement</strong>: Discover silos and choose where activations run.</li>\n<li><strong>Persistence</strong>: Store explicitly written grain state using Azure Storage, Azure Cosmos DB, ADO.NET, DynamoDB, Redis, or custom providers.</li>\n<li><strong>Timers, reminders, and durable jobs</strong>: Run activation-scoped callbacks, recurring durable callbacks, or scheduled one-time work.</li>\n<li><strong>Streams and broadcast channels</strong>: Deliver events between producers and consumers.</li>\n<li><strong>Transactions</strong>: Coordinate supported persistent state across grains using distributed ACID transactions.</li>\n<li><strong>Versioning</strong>: Run heterogeneous clusters during staged upgrades.</li>\n<li><strong>Observability</strong>: Integrate with .NET logging, metrics, distributed tracing, health checks, and the Orleans Dashboard.</li>\n<li><strong>Serialization</strong>: Generate version-tolerant serializers and integrate with formats such as System.Text.Json, MessagePack, and Protocol Buffers.</li>\n</ul>","zh":"<ul>\n<li><strong> 集群与放置 </strong>：发现 Silo，并决定激活实例的运行位置。</li>\n<li><strong> 持久化 </strong>：通过 Azure Storage、Azure Cosmos DB、ADO.NET、DynamoDB、Redis 或自定义提供程序，存储显式写入的 Grain 状态。</li>\n<li><strong> 计时器、提醒器与持久作业 </strong>：运行作用域限定于激活实例的回调、周期性的持久回调，或计划执行的一次性工作。</li>\n<li><strong> 流与广播通道 </strong>：在生产者与消费者之间传递事件。</li>\n<li><strong> 事务 </strong>：使用分布式 ACID 事务协调多个 Grain 中受支持的持久化状态。</li>\n<li><strong> 版本管理 </strong>：在分阶段升级期间运行混合版本集群。</li>\n<li><strong> 可观测性 </strong>：与 .NET 日志、指标、分布式跟踪、健康检查以及 Orleans Dashboard 集成。</li>\n<li><strong> 序列化 </strong>：生成支持版本容错的序列化器，并与 System.Text.Json、MessagePack 和 Protocol Buffers 等格式集成。</li>\n</ul>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-24","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>These capabilities are composable. An application selects providers and guarantees that fit its environment; Orleans doesn’t automatically replicate application state or make external storage durable.</p>","zh":"<p>这些能力可以组合使用。应用会选择适合其环境的提供程序和保证；Orleans 不会自动复制应用状态，也不会自动使外部存储具备持久性。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-25","type":"heading","anchor":"distributed-acid-transactions","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"distributed-acid-transactions\">Distributed ACID transactions</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"distributed-acid-transactions\">分布式 ACID 事务</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-26","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans transactions coordinate supported persistent state across multiple grains using distributed <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/windows/win32/cossdk/acid-properties\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ACID</a> transactions with serializable isolation. Transactional state uses dedicated APIs and storage configuration; ordinary grain persistence doesn’t become transactional automatically.</p>","zh":"<p>Orleans 事务通过具有可串行化隔离级别的分布式 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/windows/win32/cossdk/acid-properties\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> ACID </a> 事务，协调多个 Grain 中受支持的持久化状态。事务状态使用专用的 API 和存储配置；普通的 Grain 持久化不会自动具备事务性。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-27","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For more information, see <a href=\"#/docs/grains/transactions/\">Transactions</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>有关详细信息，请参阅 <a href=\"#/docs/grains/transactions/\"> 事务 </a>。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-28","type":"heading","anchor":"when-to-use-orleans","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"when-to-use-orleans\">When to use Orleans</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"when-to-use-orleans\">何时使用 Orleans</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-29","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans is a strong fit when an application has many independently addressable entities, benefits from per-entity isolation, and needs to distribute work across processes or machines. Common examples include AI agent sessions, fraud protection and risk, IoT and digital twins, monitoring and resource orchestration, online games, collaboration, commerce, and financial services.</p>","zh":"<p>如果应用包含大量可独立寻址的实体，能够从按实体隔离中获益，并且需要将工作分布到多个进程或机器上，那么 Orleans 非常适合。常见例子包括 AI 智能体会话、欺诈防范与风险管理、物联网与数字孪生、监控与资源编排、在线游戏、协作、商业交易以及金融服务。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-30","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>Orleans can run in a single process during development and scale to a cluster without changing grain interfaces. Production deployments still require deliberate choices for clustering, storage, retries, observability, capacity, and deployment.</p>","zh":"<p>开发期间，Orleans 可以在单个进程中运行，并且能够在不更改 Grain 接口的情况下扩展到集群。生产部署仍然需要审慎选择集群、存储、重试、可观测性、容量以及部署方案。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-31","type":"paragraph","en":"<p>For a decision guide with concrete examples and counterexamples, see <a href=\"#/docs/scenarios/\">Orleans scenarios and use cases</a>.</p>","zh":"<p>包含具体示例和反例的选型指南见 <a href=\"#/docs/scenarios/\"> Orleans 场景与用例 </a>。</p>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-32","type":"heading","anchor":"next-step","level":2,"en":"<h2 id=\"next-step\">Next step</h2>","zh":"<h2 id=\"next-step\">下一步</h2>","status":"reviewed"},{"id":"382b25bad3cd2b5e-33","type":"quote","en":"<aside class=\"starlight-aside starlight-aside--tip\"><p class=\"starlight-aside__title\"><svg class=\"starlight-aside__icon\"><path></path><path></path></svg>Next step</p><p><a href=\"#/docs/tutorials-and-samples/hello-world/\">Orleans Hello World</a></p></aside>","zh":"<aside class=\"starlight-aside starlight-aside--tip\"><p class=\"starlight-aside__title\"><svg class=\"starlight-aside__icon\"><path></path><path></path></svg> 下一步</p><p><a href=\"#/docs/tutorials-and-samples/hello-world/\"> Orleans Hello World </a></p></aside>","status":"reviewed"}],"sourceIssues":["本页把初学者示例描述为 ASP.NET Core 与 Silo 同进程托管，而本次快照的“构建第一个应用”教程使用独立客户端项目。两处译文均保留各自原文，阅读时请以对应教程的实际步骤和代码为准。"]}});
